(2724615, 379928, 56400, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but not the yellow/green lit smoke. I find it distracting since I want to look at your model (nice one too BTW) but my eyes keeps getting pulled to the left.</td>', 'I like the concept but not the yellow/green lit smoke. I find it distracting since I want to look at your model (nice one too BTW) but my eyes keeps getting pulled to the left.', '2006-08-14 05:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
