(2724639, 380057, 56400, '<td valign="top">With ''victems'' like this, I wanna be a fireman too. The term ''good shot'' has several meanings here.</td>', 'With ''victems'' like this, I wanna be a fireman too. The term ''good shot'' has several meanings here.', '2006-08-14 05:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724640, 380037, 61863, '<td valign="top">Bit flat perhaps? A bit of extra lightening in PP (or increased exposure in camera) would have brought out the colours a bit more - (JMO)</td>', 'Bit flat perhaps? A bit of extra lightening in PP (or increased exposure in camera) would have brought out the colours a bit more - (JMO)', '2006-08-14 05:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
