(2724672, 378066, 52130, '<td valign="top">The coloring and lighting is perfect for this...I only wish there was a more definate shape to the flame''s pattern.</td>', 'The coloring and lighting is perfect for this...I only wish there was a more definate shape to the flame''s pattern.', '2006-08-14 06:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
