(2724730, 380018, 63101, '<td valign="top">WOW! that really does look like fire!</td>', 'WOW! that really does look like fire!', '2006-08-14 07:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724743, 379916, 49109, '<td valign="top">hope your camera is OK ;-)  Very nice abstract macro, good crop!</td>', 'hope your camera is OK ;-)  Very nice abstract macro, good crop!', '2006-08-14 07:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724760, 379939, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the flame  balancing the digit.</td>', 'Nice composition with the flame  balancing the digit.', '2006-08-14 07:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724767, 378685, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent, 10 + fav :)</td>', 'Excellent, 10 + fav :)', '2006-08-14 07:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724774, 380059, 58452, '<td valign="top">Maybe with a square composition with the burner more centered in a corner, and the flower more centered with the burner, this would be close to the top for me.  As it is, a very nice image.</td>', 'Maybe with a square composition with the burner more centered in a corner, and the flower more centered with the burner, this would be close to the top for me.  As it is, a very nice image.', '2006-08-14 07:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724780, 379934, 34938, '<td valign="top">no way!!! that''s amazing, this should do well for the novelty factor alone...well done and good luck...<br/> <br/>Having another look, this is amazing, the blue smoke and the title are fantastic...bumping to 10</td>', 'no way!!! that''s amazing, this should do well for the novelty factor alone...well done and good luck... Having another look, this is amazing, the blue smoke and the title are fantastic...bumping to 10', '2006-08-14 07:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724783, 380057, 58452, '<td valign="top">volunteer fireman huh?  It''s a tough job, but somebodies gotta do it.  ;)  After going thru all the rest I bumped it up a notch.  Very nice.</td>', 'volunteer fireman huh?  It''s a tough job, but somebodies gotta do it.  ;)  After going thru all the rest I bumped it up a notch.  Very nice.', '2006-08-14 07:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724788, 379112, 58452, '<td valign="top">Very subtle tones.  I wish the arm could have extended at a 45 with the hand/ball on a third, perhaps the bottom right.  Nice image.</td>', 'Very subtle tones.  I wish the arm could have extended at a 45 with the hand/ball on a third, perhaps the bottom right.  Nice image.', '2006-08-14 07:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724796, 379924, 49109, '<td valign="top">great shot (if there wasn''t the frame). Needs a bit more light on the club, though - 8</td>', 'great shot (if there wasn''t the frame). Needs a bit more light on the club, though - 8', '2006-08-14 07:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724797, 379845, 49109, '<td valign="top">not too much of fire seen here, lights are blown, otherwise nice shot</td>', 'not too much of fire seen here, lights are blown, otherwise nice shot', '2006-08-14 07:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724801, 379871, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the face, hands and blade.  A touch more definition on the right arm would have been nice.  A little more downward angle of the blade to align with the V of the face while giving more vertical space for the diagonal formed to extend from top left to bottom right.  Still a fine image.</td>', 'I like the lighting on the face, hands and blade.  A touch more definition on the right arm would have been nice.  A little more downward angle of the blade to align with the V of the face while giving more vertical space for the diagonal formed to extend from top left to bottom right.  Still a fine image.', '2006-08-14 08:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724807, 379980, 58452, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.    I like the diagonal, shapes and textures with the krypton like colors.  Are these ember with the colors changed?  Nice image.</td>', 'Interesting composition.    I like the diagonal, shapes and textures with the krypton like colors.  Are these ember with the colors changed?  Nice image.', '2006-08-14 08:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724821, 379847, 58452, '<td valign="top">I love the striations of light in the clouds above and beside the God''s rays and how they align with the models inclined head.  If the models right hand were about a foot higher and slightly to our left and left hand six incher higher and six inches to our left, the hands, face, staff, and fire would form a beautiful circle surrounding the glowing rays on the horizon.  Even without, this image has a lot going for it.  I''m bumping it up another point.<br/>Very nice.</td>', 'I love the striations of light in the clouds above and beside the God''s rays and how they align with the models inclined head.  If the models right hand were about a foot higher and slightly to our left and left hand six incher higher and six inches to our left, the hands, face, staff, and fire would form a beautiful circle surrounding the glowing rays on the horizon.  Even without, this image has a lot going for it.  I''m bumping it up another point.Very nice.', '2006-08-14 08:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724827, 379117, 58452, '<td valign="top">Duh!  If the flames and glow could have been green................   hehehehe, a work accident!  After looking twice and adding to the comment I''m bumping this one up a point.  Very nice.</td>', 'Duh!  If the flames and glow could have been green................   hehehehe, a work accident!  After looking twice and adding to the comment I''m bumping this one up a point.  Very nice.', '2006-08-14 08:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724851, 378685, 52945, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, looks like it must have hurt.</td>', 'Nice shot, looks like it must have hurt.', '2006-08-14 08:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724852, 379976, 52945, '<td valign="top">I think that this would be better if the chillies were also on fire, rather than just having the flames behind them.<br/> <br/>The noisy background is rather distracting.</td>', 'I think that this would be better if the chillies were also on fire, rather than just having the flames behind them. The noisy background is rather distracting.', '2006-08-14 08:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724854, 380021, 52945, '<td valign="top">I like how the hair looks like flames, though the highlights on the face are a bit too harsh for my liking.  Good to see something in this challenge that''s not on fire.</td>', 'I like how the hair looks like flames, though the highlights on the face are a bit too harsh for my liking.  Good to see something in this challenge that''s not on fire.', '2006-08-14 08:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724859, 380037, 52945, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see any fire...<br/> <br/>Maybe my monitor isn''t calibrated, but this shot looks far to dark to me. The details in the grill are lost in the shadows. Photo also doesn''t look that sharp to me, and the background isn''t interesting enough to add anything to the shot.</td>', 'I don''t really see any fire... Maybe my monitor isn''t calibrated, but this shot looks far to dark to me. The details in the grill are lost in the shadows. Photo also doesn''t look that sharp to me, and the background isn''t interesting enough to add anything to the shot.', '2006-08-14 08:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724863, 379731, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Great processing. Great title. Gets a GR8 score from me. <br/> <br/>Apologies for the lame comment.</td>', 'Great lighting. Great processing. Great title. Gets a GR8 score from me.  Apologies for the lame comment.', '2006-08-14 08:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724867, 378514, 34938, '<td valign="top">it''s good and you must have put a lot of work into it...I just find the lighting on the arm a little harsh (flash?)</td>', 'it''s good and you must have put a lot of work into it...I just find the lighting on the arm a little harsh (flash?)', '2006-08-14 08:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724868, 379976, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and use of colour. Really Really could have done with some noise removal - probably will cost this shot a lot in the score stakes. 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice composition and use of colour. Really Really could have done with some noise removal - probably will cost this shot a lot in the score stakes. 7 from me.', '2006-08-14 08:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724869, 379762, 34938, '<td valign="top">good, clear close up of ''another'' match...I like this one, particularly the red glow on the match head itself</td>', 'good, clear close up of ''another'' match...I like this one, particularly the red glow on the match head itself', '2006-08-14 08:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724871, 380021, 34938, '<td valign="top">I like the movelent in the hair and the lighting is fantastic...I expected to see more redheads in this challenge, but there are not too many, which I hope gives you an advantage...good luck</td>', 'I like the movelent in the hair and the lighting is fantastic...I expected to see more redheads in this challenge, but there are not too many, which I hope gives you an advantage...good luck', '2006-08-14 08:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724873, 378082, 34938, '<td valign="top">there are many matches shots...this one is creative and I like the title</td>', 'there are many matches shots...this one is creative and I like the title', '2006-08-14 08:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724875, 379764, 34938, '<td valign="top">I actually like this, but you might get hammered because the person is out of focus...I think it''s a nice shot</td>', 'I actually like this, but you might get hammered because the person is out of focus...I think it''s a nice shot', '2006-08-14 08:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724876, 380007, 34938, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field...I don''t get the title, is it Joey''s death anniversary?</td>', 'I like the depth of field...I don''t get the title, is it Joey''s death anniversary?', '2006-08-14 08:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724878, 379670, 34938, '<td valign="top">That looks scary and dangerous! I like the movelent in the flame and the comp</td>', 'That looks scary and dangerous! I like the movelent in the flame and the comp', '2006-08-14 08:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724879, 379847, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well if this guy was about 40 years older this shot would have a more ''authentic'' feel and probably get a ten from me. As it is you''ll have to settle for a 9. Well lit, composed and processed. <br/> <br/>My other nitpick is the use of the basket - would have been more effective if the fire had just been on the ground or alternatively emanating from some rustic silver cauldron or something.</td>', 'Well if this guy was about 40 years older this shot would have a more ''authentic'' feel and probably get a ten from me. As it is you''ll have to settle for a 9. Well lit, composed and processed.  My other nitpick is the use of the basket - would have been more effective if the fire had just been on the ground or alternatively emanating from some rustic silver cauldron or something.', '2006-08-14 08:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724880, 379588, 34938, '<td valign="top">colours are great...the dark marks in the cup are a little distracting, but I am going to bump this one up</td>', 'colours are great...the dark marks in the cup are a little distracting, but I am going to bump this one up', '2006-08-14 08:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
