(2725039, 379760, 57712, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with all the cloud up top. The image could do with a slight rotation as the ground seems tilted. Maybe a slight color adjustment to make it a little more dramatic. Great catch of lightning, tho!</td>', 'I like the composition with all the cloud up top. The image could do with a slight rotation as the ground seems tilted. Maybe a slight color adjustment to make it a little more dramatic. Great catch of lightning, tho!', '2006-08-14 10:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
