(2725067, 379845, 57712, '<td valign="top">Wow that stands out! Love the lighting on the label, and the faint wisp of smoke is great. Excellent clarity too. If I inhale really hard I can even smell it (yuck! :P) Great shot.</td>', 'Wow that stands out! Love the lighting on the label, and the faint wisp of smoke is great. Excellent clarity too. If I inhale really hard I can even smell it (yuck! :P) Great shot.', '2006-08-14 10:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
