(2725604, 380018, 40718, '<td valign="top">Don''t let the DNMC boo-birds get you down.  Excellent take on hyperreality.  You did nicely in that there isn''t too much supersaturation.  I do think, meh, is this really fire? but DPC has become WAAAAYY to narrow in their interpretations of challenges. So a big fat 8 from me.  I''m sure it''s gonna bump you from a 4.5 to a 4.55.... ;(</td>', 'Don''t let the DNMC boo-birds get you down.  Excellent take on hyperreality.  You did nicely in that there isn''t too much supersaturation.  I do think, meh, is this really fire? but DPC has become WAAAAYY to narrow in their interpretations of challenges. So a big fat 8 from me.  I''m sure it''s gonna bump you from a 4.5 to a 4.55.... ;(', '2006-08-14 12:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
