(2725617, 380021, 40718, '<td valign="top">Man I love red hair, so bonus point from me.  I would have loved if the hair was sharper.  I''m guessing motion blur.  At least you didn''t try to overcompensate with some wicked USM.  We all know this is gonna get voted down, but I''m voting extra points for creativity. 7 from me.  I would have done higher if you could have frozen that hair completely.</td>', 'Man I love red hair, so bonus point from me.  I would have loved if the hair was sharper.  I''m guessing motion blur.  At least you didn''t try to overcompensate with some wicked USM.  We all know this is gonna get voted down, but I''m voting extra points for creativity. 7 from me.  I would have done higher if you could have frozen that hair completely.', '2006-08-14 12:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
