(2725790, 380011, 50231, '<td valign="top">Hello. The image to me is a little soft, the light harsh and some detail is lost. The composition seems to be more of the range than the fire. A closer shot of the burner, I think would have been better for meeting the challenge. As you know DPC wants WOW and this I am afraid lacks the WOW factor.<br/> <br/>Gave you a 5 for meeting the challenge.<br/> <br/>Erick</td>', 'Hello. The image to me is a little soft, the light harsh and some detail is lost. The composition seems to be more of the range than the fire. A closer shot of the burner, I think would have been better for meeting the challenge. As you know DPC wants WOW and this I am afraid lacks the WOW factor. Gave you a 5 for meeting the challenge. Erick', '2006-08-14 15:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2725803, 379939, 50231, '<td valign="top">Hello. This is a good macro. It meets the challenge for sure and it has a little drama from the action and the strike of the flint. But it is just a lighter and I think with shooting everyday objects an effort must be made to do it so different to achieve the WOW factor. Nice image good composition and meets the challenge. 6<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Hello. This is a good macro. It meets the challenge for sure and it has a little drama from the action and the strike of the flint. But it is just a lighter and I think with shooting everyday objects an effort must be made to do it so different to achieve the WOW factor. Nice image good composition and meets the challenge. 6 Wazz', '2006-08-14 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2725807, 377432, 50231, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of fire but I am not sure what to focus on and my eye is wandering looking for the WOW. It sure meets the challenge. 5<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Very nice capture of fire but I am not sure what to focus on and my eye is wandering looking for the WOW. It sure meets the challenge. 5 Wazz', '2006-08-14 15:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
