(2726170, 380057, 16004, '<td valign="top">for sheer effort alone you get a ten.  for the ever so slight cheesy and tacky benny hill-esque  you get another ten.  deeply impreseed with this; which is the obvious intent, i suppose.  i do think you might have been a little bit over zealous with the old noise reduction, there, but generally this is superb to the nth degree.  creative, imaginative, bit funny, excellently executed.  10.</td>', 'for sheer effort alone you get a ten.  for the ever so slight cheesy and tacky benny hill-esque  you get another ten.  deeply impreseed with this; which is the obvious intent, i suppose.  i do think you might have been a little bit over zealous with the old noise reduction, there, but generally this is superb to the nth degree.  creative, imaginative, bit funny, excellently executed.  10.', '2006-08-14 17:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726178, 380057, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice rescue man!;)</td>', 'Nice rescue man!;)', '2006-08-14 17:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726182, 378764, 16004, '<td valign="top">superb timing, and brilliantly captured; the nature of the sponsor just makes this even more perfect.  only slight thing is that i wish it were a bit more centred, but it''s just me reaching for anything to criticise; really it''s a great shot, perfect for the challenge and 10 times better than anything i could do.  10.</td>', 'superb timing, and brilliantly captured; the nature of the sponsor just makes this even more perfect.  only slight thing is that i wish it were a bit more centred, but it''s just me reaching for anything to criticise; really it''s a great shot, perfect for the challenge and 10 times better than anything i could do.  10.', '2006-08-14 17:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726185, 378872, 16004, '<td valign="top">nothing in the frame really appears to be in focus, or maybe everything feels slightly over sharpened.  either way, i can''t really see any real focal point of interest within the shot, and i think that it might have been more effecive as a whole piece if it were taken at night...  3.</td>', 'nothing in the frame really appears to be in focus, or maybe everything feels slightly over sharpened.  either way, i can''t really see any real focal point of interest within the shot, and i think that it might have been more effecive as a whole piece if it were taken at night...  3.', '2006-08-14 17:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726188, 380057, 32254, '<td valign="top">Yup, that''s hot :)</td>', 'Yup, that''s hot :)', '2006-08-14 17:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726199, 380008, 16004, '<td valign="top">has such a simple elegance...  puts me in mind of the cover to the cd single Garbage did for one of the bond films...  it has a sensuous curviness that i like very much.  gorgeous and lovely - 9.</td>', 'has such a simple elegance...  puts me in mind of the cover to the cd single Garbage did for one of the bond films...  it has a sensuous curviness that i like very much.  gorgeous and lovely - 9.', '2006-08-14 17:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
