(2726229, 379942, 50231, '<td valign="top">Good fire. A little soft. Perhaps a little more time in post (Bump in contrast/ more USM) would have brought out the image. 5<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Good fire. A little soft. Perhaps a little more time in post (Bump in contrast/ more USM) would have brought out the image. 5 Wazz', '2006-08-14 17:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
