(2726420, 379858, 56797, '<td valign="top">beautifully simple. I like the border too. ties it all together. 9</td>', 'beautifully simple. I like the border too. ties it all together. 9', '2006-08-14 18:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726421, 379670, 56797, '<td valign="top">nice idea. I''d prefer it was sharper though.</td>', 'nice idea. I''d prefer it was sharper though.', '2006-08-14 18:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726424, 378149, 56797, '<td valign="top">nice job getting it all black around that. I assume it''s not attached to a stove/oven. very interesting.</td>', 'nice job getting it all black around that. I assume it''s not attached to a stove/oven. very interesting.', '2006-08-14 18:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726425, 378082, 56797, '<td valign="top">I think I''d prefer this with a faster shutter speed so the flames werent so soft. but I liek the rest of this alot.</td>', 'I think I''d prefer this with a faster shutter speed so the flames werent so soft. but I liek the rest of this alot.', '2006-08-14 18:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726429, 379764, 56797, '<td valign="top">cute but the connection to the challenge seesm subtle at best and the woman would have much more impact if she were less blurry. I do like the addition of the border and your composition though.</td>', 'cute but the connection to the challenge seesm subtle at best and the woman would have much more impact if she were less blurry. I do like the addition of the border and your composition though.', '2006-08-14 18:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726433, 377837, 53316, '<td valign="top">Border is simple and elegant. I like the fact that a tiny match produced such a large flame - it gives the flame a sense of power, and the flowing shape of the flame has a sense of grace.</td>', 'Border is simple and elegant. I like the fact that a tiny match produced such a large flame - it gives the flame a sense of power, and the flowing shape of the flame has a sense of grace.', '2006-08-14 18:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726438, 379898, 53316, '<td valign="top">This shot really makes the fire come alive.  Great job.  It would be interesting to see what it would look like with the entire bottom cropped off, so that there is only flame in the shot.  (Not marking down for this at all, just saying it would be an interesting idea)</td>', 'This shot really makes the fire come alive.  Great job.  It would be interesting to see what it would look like with the entire bottom cropped off, so that there is only flame in the shot.  (Not marking down for this at all, just saying it would be an interesting idea)', '2006-08-14 18:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726446, 378165, 56797, '<td valign="top">It''s really hard to tell if this is fire or a trick. I think that hurts your chances. soemthing to show scale or heat effect would help immensely.</td>', 'It''s really hard to tell if this is fire or a trick. I think that hurts your chances. soemthing to show scale or heat effect would help immensely.', '2006-08-14 18:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726453, 380063, 56797, '<td valign="top">beautiful reflection. i think the composition is a little too straight forward and it would be nicer to not have cut off the top but it''s still nice overall. good luck.</td>', 'beautiful reflection. i think the composition is a little too straight forward and it would be nicer to not have cut off the top but it''s still nice overall. good luck.', '2006-08-14 18:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726457, 380060, 56797, '<td valign="top">wow. that''s kind of cool and creepy. I like how subtle it is. good luck.</td>', 'wow. that''s kind of cool and creepy. I like how subtle it is. good luck.', '2006-08-14 18:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726459, 380038, 50231, '<td valign="top">Nice! I think the image needs to by tilted a touch to level the glass. I think a tough more contrast and USM. The image is cool and captivating it has the beginnings of the "WOW'' factor. 7<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Nice! I think the image needs to by tilted a touch to level the glass. I think a tough more contrast and USM. The image is cool and captivating it has the beginnings of the "WOW'' factor. 7 Wazz', '2006-08-14 18:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726464, 378864, 56797, '<td valign="top">WOW! That''s fantastic. It''s beautiful and mesmerizing. my first 10 given so far too.</td>', 'WOW! That''s fantastic. It''s beautiful and mesmerizing. my first 10 given so far too.', '2006-08-14 18:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726467, 379730, 56797, '<td valign="top">nice composition. I like how the people give this a sense of scale. good job.</td>', 'nice composition. I like how the people give this a sense of scale. good job.', '2006-08-14 18:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726468, 378851, 50231, '<td valign="top">This has the "WOW" factor! Superb light and the capture of the flame is perfect. In focus it is sharp and the colors are right on! Whats not to love! 9<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'This has the "WOW" factor! Superb light and the capture of the flame is perfect. In focus it is sharp and the colors are right on! Whats not to love! 9 Wazz', '2006-08-14 18:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
