(2726484, 379942, 56797, '<td valign="top">I think i''d like this better if the people werent so far off to the left of the frame. maybe if the fire was slightly right and the people slightly left it wouldnt feel so cramped.</td>', 'I think i''d like this better if the people werent so far off to the left of the frame. maybe if the fire was slightly right and the people slightly left it wouldnt feel so cramped.', '2006-08-14 18:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
