(2726557, 379928, 53316, '<td valign="top">This is a hard shot for me as my eye wants to keep focusing on the woman and then the flames - it is like my eye does not know where to go.  I would mark down for that, except this is such a creative shot that I simply cannot bring myself to do that.  The contrasting green and red also seems harsh to my eye, but that actually helps me appreciate the mood of the shot.  Overall, I like this and think it was a great idea that was nicely executed.</td>', 'This is a hard shot for me as my eye wants to keep focusing on the woman and then the flames - it is like my eye does not know where to go.  I would mark down for that, except this is such a creative shot that I simply cannot bring myself to do that.  The contrasting green and red also seems harsh to my eye, but that actually helps me appreciate the mood of the shot.  Overall, I like this and think it was a great idea that was nicely executed.', '2006-08-14 18:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
