(2726576, 380037, 53316, '<td valign="top">Composition is good - I especially like the perspective.  But of course it would have been a better fit for this challenge if there had been flames showing.  Some contrast or color adjustments may have helped bring this shot to life.  I don''t think this is a bad photo, just one that could have used a little extra to impress.</td>', 'Composition is good - I especially like the perspective.  But of course it would have been a better fit for this challenge if there had been flames showing.  Some contrast or color adjustments may have helped bring this shot to life.  I don''t think this is a bad photo, just one that could have used a little extra to impress.', '2006-08-14 18:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
