(2726600, 379924, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Confusing concept (I''m wondering why the heck a golf club''s on fire) but I am unexpectedly finding myself liking it.  I think it is due to the sheer elegance of the trailing flame.  This shot took my mind off of confusion and put it on the artistic, and I think that is a great achievement.</td>', 'Hmm.  Confusing concept (I''m wondering why the heck a golf club''s on fire) but I am unexpectedly finding myself liking it.  I think it is due to the sheer elegance of the trailing flame.  This shot took my mind off of confusion and put it on the artistic, and I think that is a great achievement.', '2006-08-14 18:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
