(2726663, 379484, 53316, '<td valign="top">Haha, it''s great on dialup... I was totally sitting here when it was only a bit loaded thinking, what''s that foil thing sticking up out of a loaf of bread? LOL.  Your image captures or implies everything that is good about campfires - roasting marshmallows, sitting around with your friends talking.... and the bad, too, like the horrible plumes of smoke that make your clothes smell for days! :-)  <br/> <br/>Anyway, I think this is a great shot and I cannot find much to say that would improve it!</td>', 'Haha, it''s great on dialup... I was totally sitting here when it was only a bit loaded thinking, what''s that foil thing sticking up out of a loaf of bread? LOL.  Your image captures or implies everything that is good about campfires - roasting marshmallows, sitting around with your friends talking.... and the bad, too, like the horrible plumes of smoke that make your clothes smell for days! :-)   Anyway, I think this is a great shot and I cannot find much to say that would improve it!', '2006-08-14 19:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
