(2726778, 379847, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like how most of the shot is muted which brings more attention to the flames; the muted colors, while not drawing too much attention to themselves, still are very beautiful and go together very nicely.  The model looks dramatic but not too staged, and many times that balance is hard to achieve.  I also like how the sun is streaming through the clouds next to the hand.  The minimal border puts the finishing touch on this fantastic image.</td>', 'I like how most of the shot is muted which brings more attention to the flames; the muted colors, while not drawing too much attention to themselves, still are very beautiful and go together very nicely.  The model looks dramatic but not too staged, and many times that balance is hard to achieve.  I also like how the sun is streaming through the clouds next to the hand.  The minimal border puts the finishing touch on this fantastic image.', '2006-08-14 19:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
