(2726888, 380016, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice shot great colors</td>', 'nice shot great colors', '2006-08-14 20:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726889, 380021, 53316, '<td valign="top">Seems possibly oversharpened.  However, I LOVE the way the shoulder becomes part of the background.  It reminds me of a bust, and therefore since a bust is not human I can forgive the oversharpened-ish skin texture.  I do like the way the details show up in the hair so you probably made the right decisions as far as sharpening is concerned.  As for meeting the challenge, it does not satisfy this as much as others do, but I think that it is close enough for me so I will not mark down.  I like the pose very much and the warm colors - makes me think she is turning her face upwards towards a bright sun. If you were trying for a solid color background, you were not quite there - however, I LOVE the way that the background appears to be solid until you look at the image more, and then there are hidden shapes that appear.  Overall I think this is a great photo and you did a great job of capturing the motion and the "fire" in the hair.</td>', 'Seems possibly oversharpened.  However, I LOVE the way the shoulder becomes part of the background.  It reminds me of a bust, and therefore since a bust is not human I can forgive the oversharpened-ish skin texture.  I do like the way the details show up in the hair so you probably made the right decisions as far as sharpening is concerned.  As for meeting the challenge, it does not satisfy this as much as others do, but I think that it is close enough for me so I will not mark down.  I like the pose very much and the warm colors - makes me think she is turning her face upwards towards a bright sun. If you were trying for a solid color background, you were not quite there - however, I LOVE the way that the background appears to be solid until you look at the image more, and then there are hidden shapes that appear.  Overall I think this is a great photo and you did a great job of capturing the motion and the "fire" in the hair.', '2006-08-14 20:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726891, 379934, 51556, '<td valign="top">crazy dude</td>', 'crazy dude', '2006-08-14 20:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726894, 378074, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice shot,great colors</td>', 'nice shot,great colors', '2006-08-14 20:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726895, 378948, 53316, '<td valign="top">Seems like a very creative concept!  Composition seems off but I cannot figure out where more or less negative space is needed (not marking off for this).</td>', 'Seems like a very creative concept!  Composition seems off but I cannot figure out where more or less negative space is needed (not marking off for this).', '2006-08-14 20:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726901, 379797, 51556, '<td valign="top">really cool</td>', 'really cool', '2006-08-14 20:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726902, 380050, 53316, '<td valign="top">My main suggestion would be to have the cigarete glowing red to increase the appearance of "fire".  The thing I like most is the trail of smoke rising upwards.</td>', 'My main suggestion would be to have the cigarete glowing red to increase the appearance of "fire".  The thing I like most is the trail of smoke rising upwards.', '2006-08-14 20:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726903, 379479, 50231, '<td valign="top">Had something here I can see it! I like the idea. I don''t like the garbage bag. I think the lighting is a tad harsh and the background seem to printed. But the peppers are a nice compositional element. Tad OOF and could be sharper. Meets the Challenge I give a generous 6<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Had something here I can see it! I like the idea. I don''t like the garbage bag. I think the lighting is a tad harsh and the background seem to printed. But the peppers are a nice compositional element. Tad OOF and could be sharper. Meets the Challenge I give a generous 6 Wazz', '2006-08-14 20:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726907, 379547, 51556, '<td valign="top">sweet,I like it.</td>', 'sweet,I like it.', '2006-08-14 20:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726908, 379760, 50231, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! And yup it is a fire starter. 6<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Nice capture! And yup it is a fire starter. 6 Wazz', '2006-08-14 20:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726913, 379762, 53316, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I have always liked the way that matches have the second flame that "drips down" from below (the flame that starts to the left on your image).  I like how you captured this, as well as the match in mid-burn (some charred portion and some non-charred portion visible).  I like how the match head fades into the background, and how there are such fine details visible on the match.  What I love most of all is the magenta and blue colors that are visible at the bottom.  Truly a wonderful and uncommon image of a common subject.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I have always liked the way that matches have the second flame that "drips down" from below (the flame that starts to the left on your image).  I like how you captured this, as well as the match in mid-burn (some charred portion and some non-charred portion visible).  I like how the match head fades into the background, and how there are such fine details visible on the match.  What I love most of all is the magenta and blue colors that are visible at the bottom.  Truly a wonderful and uncommon image of a common subject.', '2006-08-14 20:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726915, 378864, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great explosion. Love the heat displacement too. Well done :)</td>', 'Great explosion. Love the heat displacement too. Well done :)', '2006-08-14 20:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726916, 379879, 50231, '<td valign="top">The first thing is it feel real abstract until I see the 5. It is not really in focus and I dont get the feel of fire as I have see from others in this challenge. 5<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'The first thing is it feel real abstract until I see the 5. It is not really in focus and I dont get the feel of fire as I have see from others in this challenge. 5 Wazz', '2006-08-14 20:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726920, 379690, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oooooh.  Very captivating shot.  While the background is a bit distracting, it also gives a real-life feel to the photo, which is furthered by the period cloting.  Composition is great - I like how there is the smaller fire in the middle.  I also I love how the flames are visible starting from their faces - I feel like this is a shot that could have taken so many tries to get right, because this looks like it was done right.</td>', 'Oooooh.  Very captivating shot.  While the background is a bit distracting, it also gives a real-life feel to the photo, which is furthered by the period cloting.  Composition is great - I like how there is the smaller fire in the middle.  I also I love how the flames are visible starting from their faces - I feel like this is a shot that could have taken so many tries to get right, because this looks like it was done right.', '2006-08-14 20:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726923, 377797, 51556, '<td valign="top">great shot,nice soft flames,nice colors too.</td>', 'great shot,nice soft flames,nice colors too.', '2006-08-14 20:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726928, 380055, 45475, '<td valign="top">Interesting take. Love the silhouettes, albeit noisey, but I suspect the ISO may have been high for this. Good work all the same :)</td>', 'Interesting take. Love the silhouettes, albeit noisey, but I suspect the ISO may have been high for this. Good work all the same :)', '2006-08-14 20:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726930, 379923, 51556, '<td valign="top">great work</td>', 'great work', '2006-08-14 20:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726934, 379349, 53316, '<td valign="top">Sadly, with the head not visible and the arm cropped out of the shot, the figure to the left becomes the main focus as the eye is trying to figure out how it makes sense visually.  That is what hurts this photo in my opinion.  <br/>Another thing that I think would make this better is if there were more of the forge shown (if the photo was cropped / framed looser on the bottom).  But that is not a main concern to me.  I can also imagine how some might now like the soft focus - but I do in fact like it.  I think it gives the feel of a dated postcard or photograph, which the monochrome helps to achieve.  Overall I think this is an image that has a lot of potential but does not really live up to it.  If you have the chance to go back and retake or recrop the shot, I would love to see how it would be with some improvements worked in.</td>', 'Sadly, with the head not visible and the arm cropped out of the shot, the figure to the left becomes the main focus as the eye is trying to figure out how it makes sense visually.  That is what hurts this photo in my opinion.  Another thing that I think would make this better is if there were more of the forge shown (if the photo was cropped / framed looser on the bottom).  But that is not a main concern to me.  I can also imagine how some might now like the soft focus - but I do in fact like it.  I think it gives the feel of a dated postcard or photograph, which the monochrome helps to achieve.  Overall I think this is an image that has a lot of potential but does not really live up to it.  If you have the chance to go back and retake or recrop the shot, I would love to see how it would be with some improvements worked in.', '2006-08-14 20:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726938, 378872, 51556, '<td valign="top">great colors ,one of my favorites</td>', 'great colors ,one of my favorites', '2006-08-14 20:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726940, 379746, 61971, '<td valign="top">The concept is nice. But it is hard to see if it really is flames on the cards. The background is way too busy imo. I would have liked to see them on a black bacground and the fire near the top of the cards or maybe behind the cards.</td>', 'The concept is nice. But it is hard to see if it really is flames on the cards. The background is way too busy imo. I would have liked to see them on a black bacground and the fire near the top of the cards or maybe behind the cards.', '2006-08-14 20:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726942, 379713, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I do not personally feel like it meets the challenge.  However, if there is a "right" way to get a DNMC, this would be it.  It is hard to put into different words what I mean, but I feel like while this photo fails to meet the challenge, it fails with grace - with thought to the challenge and not a blatent defiance of it.  I am marking you down but not as much as I otherwise would because I do see where you put thought into the shot.  Again, this is a beautiful photo - and one you should be very proud of.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I do not personally feel like it meets the challenge.  However, if there is a "right" way to get a DNMC, this would be it.  It is hard to put into different words what I mean, but I feel like while this photo fails to meet the challenge, it fails with grace - with thought to the challenge and not a blatent defiance of it.  I am marking you down but not as much as I otherwise would because I do see where you put thought into the shot.  Again, this is a beautiful photo - and one you should be very proud of.', '2006-08-14 20:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726943, 379908, 51556, '<td valign="top">this is really cool,great shot</td>', 'this is really cool,great shot', '2006-08-14 20:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726945, 379944, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2006-08-14 20:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726948, 379898, 51556, '<td valign="top">great shot ,creepy faces</td>', 'great shot ,creepy faces', '2006-08-14 21:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726951, 379753, 53316, '<td valign="top">Something about the composition seems a bit off.  Maybe with the flame in the location it is in, there is more attention drawn to it - but with the brightness of the flame I think anywhere it is positioned would have worked.  I don''t know what type of composition I would prefer.. it just seems off.  If I could put my finger on it I might mark down for it but as it stands now I will not.  There is haloing around the glass and bottle and while not immediately obvious, it is noticable.<br/> <br/>I like the colors - no, I adore the colors.  I also love how the flame seems to be coming from the glass as well as the bottle.  The lighting is good too, and while some people might not prefer the flash reflection on the bottle I think it adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Something about the composition seems a bit off.  Maybe with the flame in the location it is in, there is more attention drawn to it - but with the brightness of the flame I think anywhere it is positioned would have worked.  I don''t know what type of composition I would prefer.. it just seems off.  If I could put my finger on it I might mark down for it but as it stands now I will not.  There is haloing around the glass and bottle and while not immediately obvious, it is noticable. I like the colors - no, I adore the colors.  I also love how the flame seems to be coming from the glass as well as the bottle.  The lighting is good too, and while some people might not prefer the flash reflection on the bottle I think it adds a nice touch.', '2006-08-14 21:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726955, 379908, 53316, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative shot... um.. photo. A very creative photo. :-)  I like the colors in the background as well as the cut-off composition.  An all around great job in my opinion.</td>', 'This is a very creative shot... um.. photo. A very creative photo. :-)  I like the colors in the background as well as the cut-off composition.  An all around great job in my opinion.', '2006-08-14 21:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726962, 378149, 53316, '<td valign="top">It''s neat to see an image with blue flame instead of red/orange/yellow.  I like the pattern of colors on the left corner of the metal - but unfortunately, the beauty of it distracts my eye from the flame.  I think that could be just me, though; I think overall the composition is good.</td>', 'It''s neat to see an image with blue flame instead of red/orange/yellow.  I like the pattern of colors on the left corner of the metal - but unfortunately, the beauty of it distracts my eye from the flame.  I think that could be just me, though; I think overall the composition is good.', '2006-08-14 21:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726970, 380057, 3306, '<td valign="top">This has all the elements of a ribbon winner. Humor, Creativity, Unique, and technically well done. Good luck.</td>', 'This has all the elements of a ribbon winner. Humor, Creativity, Unique, and technically well done. Good luck.', '2006-08-14 21:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726972, 379670, 53316, '<td valign="top">A little bit more contrast between subject and background colors may have helped.  Otherwise I think this is great - it seems alive with motion, as if the cord is being dragged along the floor.  You captured "fire" in a creative and beautiful way.</td>', 'A little bit more contrast between subject and background colors may have helped.  Otherwise I think this is great - it seems alive with motion, as if the cord is being dragged along the floor.  You captured "fire" in a creative and beautiful way.', '2006-08-14 21:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726976, 380018, 51556, '<td valign="top">well I have to say,even though theres no real fire here,its  awesome.My favorite of the challenge.10</td>', 'well I have to say,even though theres no real fire here,its  awesome.My favorite of the challenge.10', '2006-08-14 21:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726978, 378165, 55642, '<td valign="top">The color gradient is nice, but noisy. And how do I know this is fire? I''m generally a fan of macro and abstract, but I honestly can''t tell that this is a blue flame. Such doubt will kill your score every time.</td>', 'The color gradient is nice, but noisy. And how do I know this is fire? I''m generally a fan of macro and abstract, but I honestly can''t tell that this is a blue flame. Such doubt will kill your score every time.', '2006-08-14 21:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726979, 379584, 51556, '<td valign="top">hell of a fire</td>', 'hell of a fire', '2006-08-14 21:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726985, 380004, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2006-08-14 21:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726986, 379847, 55642, '<td valign="top">This is a great take on the druid concept nice sharpness in the waves, and the driftwood. The lack of DoF makes it look like a still from a video game. That might be my only critique, actually, that it looks a touch computer generated. Overall, nice work!</td>', 'This is a great take on the druid concept nice sharpness in the waves, and the driftwood. The lack of DoF makes it look like a still from a video game. That might be my only critique, actually, that it looks a touch computer generated. Overall, nice work!', '2006-08-14 21:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726988, 379939, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2006-08-14 21:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726991, 379547, 55642, '<td valign="top">Thank you for giving the fire a context! I like the contrast of the red/orange flame and coals against the cool blue of dusk. Cozy! Can I pull up a folding chair and roast some marshmallows? Want a s''more?</td>', 'Thank you for giving the fire a context! I like the contrast of the red/orange flame and coals against the cool blue of dusk. Cozy! Can I pull up a folding chair and roast some marshmallows? Want a s''more?', '2006-08-14 21:12:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2726994, 379588, 55642, '<td valign="top">The color here is fabulous. I like the subtlety and the grace, a refreshing change from the more dark and in-your-face shots.</td>', 'The color here is fabulous. I like the subtlety and the grace, a refreshing change from the more dark and in-your-face shots.', '2006-08-14 21:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726995, 378870, 51556, '<td valign="top">great shot ,the eye is really cool</td>', 'great shot ,the eye is really cool', '2006-08-14 21:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727000, 380057, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hah, I love it! I love that the firefighter remains anonymous and mantains a "just doin'' my job, ma''am" look via the shadow across his eyes. I wonder how the fire was done? Nice work!</td>', 'Hah, I love it! I love that the firefighter remains anonymous and mantains a "just doin'' my job, ma''am" look via the shadow across his eyes. I wonder how the fire was done? Nice work!', '2006-08-14 21:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727002, 378851, 51556, '<td valign="top">great sot nice colors,I really like the blue smoke</td>', 'great sot nice colors,I really like the blue smoke', '2006-08-14 21:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727005, 378691, 55642, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. There''s something appealing about the apple flambe. Nice focus on the apple. Reminds me of the flaming heart in religious iconography.</td>', 'I really like this photo. There''s something appealing about the apple flambe. Nice focus on the apple. Reminds me of the flaming heart in religious iconography.', '2006-08-14 21:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727006, 379990, 51556, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2006-08-14 21:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727009, 379920, 51556, '<td valign="top">cool,that smoke is awesome</td>', 'cool,that smoke is awesome', '2006-08-14 21:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727010, 378685, 55642, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus on the arm here. There''s a scar on the arm I would clone out since it''s a minor distraction from the hand of flame. I hope this didn''t require a trip to the ER... it looks painful!</td>', 'Excellent focus on the arm here. There''s a scar on the arm I would clone out since it''s a minor distraction from the hand of flame. I hope this didn''t require a trip to the ER... it looks painful!', '2006-08-14 21:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727014, 380018, 55642, '<td valign="top">That is quote a sunset! There are a couple spots in the sky where it looks like the curves got a bit out of control. I''m not sure the voters will buy this as fire since they seem pretty literal for this challenge.</td>', 'That is quote a sunset! There are a couple spots in the sky where it looks like the curves got a bit out of control. I''m not sure the voters will buy this as fire since they seem pretty literal for this challenge.', '2006-08-14 21:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727017, 379760, 51556, '<td valign="top">sweet shot.10</td>', 'sweet shot.10', '2006-08-14 21:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727018, 379933, 51556, '<td valign="top">really nice</td>', 'really nice', '2006-08-14 21:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727019, 377797, 55642, '<td valign="top">nice focus on the pepper, but it doesn''t look like it''s actually on fire. It looks rather disembodied. There''s a small flare along the top edge I would clone out. Despite the criticisms I''ve mentioned, I think this is a fairly solid shot and it should do well in this challenge.</td>', 'nice focus on the pepper, but it doesn''t look like it''s actually on fire. It looks rather disembodied. There''s a small flare along the top edge I would clone out. Despite the criticisms I''ve mentioned, I think this is a fairly solid shot and it should do well in this challenge.', '2006-08-14 21:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727020, 377724, 51556, '<td valign="top">crazy,nice shot</td>', 'crazy,nice shot', '2006-08-14 21:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727021, 379038, 55642, '<td valign="top">This was quite a find! A good depiction of the chaos and destructive power of the element.</td>', 'This was quite a find! A good depiction of the chaos and destructive power of the element.', '2006-08-14 21:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727022, 377891, 61971, '<td valign="top">thats a neet idea. imo it would be better if the candle was outside of the glass? or screen.</td>', 'thats a neet idea. imo it would be better if the candle was outside of the glass? or screen.', '2006-08-14 21:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727026, 378851, 55642, '<td valign="top">After the success of a few different match shots in recent challenges, it was rather predictable that Fire would be innundated with matches. However, I like this one. It''s a solid shot that displays a bit of creativity which sets it apart from the others.</td>', 'After the success of a few different match shots in recent challenges, it was rather predictable that Fire would be innundated with matches. However, I like this one. It''s a solid shot that displays a bit of creativity which sets it apart from the others.', '2006-08-14 21:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727030, 379038, 51556, '<td valign="top">nice shot,great sky colors</td>', 'nice shot,great sky colors', '2006-08-14 21:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727031, 380020, 55642, '<td valign="top">If the model''s face were better lit, this would have scored a point higher from me. Everything else about it is great! I have a feeling other voters will find it too busy or just won''t get it, but I think the quirkiness is what gives this one so much potential.</td>', 'If the model''s face were better lit, this would have scored a point higher from me. Everything else about it is great! I have a feeling other voters will find it too busy or just won''t get it, but I think the quirkiness is what gives this one so much potential.', '2006-08-14 21:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727032, 379447, 61971, '<td valign="top">IMO this picture would have been nice if it were bigger. The background is great. The white cap at the bottom of the torch is a little distracting though.</td>', 'IMO this picture would have been nice if it were bigger. The background is great. The white cap at the bottom of the torch is a little distracting though.', '2006-08-14 21:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727035, 380056, 55642, '<td valign="top">This is sublime. The single burning tree makes this menacing, a subtle threat, a promise of the destruction yet to come. Gorgeous.</td>', 'This is sublime. The single burning tree makes this menacing, a subtle threat, a promise of the destruction yet to come. Gorgeous.', '2006-08-14 21:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727038, 379797, 55642, '<td valign="top">Looks like aurora borealis! I do think the composition is a bit chaotic and there''s a little too much negative space at the top. But I like the color and the concept quite a bit.</td>', 'Looks like aurora borealis! I do think the composition is a bit chaotic and there''s a little too much negative space at the top. But I like the color and the concept quite a bit.', '2006-08-14 21:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727040, 379920, 55642, '<td valign="top">The clarity of the black smoke is what makes this great for me. In some places it looks like a thin, fine mesh fabric. Che bellissima!</td>', 'The clarity of the black smoke is what makes this great for me. In some places it looks like a thin, fine mesh fabric. Che bellissima!', '2006-08-14 21:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727041, 378864, 51556, '<td valign="top">hope the whole place didnt go up,great colors</td>', 'hope the whole place didnt go up,great colors', '2006-08-14 21:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727043, 379753, 55773, '<td valign="top">10.</td>', '10.', '2006-08-14 21:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727045, 379927, 55642, '<td valign="top">I am so appreciative of the photos that give fire a context like this! Good light here, but I would like to see it a bit sharper.</td>', 'I am so appreciative of the photos that give fire a context like this! Good light here, but I would like to see it a bit sharper.', '2006-08-14 21:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727053, 379976, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity on the peppers, though it looks a touch <i>over</i>sharpened along some of the edges judging by the haloing. The background is quite noisy, but nothing a pass through NI shouldn''t be able to fix. It might also add a nice smooth gloss to the peppers.</td>', 'Nice clarity on the peppers, though it looks a touch oversharpened along some of the edges judging by the haloing. The background is quite noisy, but nothing a pass through NI shouldn''t be able to fix. It might also add a nice smooth gloss to the peppers.', '2006-08-14 21:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727054, 379731, 55642, '<td valign="top">I think the oversaturation works here. What works against you is that matches were a very common theme in this challenge.</td>', 'I think the oversaturation works here. What works against you is that matches were a very common theme in this challenge.', '2006-08-14 21:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727059, 379924, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, perhaps a bit more light on the ball? It looks so dull compared to the flaming club.</td>', 'I like the concept here, perhaps a bit more light on the ball? It looks so dull compared to the flaming club.', '2006-08-14 21:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727061, 376056, 55642, '<td valign="top">The subject is rather overdone, but this composition with the tight pseudopanoramic crop makes this a nice take on it.</td>', 'The subject is rather overdone, but this composition with the tight pseudopanoramic crop makes this a nice take on it.', '2006-08-14 21:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727068, 380007, 55642, '<td valign="top">Good composition here! My only complaint is that the color of the candles is rather dull. A dark purple or blue might have added a nice color punch.</td>', 'Good composition here! My only complaint is that the color of the candles is rather dull. A dark purple or blue might have added a nice color punch.', '2006-08-14 21:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727070, 379916, 55642, '<td valign="top">Yay for abstracts! This is a really nice mix of shape and color. Nice work!</td>', 'Yay for abstracts! This is a really nice mix of shape and color. Nice work!', '2006-08-14 21:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727072, 379270, 55773, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus, but still gives it somewhat of a warming effect. 7.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus, but still gives it somewhat of a warming effect. 7.', '2006-08-14 21:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727075, 378685, 58785, '<td valign="top">An excellent shot of a fire... The border also sits very nice with tan and fire color.<br/> <br/>I voted 9 to this shot, because it is very clean shot. Lighting is excellent too ;)<br/> <br/>good luck.</td>', 'An excellent shot of a fire... The border also sits very nice with tan and fire color. I voted 9 to this shot, because it is very clean shot. Lighting is excellent too ;) good luck.', '2006-08-14 21:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727079, 379753, 55642, '<td valign="top">This would have done better if it had more space on the left edge and showed the entire bottle. It looks rather shoved into that left corner.</td>', 'This would have done better if it had more space on the left edge and showed the entire bottle. It looks rather shoved into that left corner.', '2006-08-14 21:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727080, 379871, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but a bit dark. I would like to see the model better lit.</td>', 'Nice idea, but a bit dark. I would like to see the model better lit.', '2006-08-14 21:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727083, 379447, 55773, '<td valign="top">Kind of small. Increasing length and width would''ve helped this heaps.</td>', 'Kind of small. Increasing length and width would''ve helped this heaps.', '2006-08-14 21:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727090, 379859, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice to see an original concept in the challenge, congrats on being the only one to think of it, obvious though it may have been! The composition is a bit cluttered, I think. The person standing behind her is distracting, the angle isn''t the best. I would like to see her face as she''s blowing the candles out.</td>', 'Nice to see an original concept in the challenge, congrats on being the only one to think of it, obvious though it may have been! The composition is a bit cluttered, I think. The person standing behind her is distracting, the angle isn''t the best. I would like to see her face as she''s blowing the candles out.', '2006-08-14 21:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727104, 379974, 40718, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5.  Perhaps it has too much negative space at the top.  I do like the idea and it does look like the northern lights.  In the end I think perhaps there wasn''t quite enough to it to hold our attention.<br/> <br/>Keep it up though.</td>', 'I gave this a 5.  Perhaps it has too much negative space at the top.  I do like the idea and it does look like the northern lights.  In the end I think perhaps there wasn''t quite enough to it to hold our attention. Keep it up though.', '2006-08-14 21:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727105, 379933, 55642, '<td valign="top">There are just too many contextless, dismbodied flame shots in this challenge, and to be honest none of them are terribly interesting. This is much like the Fireworks challenge, where the photos that scored best actually placed them in some kind of context. That said, I think this is one of the better versions, with nice clarity in the upper right.</td>', 'There are just too many contextless, dismbodied flame shots in this challenge, and to be honest none of them are terribly interesting. This is much like the Fireworks challenge, where the photos that scored best actually placed them in some kind of context. That said, I think this is one of the better versions, with nice clarity in the upper right.', '2006-08-14 21:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727106, 377109, 55773, '<td valign="top">Classic childhood photo.</td>', 'Classic childhood photo.', '2006-08-14 21:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727109, 379763, 55642, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, pasta, but pasta flambe? I''ve never seen that before... That''s the only thing that puts me off a bit for this photo, the fact that one would not normally light spaghetti on fire.</td>', 'Mmmm, pasta, but pasta flambe? I''ve never seen that before... That''s the only thing that puts me off a bit for this photo, the fact that one would not normally light spaghetti on fire.', '2006-08-14 21:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727111, 379417, 55642, '<td valign="top">A very nice, simple composition, but perhaps one more click to the right would bring out a little more detail along the rim and give the flame a little dimension.</td>', 'A very nice, simple composition, but perhaps one more click to the right would bring out a little more detail along the rim and give the flame a little dimension.', '2006-08-14 21:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727118, 379986, 55642, '<td valign="top">I''m always impressed by this trick, but have no desire to learn it myself. The color of the flame is nice, but the rest of the photo is rather dull. And the top of his head is cut off. My advice is to loosen the crop by a good margin and include a bit of the setting.</td>', 'I''m always impressed by this trick, but have no desire to learn it myself. The color of the flame is nice, but the rest of the photo is rather dull. And the top of his head is cut off. My advice is to loosen the crop by a good margin and include a bit of the setting.', '2006-08-14 21:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727125, 379849, 55642, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s going on here, exactly, but it''s very chaotic. The clarity of the stopped motion is nice, but I''m just not sure what I''m witnessing.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s going on here, exactly, but it''s very chaotic. The clarity of the stopped motion is nice, but I''m just not sure what I''m witnessing.', '2006-08-14 21:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727128, 379990, 50231, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones, light and idea. The illusion is awesome. Z vote you get from me iz 8<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Wonderful tones, light and idea. The illusion is awesome. Z vote you get from me iz 8 Wazz', '2006-08-14 21:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727130, 379847, 34938, '<td valign="top">how can this not get the BLUE? Congratulations on your blue ribbon in the fire challenge...I cannot find any fault with this shot...12, I mean, 10!<br/> <br/>I have come back to this after voting and commenting on nearly every photo...O reckon this has to be the clearest winner in this or any challenge for quite some time...well done on all the work and preparation...you deserve the blue...you can start celebrating now, cause it''s in the bag!</td>', 'how can this not get the BLUE? Congratulations on your blue ribbon in the fire challenge...I cannot find any fault with this shot...12, I mean, 10! I have come back to this after voting and commenting on nearly every photo...O reckon this has to be the clearest winner in this or any challenge for quite some time...well done on all the work and preparation...you deserve the blue...you can start celebrating now, cause it''s in the bag!', '2006-08-14 21:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727133, 379791, 55642, '<td valign="top">Interesting color in the flame, and the etched design adds an interesting refractive detail, but I''m missing the stem of the glass. It feels unbalanced somehow without it.</td>', 'Interesting color in the flame, and the etched design adds an interesting refractive detail, but I''m missing the stem of the glass. It feels unbalanced somehow without it.', '2006-08-14 21:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727134, 378514, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice idea here, though the light on the arm is too harsh.</td>', 'Nice idea here, though the light on the arm is too harsh.', '2006-08-14 21:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727138, 380031, 55642, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, though it looks like there''s some image noise in the background? Especially visible near the flame.</td>', 'Interesting concept, though it looks like there''s some image noise in the background? Especially visible near the flame.', '2006-08-14 21:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727142, 380055, 50231, '<td valign="top">Powerful image and yes it implies fire. However I see no fire and that in lies the problem. A silhouette is much easier to capture than fire. I feel that is what the challenge is about. Having said that I will vote this at my base if there was fire in it because the content relates to fire. 5<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Powerful image and yes it implies fire. However I see no fire and that in lies the problem. A silhouette is much easier to capture than fire. I feel that is what the challenge is about. Having said that I will vote this at my base if there was fire in it because the content relates to fire. 5 Wazz', '2006-08-14 21:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727143, 379939, 55642, '<td valign="top">While I appreciate the idea, I think the composition just doesn''t flow well.</td>', 'While I appreciate the idea, I think the composition just doesn''t flow well.', '2006-08-14 21:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727146, 379665, 55642, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of match shots in this challenge, and I appreciate that people want to try it since a couple have veen very successful in other challenges as of late, but in a Fire challenge I think it needs to be a lot more original than this to succeed.</td>', 'There are a lot of match shots in this challenge, and I appreciate that people want to try it since a couple have veen very successful in other challenges as of late, but in a Fire challenge I think it needs to be a lot more original than this to succeed.', '2006-08-14 21:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727148, 379756, 23458, '<td valign="top">A closer crop would have done wonders. Still nice perspective  - you have guts taking a photo from this angle, that''s for sure.</td>', 'A closer crop would have done wonders. Still nice perspective  - you have guts taking a photo from this angle, that''s for sure.', '2006-08-14 21:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727152, 378864, 55642, '<td valign="top">Wow. Do you maintain possession of your eyebrows and nosehair after this stunt?</td>', 'Wow. Do you maintain possession of your eyebrows and nosehair after this stunt?', '2006-08-14 21:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727156, 380008, 50231, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the flame but nothing else to help the composition. The technicals are there and it''s not bad. The problem is, with it being contrived. I do like it, in its simplicity. But the score remains at my base 5<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Good capture of the flame but nothing else to help the composition. The technicals are there and it''s not bad. The problem is, with it being contrived. I do like it, in its simplicity. But the score remains at my base 5 Wazz', '2006-08-14 21:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727157, 380016, 55642, '<td valign="top">There are just too many matches in this challenge. I think the successful match shot will be one that does something slightly more creative than merely lighting it.</td>', 'There are just too many matches in this challenge. I think the successful match shot will be one that does something slightly more creative than merely lighting it.', '2006-08-14 21:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727159, 379923, 55642, '<td valign="top">There are just too many contextless, dismbodied flame shots in this challenge, and to be honest none of them are terribly interesting. This is much like the Fireworks challenge, where the photos that scored best actually placed them in some kind of context. There''s some good clarity in the lower left.</td>', 'There are just too many contextless, dismbodied flame shots in this challenge, and to be honest none of them are terribly interesting. This is much like the Fireworks challenge, where the photos that scored best actually placed them in some kind of context. There''s some good clarity in the lower left.', '2006-08-14 21:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727161, 379858, 55642, '<td valign="top">Take those babies to Vegas! Nice choice with the red die.</td>', 'Take those babies to Vegas! Nice choice with the red die.', '2006-08-14 22:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727163, 379690, 50231, '<td valign="top">Good capture and yes I can feel the heat! I like the amount of flame but cant help thinking how cool a tighter crop might be. Anyway fun shot good work. 7<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Good capture and yes I can feel the heat! I like the amount of flame but cant help thinking how cool a tighter crop might be. Anyway fun shot good work. 7 Wazz', '2006-08-14 22:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727165, 379837, 55642, '<td valign="top">I would like this a lot more without the shaker at the top. The flaming martini stands on its own.</td>', 'I would like this a lot more without the shaker at the top. The flaming martini stands on its own.', '2006-08-14 22:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727166, 378078, 50231, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea! The shot works and is sharp and good light. Only one suggestion. Maybe get lower to the ground and shoot more from her perspective. Anyway I dig it. 7</td>', 'Nice Idea! The shot works and is sharp and good light. Only one suggestion. Maybe get lower to the ground and shoot more from her perspective. Anyway I dig it. 7', '2006-08-14 22:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727167, 379930, 55642, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting concept. I think the candle itself is too bright, but the reflection on the vase and flowers is spot on.</td>', 'This is an interesting concept. I think the candle itself is too bright, but the reflection on the vase and flowers is spot on.', '2006-08-14 22:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727168, 380049, 55642, '<td valign="top">Mostly I look at this and just think, "Straaange..." but I appreciate the originality and the execution isn''t bad, though perhaps a touch too flat.</td>', 'Mostly I look at this and just think, "Straaange..." but I appreciate the originality and the execution isn''t bad, though perhaps a touch too flat.', '2006-08-14 22:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727171, 379871, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great concept, nice composition. I would like to see the lighting on the man a little crisper. 7.</td>', 'Great concept, nice composition. I would like to see the lighting on the man a little crisper. 7.', '2006-08-14 22:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727173, 379843, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve given the fire some context. However, I think the lightness of the scene works against your druidic theme and there''s too much negative space with the sky. This might work better as a square crop.</td>', 'I like that you''ve given the fire some context. However, I think the lightness of the scene works against your druidic theme and there''s too much negative space with the sky. This might work better as a square crop.', '2006-08-14 22:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727174, 379845, 50231, '<td valign="top">Super shot! Except for the blown out spot on the ring but that is neither here nor there. I want a match in this shot for the fire but ... 7<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Super shot! Except for the blown out spot on the ring but that is neither here nor there. I want a match in this shot for the fire but ... 7 Wazz', '2006-08-14 22:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727176, 378628, 50231, '<td valign="top">Nice timing! What can I say about this but wonderful. Kiwi-esq no?<br/> <br/>Maybe a tad sharper but very nice. 8<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Nice timing! What can I say about this but wonderful. Kiwi-esq no? Maybe a tad sharper but very nice. 8 Wazz', '2006-08-14 22:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727177, 379480, 55642, '<td valign="top">In a fire challenge, a successful match photo will do more than just light them. Aside from being yet another match photo, the trailing end of the flame is cut off at the left. I feel like I''m only looking at part of the action.</td>', 'In a fire challenge, a successful match photo will do more than just light them. Aside from being yet another match photo, the trailing end of the flame is cut off at the left. I feel like I''m only looking at part of the action.', '2006-08-14 22:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727178, 379928, 23458, '<td valign="top">Crazy outfit - like the smokey effects. Would like to see the subject slightly better lit such that she stands out a little more from her surrounds. 7</td>', 'Crazy outfit - like the smokey effects. Would like to see the subject slightly better lit such that she stands out a little more from her surrounds. 7', '2006-08-14 22:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727181, 378764, 55642, '<td valign="top">Oooh, that''s never good... This is a nice break from the monotony of matches and disembodied flames. I might clone out the white bucket and items around it in the upper left.</td>', 'Oooh, that''s never good... This is a nice break from the monotony of matches and disembodied flames. I might clone out the white bucket and items around it in the upper left.', '2006-08-14 22:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727182, 379944, 50231, '<td valign="top">Quite a few flame only shots in this challenge so I know that bummed you out. I won''t beat on it. Just to say that it could be a little sharper. 6<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Quite a few flame only shots in this challenge so I know that bummed you out. I won''t beat on it. Just to say that it could be a little sharper. 6 Wazz', '2006-08-14 22:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727183, 377797, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well there are a lot of similar shots in this challenge. However this is very well executed. Perhaps I''d like to see some of the highlights toned down a touch. 7.</td>', 'Well there are a lot of similar shots in this challenge. However this is very well executed. Perhaps I''d like to see some of the highlights toned down a touch. 7.', '2006-08-14 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727184, 379962, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice texture on the briquettes! Perhaps a bit too much noise in the flame, especially visible top center.</td>', 'Nice texture on the briquettes! Perhaps a bit too much noise in the flame, especially visible top center.', '2006-08-14 22:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727185, 379837, 45475, '<td valign="top">Is it just me, or is that olive looking mighty sexy??? [cough] Umm, ok, back to the comment: The lighting is good, the set-up (although a repetative theme) is well executed, you''ve captured beautiful colour from the flame, everything is visible and in focus - ''tis a 9 :)</td>', 'Is it just me, or is that olive looking mighty sexy??? [cough] Umm, ok, back to the comment: The lighting is good, the set-up (although a repetative theme) is well executed, you''ve captured beautiful colour from the flame, everything is visible and in focus - ''tis a 9 :)', '2006-08-14 22:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727186, 380022, 50231, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I am sure you know by now that the flame really should be in the glass for that WOW factor to start kicking in. Not a bad effort. 6<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Good idea but I am sure you know by now that the flame really should be in the glass for that WOW factor to start kicking in. Not a bad effort. 6 Wazz', '2006-08-14 22:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727187, 379839, 55642, '<td valign="top">I am not fond of the title, but I like the concept of the burning shoes. Good execution.</td>', 'I am not fond of the title, but I like the concept of the burning shoes. Good execution.', '2006-08-14 22:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727190, 379602, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colour here. I like the way the fire refracts (?) through the stem of glass. Could be improved if the glass was slightly crisper.</td>', 'Nice use of colour here. I like the way the fire refracts (?) through the stem of glass. Could be improved if the glass was slightly crisper.', '2006-08-14 22:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727192, 379908, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, especially since it gives the fire some context, but it''s too obscured by the smoke.</td>', 'I like the idea here, especially since it gives the fire some context, but it''s too obscured by the smoke.', '2006-08-14 22:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727202, 378691, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice work! A tad slower on the shutter would have seen smoother curves on the flames, but a brilliant shot all the same :)</td>', 'Nice work! A tad slower on the shutter would have seen smoother curves on the flames, but a brilliant shot all the same :)', '2006-08-14 22:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727204, 377724, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice! Great stop motion here. My one complaint is that the top of the fireball is cut off.</td>', 'Nice! Great stop motion here. My one complaint is that the top of the fireball is cut off.', '2006-08-14 22:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727207, 379756, 55642, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalist idea here, but I feel as though there could be more clarity around the inner edge of the burner.</td>', 'I like the minimalist idea here, but I feel as though there could be more clarity around the inner edge of the burner.', '2006-08-14 22:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727209, 376056, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great work. I like the pano-style crop you''ve given it too.</td>', 'Great work. I like the pano-style crop you''ve given it too.', '2006-08-14 22:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727211, 380064, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something a bit different from the other entries, but there''s a lot of noise and the branch is oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice to see something a bit different from the other entries, but there''s a lot of noise and the branch is oversharpened.', '2006-08-14 22:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727213, 380022, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice color! I do think the flame needs to be more obvious - its location and shape make it look almost like some kind of leaf. The background has a bit of noise, as well, so it might benefit from a pass through NI.</td>', 'Nice color! I do think the flame needs to be more obvious - its location and shape make it look almost like some kind of leaf. The background has a bit of noise, as well, so it might benefit from a pass through NI.', '2006-08-14 22:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727215, 379942, 45475, '<td valign="top">Yeah, nicely caught. I do like this a lot. Not sure about all the negative space on the right though, composition feels a little unbalanced. But all in all, technically well handled.</td>', 'Yeah, nicely caught. I do like this a lot. Not sure about all the negative space on the right though, composition feels a little unbalanced. But all in all, technically well handled.', '2006-08-14 22:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727226, 379981, 50231, '<td valign="top">This is a hard one. I see the dancer and I see the fire. They are both blurry and blown out/no detail. But I like the idea I just don''t think it was executed quite the way you wanted it. It meets the challenge and I am going to give my base vote on this because you tried. 5<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'This is a hard one. I see the dancer and I see the fire. They are both blurry and blown out/no detail. But I like the idea I just don''t think it was executed quite the way you wanted it. It meets the challenge and I am going to give my base vote on this because you tried. 5 Wazz', '2006-08-14 22:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727227, 379731, 45475, '<td valign="top">Excellent set up. Bit harsh on the contrast (intentional maybe?) and I think this would have been ok as a centered composition. Nonetheless, great challenge entry :)</td>', 'Excellent set up. Bit harsh on the contrast (intentional maybe?) and I think this would have been ok as a centered composition. Nonetheless, great challenge entry :)', '2006-08-14 22:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727236, 378082, 55642, '<td valign="top">In a fire challenge, to stand out, a match photo needs to be really special and  do something truly creative - more than just lighting them. The execution here is okay, though a bit unbalanced with it being off center, and I don''t think this goes far enough into that creative territory.</td>', 'In a fire challenge, to stand out, a match photo needs to be really special and  do something truly creative - more than just lighting them. The execution here is okay, though a bit unbalanced with it being off center, and I don''t think this goes far enough into that creative territory.', '2006-08-14 22:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727237, 379479, 55642, '<td valign="top">The idea is excellent, but the execution is sloppy. the visible line across the bottom and through the middle of the table near the glass kill your surface, and the flames look totally overprocessed. The processing brought out a fair bit of noise, and the whole image needs sharpening. This would have been excellent done much more subtly - keep the glass of peppers as is, fix the surface, tone down the flames (put a but more darkness behind the peppers in the glass), pay more attention to clarity, and keep the photo looking more real.</td>', 'The idea is excellent, but the execution is sloppy. the visible line across the bottom and through the middle of the table near the glass kill your surface, and the flames look totally overprocessed. The processing brought out a fair bit of noise, and the whole image needs sharpening. This would have been excellent done much more subtly - keep the glass of peppers as is, fix the surface, tone down the flames (put a but more darkness behind the peppers in the glass), pay more attention to clarity, and keep the photo looking more real.', '2006-08-14 22:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727238, 378082, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great detail. What a superb close up, well done!</td>', 'Great detail. What a superb close up, well done!', '2006-08-14 22:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727241, 379668, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but not extremely interesting. The "1932" in your title implies that it''s an antique while the Toyota logo is plainly visible.</td>', 'Nice photo, but not extremely interesting. The "1932" in your title implies that it''s an antique while the Toyota logo is plainly visible.', '2006-08-14 22:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727244, 378628, 55642, '<td valign="top">I think a match shot in this challenge needs to be super creatively done to fare well, and nothing about this stands out. The matchstick isn''t perfectly in focus and there''s a bit of image noise to be dealt with.</td>', 'I think a match shot in this challenge needs to be super creatively done to fare well, and nothing about this stands out. The matchstick isn''t perfectly in focus and there''s a bit of image noise to be dealt with.', '2006-08-14 22:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727248, 379584, 62006, '<td valign="top">I think a faster shutter speed could have made this a nice shot with a little more detail in the flames</td>', 'I think a faster shutter speed could have made this a nice shot with a little more detail in the flames', '2006-08-14 22:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727250, 380063, 45475, '<td valign="top">Just a slight clock-wise rotation would have made this feel more symmetrical, however, it is still a stunning piece of work. Well done :)</td>', 'Just a slight clock-wise rotation would have made this feel more symmetrical, however, it is still a stunning piece of work. Well done :)', '2006-08-14 22:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727252, 379484, 55642, '<td valign="top">The marshmallow looks totally flat and a bit green against the supersaturated orange of the flames. I''d like to see warmer tones and more clarity on the marshmallow to bring out the texture and make it look more inviting and appetizing.</td>', 'The marshmallow looks totally flat and a bit green against the supersaturated orange of the flames. I''d like to see warmer tones and more clarity on the marshmallow to bring out the texture and make it look more inviting and appetizing.', '2006-08-14 22:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727257, 379843, 62006, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I am looking forward to seeing how it was done. Good Luck</td>', 'Interesting shot. I am looking forward to seeing how it was done. Good Luck', '2006-08-14 22:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
