(2727294, 380053, 55642, '<td valign="top">the suggestion of fire is there, but some smoke in the distance just doesn''t go far enough to meeting the challenge description. The lens flare above the tree takes center stage. The smoke is an afterthought.</td>', 'the suggestion of fire is there, but some smoke in the distance just doesn''t go far enough to meeting the challenge description. The lens flare above the tree takes center stage. The smoke is an afterthought.', '2006-08-14 22:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
