(2727306, 378520, 55642, '<td valign="top">I think there isn''t enough crisp detail to redeem this concept. I would also like to see the entire bottle, but the top is lost up in the negative space.</td>', 'I think there isn''t enough crisp detail to redeem this concept. I would also like to see the entire bottle, but the top is lost up in the negative space.', '2006-08-14 22:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
