(2727441, 379681, 55642, '<td valign="top">This would be better with more clarity, but mostly it''s just not a very interesting subject.</td>', 'This would be better with more clarity, but mostly it''s just not a very interesting subject.', '2006-08-14 23:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727443, 379754, 55642, '<td valign="top">The flame is very blown out. It took awhile for me to realize what I was looking at, and it''s not a very interesting composition to begin with.</td>', 'The flame is very blown out. It took awhile for me to realize what I was looking at, and it''s not a very interesting composition to begin with.', '2006-08-14 23:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727448, 379003, 55642, '<td valign="top">Very dark and chaotic, not a very appealing composition.</td>', 'Very dark and chaotic, not a very appealing composition.', '2006-08-14 23:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727449, 380001, 55642, '<td valign="top">Intriguing... nice to see something original in this challenge.</td>', 'Intriguing... nice to see something original in this challenge.', '2006-08-14 23:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727450, 379575, 7910, '<td valign="top">Wow, I see it.  Cool.</td>', 'Wow, I see it.  Cool.', '2006-08-14 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727451, 379713, 50231, '<td valign="top">Well I know the DNMC folks have been putting you through the ringer. They have a point but I am sure you know that. It is a beautiful sky! Sky images like this I always shoot and keep but most of the time I think sky''s don''t have a focus I mean No subject. So its easy to get lost in a cloud. So with no fire too! You see where I am going? A mercy 5<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Well I know the DNMC folks have been putting you through the ringer. They have a point but I am sure you know that. It is a beautiful sky! Sky images like this I always shoot and keep but most of the time I think sky''s don''t have a focus I mean No subject. So its easy to get lost in a cloud. So with no fire too! You see where I am going? A mercy 5 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727452, 378948, 55642, '<td valign="top">Intruiging form, but a bit blown out.</td>', 'Intruiging form, but a bit blown out.', '2006-08-14 23:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727454, 379549, 50231, '<td valign="top">SO plain but so very exciting! It''s like it is beckoning someone home ...<br/> <br/>WEIRD <br/> <br/>9<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'SO plain but so very exciting! It''s like it is beckoning someone home ... WEIRD  9 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727455, 380059, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity on the dahlia, but I really am not getting it. Why is the flower not on fire? Why such a tight and tilted crop? It could almost look like a lotus if it were shot straight on with more room around the subject.</td>', 'Nice clarity on the dahlia, but I really am not getting it. Why is the flower not on fire? Why such a tight and tilted crop? It could almost look like a lotus if it were shot straight on with more room around the subject.', '2006-08-14 23:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727457, 379445, 55642, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting composition, sorry.</td>', 'Not a very interesting composition, sorry.', '2006-08-14 23:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727458, 379933, 50231, '<td valign="top">ROCKING A$$ IMAGE! Great capture of fire. (Lucky) LOL<br/> <br/>Said all I had to say.<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'ROCKING A$$ IMAGE! Great capture of fire. (Lucky) LOL Said all I had to say. 9', '2006-08-14 23:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727461, 379696, 55642, '<td valign="top">This could be nice if shot a notch or two further to the right. This exposure is a bit too bright and the colors are dull.</td>', 'This could be nice if shot a notch or two further to the right. This exposure is a bit too bright and the colors are dull.', '2006-08-14 23:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727462, 377109, 55642, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a wider crop and less image noise.</td>', 'I would like to see a wider crop and less image noise.', '2006-08-14 23:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727463, 379117, 55642, '<td valign="top">Cute idea!</td>', 'Cute idea!', '2006-08-14 23:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727464, 380050, 55642, '<td valign="top">Composition is flat, and there''s no reason to cut off the corner of the cigarette box.</td>', 'Composition is flat, and there''s no reason to cut off the corner of the cigarette box.', '2006-08-14 23:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727467, 379981, 55642, '<td valign="top">Dancing Nancy..? Unfortunately the whole thing is very overexposed and not very graceful looking for a dancer.</td>', 'Dancing Nancy..? Unfortunately the whole thing is very overexposed and not very graceful looking for a dancer.', '2006-08-14 23:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727468, 379854, 55642, '<td valign="top">Okay composition, but very noisy.</td>', 'Okay composition, but very noisy.', '2006-08-14 23:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727469, 378683, 55642, '<td valign="top">Much too dark here.</td>', 'Much too dark here.', '2006-08-14 23:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727470, 377891, 55642, '<td valign="top">Decent abstract, but a bit tilted, in need of a very slight counterclockwise rotation.</td>', 'Decent abstract, but a bit tilted, in need of a very slight counterclockwise rotation.', '2006-08-14 23:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727473, 378074, 50231, '<td valign="top">Lot of just flames so I know the subset competition is tough. The biggest thing is focus. I know fire is tricky. I like the shape the the tones are good. I mentioned the sharpness and i would have had it portrait. 6<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Lot of just flames so I know the subset competition is tough. The biggest thing is focus. I know fire is tricky. I like the shape the the tones are good. I mentioned the sharpness and i would have had it portrait. 6 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727474, 379944, 55642, '<td valign="top">There are just too many contextless, dismbodied flame shots in this challenge, and to be honest none of them are terribly interesting. This is much like the Fireworks challenge, where the photos that scored best actually placed them in some kind of context. This one is very flat and noisy.</td>', 'There are just too many contextless, dismbodied flame shots in this challenge, and to be honest none of them are terribly interesting. This is much like the Fireworks challenge, where the photos that scored best actually placed them in some kind of context. This one is very flat and noisy.', '2006-08-14 23:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727475, 379893, 55642, '<td valign="top">There''s no fire here, but the photo itself isn''t bad. Just not right for this challenge.</td>', 'There''s no fire here, but the photo itself isn''t bad. Just not right for this challenge.', '2006-08-14 23:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727480, 379942, 55642, '<td valign="top">This would be better if I could see the people engaged in conversation. They are shoved up in a corner, relegated to darkness and virtual obscurity.</td>', 'This would be better if I could see the people engaged in conversation. They are shoved up in a corner, relegated to darkness and virtual obscurity.', '2006-08-14 23:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727483, 379349, 50231, '<td valign="top">Sure is fire in working for man! Great idea for the challenge. It is OOF and maybe a slightly different angle. But I still say for a fire challenge the fire has to be in color. For these reasons I am giving my base a 5<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Sure is fire in working for man! Great idea for the challenge. It is OOF and maybe a slightly different angle. But I still say for a fire challenge the fire has to be in color. For these reasons I am giving my base a 5 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727484, 379549, 55642, '<td valign="top">The composition here is just boring, nothing special in a field of lots of likewise so-so flame shots. Sorry.</td>', 'The composition here is just boring, nothing special in a field of lots of likewise so-so flame shots. Sorry.', '2006-08-14 23:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727486, 379846, 55642, '<td valign="top">Too dark, and too noisy. The colors have some nice variance, though.</td>', 'Too dark, and too noisy. The colors have some nice variance, though.', '2006-08-14 23:37:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2727487, 378718, 55642, '<td valign="top">The light looks far too unnatural for the setting, and the glare off Joe is distracting.</td>', 'The light looks far too unnatural for the setting, and the glare off Joe is distracting.', '2006-08-14 23:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727489, 379980, 55642, '<td valign="top">Is this fire? Giving you the benefit of the doubt here, it''s difficult to tell what I''m looking at and the composition is rather chaotic.</td>', 'Is this fire? Giving you the benefit of the doubt here, it''s difficult to tell what I''m looking at and the composition is rather chaotic.', '2006-08-14 23:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727490, 379681, 50231, '<td valign="top">First this is a good shot of a candle. Maybe could be a little sharper. But alas just a candle. I dont mean to sound harsh but to win or even place the image must have the WOW factor. Everyone knows what a candle burnig looks like. 5<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'First this is a good shot of a candle. Maybe could be a little sharper. But alas just a candle. I dont mean to sound harsh but to win or even place the image must have the WOW factor. Everyone knows what a candle burnig looks like. 5 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727494, 379879, 55642, '<td valign="top">Too bright, very noisy. I am hoping this is a fake bill, lest you upset some people who don''t have $5 bills to waste.</td>', 'Too bright, very noisy. I am hoping this is a fake bill, lest you upset some people who don''t have $5 bills to waste.', '2006-08-14 23:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727500, 379755, 50231, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! Only one small thing, increase the DoF to get the bottom of the bottle in focus. Very Cool Image 8<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Fun shot! Only one small thing, increase the DoF to get the bottom of the bottle in focus. Very Cool Image 8 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727501, 379713, 55642, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset, though a bit oversaturated in the pinks. Doesn''t really meet the challenge, but not a bad photo overall.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset, though a bit oversaturated in the pinks. Doesn''t really meet the challenge, but not a bad photo overall.', '2006-08-14 23:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727505, 379191, 55642, '<td valign="top">When you''re going for simple, you need to make sure the clarity is spot on perfect. This just isn''t sharp enough.</td>', 'When you''re going for simple, you need to make sure the clarity is spot on perfect. This just isn''t sharp enough.', '2006-08-14 23:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727508, 377601, 55642, '<td valign="top">Very oversaturated, and the flame is way too blown out.</td>', 'Very oversaturated, and the flame is way too blown out.', '2006-08-14 23:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727510, 380021, 55642, '<td valign="top">A bit too much of a shoehorn, but a lovely photo separate from the challenge.</td>', 'A bit too much of a shoehorn, but a lovely photo separate from the challenge.', '2006-08-14 23:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727511, 380043, 50231, '<td valign="top">Good capture of fire works. Tad soft and needs more DoF. I wanted to see more fire than works. But I like it and 6<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Good capture of fire works. Tad soft and needs more DoF. I wanted to see more fire than works. But I like it and 6 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727515, 379862, 50231, '<td valign="top">One of the few cool candle shots! I like the melted wax. Weird flame pattern too. Little soft. 6<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'One of the few cool candle shots! I like the melted wax. Weird flame pattern too. Little soft. 6 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727519, 379844, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hello Neat Image! Not only is the skin way too cartooned by the noise reduction, but it''s oompa loompa orange, and the whites of the eyes are powder blue, with a visible orange streak in the middle od the white to the left of the iris. Not a crisp line to be seen... Not a great combination.</td>', 'Hello Neat Image! Not only is the skin way too cartooned by the noise reduction, but it''s oompa loompa orange, and the whites of the eyes are powder blue, with a visible orange streak in the middle od the white to the left of the iris. Not a crisp line to be seen... Not a great combination.', '2006-08-14 23:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727520, 379575, 45475, '<td valign="top">Goofy, evil? Never! ;) I do see him there though. Great imagination and great capture!</td>', 'Goofy, evil? Never! ;) I do see him there though. Great imagination and great capture!', '2006-08-14 23:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727521, 379447, 55642, '<td valign="top">This would not be bad, but it''s just too small!</td>', 'This would not be bad, but it''s just too small!', '2006-08-14 23:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727522, 379746, 55642, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed, and the flames are very blown out.</td>', 'A bit overexposed, and the flames are very blown out.', '2006-08-14 23:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727525, 379586, 55642, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more clarity here. Might be more interesting with a red pepper instead of the yellow.</td>', 'I''d like to see more clarity here. Might be more interesting with a red pepper instead of the yellow.', '2006-08-14 23:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727526, 377601, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wow, can''t wait to find out how you did this. I likey lots! :)</td>', 'Wow, can''t wait to find out how you did this. I likey lots! :)', '2006-08-14 23:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727530, 379934, 50231, '<td valign="top">SWEET ASS POSE! Killer! 8</td>', 'SWEET ASS POSE! Killer! 8', '2006-08-14 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727531, 379965, 55642, '<td valign="top">The flame is very blown out, it has no dimension at all. Otherwise it''s not a bad concept.</td>', 'The flame is very blown out, it has no dimension at all. Otherwise it''s not a bad concept.', '2006-08-14 23:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727533, 379112, 45475, '<td valign="top">owowowowowowowow... hot burny burnies! :D This is outrageously cool, one of my favs in this challenge.</td>', 'owowowowowowowow... hot burny burnies! :D This is outrageously cool, one of my favs in this challenge.', '2006-08-14 23:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727536, 380004, 50231, '<td valign="top">Very Cool! Perfect Image! 9<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Very Cool! Perfect Image! 9 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727538, 379976, 50231, '<td valign="top">UMMMMMMMMMMM Peppers!<br/> <br/>Nie shot! Great Image! 8<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'UMMMMMMMMMMM Peppers! Nie shot! Great Image! 8 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727539, 378149, 55642, '<td valign="top">The composition here is a bit cluttered. There are too many places to look and so my eye rests on the one sharp line it can find, which is at the furthest point from the flame (upper left corner of the metal bit). In a fire challenge, shouldn''t your eye be drawn to the fire?</td>', 'The composition here is a bit cluttered. There are too many places to look and so my eye rests on the one sharp line it can find, which is at the furthest point from the flame (upper left corner of the metal bit). In a fire challenge, shouldn''t your eye be drawn to the fire?', '2006-08-14 23:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727543, 377724, 54431, '<td valign="top">Now this is a cool photo! Great capture. It''s amazing how much detail you can see in the fire. I also love the expressions of the people behind him. Good Luck!</td>', 'Now this is a cool photo! Great capture. It''s amazing how much detail you can see in the fire. I also love the expressions of the people behind him. Good Luck!', '2006-08-14 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727544, 379837, 50231, '<td valign="top">Very Nice Image! The only thing I would say is more contrast and USM but I really like it. 8</td>', 'Very Nice Image! The only thing I would say is more contrast and USM but I really like it. 8', '2006-08-14 23:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727545, 379974, 55642, '<td valign="top">I''m not digging on the dark line visible along the bottom edge. Tighten the crop a bit and punch up the colors, play with curves to get some dimension, and run it through some noise reduction software, and you might have a nice abstract.</td>', 'I''m not digging on the dark line visible along the bottom edge. Tighten the crop a bit and punch up the colors, play with curves to get some dimension, and run it through some noise reduction software, and you might have a nice abstract.', '2006-08-14 23:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727547, 379579, 55642, '<td valign="top">The flame just looks like a giant blown highlight to me, no dimensionality at all.</td>', 'The flame just looks like a giant blown highlight to me, no dimensionality at all.', '2006-08-14 23:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727550, 379846, 50231, '<td valign="top">Very hard to tell what is going on and what is burning and it is OOF. 4<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Very hard to tell what is going on and what is burning and it is OOF. 4 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727551, 379602, 55642, '<td valign="top">The glass is very interesting, but the flame looks very oversaturated and a touch blown.</td>', 'The glass is very interesting, but the flame looks very oversaturated and a touch blown.', '2006-08-14 23:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727552, 379877, 50231, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and good color. 7<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Nice perspective and good color. 7 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727554, 378764, 50231, '<td valign="top">Cool! Nothing to say but COOL! 8<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'Cool! Nothing to say but COOL! 8 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727556, 379454, 55642, '<td valign="top">The flames just look like giant blown highlights to me. I would try greatly reducing the exposure time, and if you lose visibility of the peppers and tabasco sauce, then some additional front lighting might help.</td>', 'The flames just look like giant blown highlights to me. I would try greatly reducing the exposure time, and if you lose visibility of the peppers and tabasco sauce, then some additional front lighting might help.', '2006-08-14 23:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727560, 379349, 55642, '<td valign="top">OMG where''s his head?? Seriously, the crop is too tight and the whole photo is badly out of focus. It would be nice if the forger had a head. Poor guy.</td>', 'OMG where''s his head?? Seriously, the crop is too tight and the whole photo is badly out of focus. It would be nice if the forger had a head. Poor guy.', '2006-08-14 23:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727564, 379991, 55642, '<td valign="top">Besides just not being a very interesting composition, there''s one speck of orange in the bottom of the upper left quadrant that is very distracting. It''s the first place my eye goes every time.</td>', 'Besides just not being a very interesting composition, there''s one speck of orange in the bottom of the upper left quadrant that is very distracting. It''s the first place my eye goes every time.', '2006-08-14 23:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727565, 380060, 55642, '<td valign="top">Mary is too dark. Up the exposure one click and see what happens.</td>', 'Mary is too dark. Up the exposure one click and see what happens.', '2006-08-14 23:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727570, 379845, 38032, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting - great all around.</td>', 'excellent lighting - great all around.', '2006-08-14 23:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727573, 379454, 50231, '<td valign="top">WoW the Best for last! Superb set up! Great light! The fire is a little blown but I can''t see it. (wink wink) Great Work 9<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'WoW the Best for last! Superb set up! Great light! The fire is a little blown but I can''t see it. (wink wink) Great Work 9 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727574, 378870, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF, nice desat, nice detail in the iris, but I''m not sure that the reflection I''m seeing is a flame. It''s really too small to be the subject of the photo.</td>', 'Nice DoF, nice desat, nice detail in the iris, but I''m not sure that the reflection I''m seeing is a flame. It''s really too small to be the subject of the photo.', '2006-08-14 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727576, 379318, 55642, '<td valign="top">The red here is very oversaturated and the candle flame is one big blown highlight.</td>', 'The red here is very oversaturated and the candle flame is one big blown highlight.', '2006-08-14 23:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727577, 377601, 50231, '<td valign="top">I love illusions! This is a great one! 9<br/> <br/>Wazz</td>', 'I love illusions! This is a great one! 9 Wazz', '2006-08-14 23:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727583, 379877, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, but a bit dark on the rest of the stove and pot. Perhaps some soft diffuse lighting?</td>', 'Nice clarity, but a bit dark on the rest of the stove and pot. Perhaps some soft diffuse lighting?', '2006-08-15 00:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727584, 377717, 55642, '<td valign="top">I absolutely cannot tell that this is a flame.</td>', 'I absolutely cannot tell that this is a flame.', '2006-08-15 00:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727586, 380037, 55642, '<td valign="top">It may be a grill, but there''s no fire to be seen, not even any smoke. The lighting is dark due to the weather and the photo is rather flat.</td>', 'It may be a grill, but there''s no fire to be seen, not even any smoke. The lighting is dark due to the weather and the photo is rather flat.', '2006-08-15 00:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727588, 380055, 55642, '<td valign="top">I see no fire here, just smoke.</td>', 'I see no fire here, just smoke.', '2006-08-15 00:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727591, 378694, 55642, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to use the word "focus" in your title, it''s probably a good idea to make the photo as crisp as possible. As it stands, this is so blurry that I can''t tell that it''s a flame.</td>', 'If you''re going to use the word "focus" in your title, it''s probably a good idea to make the photo as crisp as possible. As it stands, this is so blurry that I can''t tell that it''s a flame.', '2006-08-15 00:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727593, 380017, 55642, '<td valign="top">Is the red in the background supposed to be fire? It doesn''t much look like it.</td>', 'Is the red in the background supposed to be fire? It doesn''t much look like it.', '2006-08-15 00:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727619, 378074, 54540, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing abstract - the more I look, the more I like it!</td>', 'A very pleasing abstract - the more I look, the more I like it!', '2006-08-15 00:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727629, 379924, 25787, '<td valign="top">I''d like to burn mine too.</td>', 'I''d like to burn mine too.', '2006-08-15 00:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727631, 379920, 25787, '<td valign="top">como?</td>', 'como?', '2006-08-15 00:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
