(2727656, 379746, 25787, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The fire is blown out, and the background is too washed out.</td>', 'Good idea.  The fire is blown out, and the background is too washed out.', '2006-08-15 00:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727658, 380046, 45475, '<td valign="top">Dark and frightening. Love it, great work.</td>', 'Dark and frightening. Love it, great work.', '2006-08-15 00:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727662, 380021, 19672, '<td valign="top">Might not do well for this challenge. But it is a superb artistic portrait.</td>', 'Might not do well for this challenge. But it is a superb artistic portrait.', '2006-08-15 00:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727664, 379754, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple composition. Good use of props and light, just enough to reveal the colours on the sticks and holder, but not too dark that we can''t make out surrounding surface texture. Well done :)</td>', 'Nice and simple composition. Good use of props and light, just enough to reveal the colours on the sticks and holder, but not too dark that we can''t make out surrounding surface texture. Well done :)', '2006-08-15 00:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727673, 379670, 45475, '<td valign="top">Niiiice work! Great concept. Looks like this must have been one exciting photo shoot! Well done :)</td>', 'Niiiice work! Great concept. Looks like this must have been one exciting photo shoot! Well done :)', '2006-08-15 00:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727679, 380049, 19672, '<td valign="top">Did you kill this bug??? eeewwwww!!!</td>', 'Did you kill this bug??? eeewwwww!!!', '2006-08-15 00:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727692, 380053, 54540, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition!  Very nice!  More fire would be better, but still - a really good photo!</td>', 'I really like this composition!  Very nice!  More fire would be better, but still - a really good photo!', '2006-08-15 00:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727694, 378870, 62187, '<td valign="top">Your photo is very tasty - like eye-candy! I can''t vote in this challenge, but if I could, I''d give it a 10.</td>', 'Your photo is very tasty - like eye-candy! I can''t vote in this challenge, but if I could, I''d give it a 10.', '2006-08-15 00:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727697, 379845, 54540, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot, I like the lighting alot.  I''m worried about it having enough "fire", but still - lighting, composition, plume, etc...  Well done!</td>', 'Really cool shot, I like the lighting alot.  I''m worried about it having enough "fire", but still - lighting, composition, plume, etc...  Well done!', '2006-08-15 00:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727704, 380056, 38648, '<td valign="top">I really hope this was not done just for the challenge :)</td>', 'I really hope this was not done just for the challenge :)', '2006-08-15 01:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727709, 378165, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wow, gorgeous gradient. The only problem I have with it is the texture to the bottom right - at first glance, it looks more like noise or pixel distortion due to compression, rather than what I''m sure must be the surface under the flame. Original take on the challenge, I likey, but suspect many others may feel differently.<br/> <br/><i>edit to add:</i> HAHA! Very funny. You got me :D</td>', 'Wow, gorgeous gradient. The only problem I have with it is the texture to the bottom right - at first glance, it looks more like noise or pixel distortion due to compression, rather than what I''m sure must be the surface under the flame. Original take on the challenge, I likey, but suspect many others may feel differently. edit to add: HAHA! Very funny. You got me :D', '2006-08-15 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727717, 380057, 38648, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  My only 10</td>', 'Very clever.  My only 10', '2006-08-15 01:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727718, 379858, 38648, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  My dice have ice on them, though. 9</td>', 'Great shot.  My dice have ice on them, though. 9', '2006-08-15 01:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727719, 380004, 38648, '<td valign="top">Great setup. 9</td>', 'Great setup. 9', '2006-08-15 01:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727722, 380057, 6179, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo. I really seem drawn into it for some reason. :-) Looks a bit photoshopped but I like it. I would love to see some outtakes. (10)</td>', 'Awesome photo. I really seem drawn into it for some reason. :-) Looks a bit photoshopped but I like it. I would love to see some outtakes. (10)', '2006-08-15 01:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727723, 379845, 38648, '<td valign="top">I think I smell smoke. 9</td>', 'I think I smell smoke. 9', '2006-08-15 01:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727727, 377797, 38648, '<td valign="top">Why do I hear a Chili''s commercial in my head? 8</td>', 'Why do I hear a Chili''s commercial in my head? 8', '2006-08-15 01:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2727799, 379412, 53316, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for hearts.  I like how you captured "fire" in a non-flame form.  I love how the top edge of the top of the heart blends into the light while the bottom edge of that part is distinct.  I love the color of the heart and the circle and how they go together so well.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for hearts.  I like how you captured "fire" in a non-flame form.  I love how the top edge of the top of the heart blends into the light while the bottom edge of that part is distinct.  I love the color of the heart and the circle and how they go together so well.', '2006-08-15 01:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728057, 378683, 16004, '<td valign="top">one feels if the guy was directly head on partly obscured with a trilby hat might boost its noir quotient a bit...  as it is, i like that it''s quite a moody shot, though it feels that the white balance is a bit off (bit too red for me) and his fingers on his left hand both obscure his face and appear fuzzy in comparison with the rest.  as you can tell, most of my criticisms are regarding his posture; technically (apart from the WB thing) this is really nice.  i especially like the large portions of black; it feels like its enveloping and suffocating your subject (but in a good, cool way). you can also sense the immediate darkness as soon as the lighter goes out.  yeh, this is really evocative in terms of mood and style.  more i look, more i like it.  7.</td>', 'one feels if the guy was directly head on partly obscured with a trilby hat might boost its noir quotient a bit...  as it is, i like that it''s quite a moody shot, though it feels that the white balance is a bit off (bit too red for me) and his fingers on his left hand both obscure his face and appear fuzzy in comparison with the rest.  as you can tell, most of my criticisms are regarding his posture; technically (apart from the WB thing) this is really nice.  i especially like the large portions of black; it feels like its enveloping and suffocating your subject (but in a good, cool way). you can also sense the immediate darkness as soon as the lighter goes out.  yeh, this is really evocative in terms of mood and style.  more i look, more i like it.  7.', '2006-08-15 03:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728062, 379762, 16004, '<td valign="top">nice macro, but it feels like there is almost a depth of field issue going on, as if the flame is some distance behind the match and it doesn''t feel as if the match has actually been lit.  it''s a weird optical illusion i guess.  it''s a nice study of what happens once a match is struck, but i do with the flame element was more defined.  6.</td>', 'nice macro, but it feels like there is almost a depth of field issue going on, as if the flame is some distance behind the match and it doesn''t feel as if the match has actually been lit.  it''s a weird optical illusion i guess.  it''s a nice study of what happens once a match is struck, but i do with the flame element was more defined.  6.', '2006-08-15 03:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728071, 379003, 16004, '<td valign="top">i''m guessing you also has a mirror behind the candles, because there is something very odd going on with the candles at the back left.  i''m also guessing you might have had some preconceived ideas about what you wanted to achieve, and i think the picture suffers as a result; the desire to include the reflections in the bottom half doesn''t really add to the overall picture - i think i''d have cropped it out entirely.  it''s also giving the illusion of being wonky (which voters never like because it''s usually the first thing they see), and it''s far too dark; i think some additional lighting (like a typical flashlight) rather than a longer exposure might have helped, because the way you''ve set the candles up is really nice, almost like a city skyline.  4.</td>', 'i''m guessing you also has a mirror behind the candles, because there is something very odd going on with the candles at the back left.  i''m also guessing you might have had some preconceived ideas about what you wanted to achieve, and i think the picture suffers as a result; the desire to include the reflections in the bottom half doesn''t really add to the overall picture - i think i''d have cropped it out entirely.  it''s also giving the illusion of being wonky (which voters never like because it''s usually the first thing they see), and it''s far too dark; i think some additional lighting (like a typical flashlight) rather than a longer exposure might have helped, because the way you''ve set the candles up is really nice, almost like a city skyline.  4.', '2006-08-15 03:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728091, 379509, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s a dramatic image, but i think it suffers a little from the camera being hand held (use a table if without tripod), and to be honest, the girl dancing around too much.  in terms of composition, i feel that you could get away with having her centred because the right half of the frame looks a bit redundant, and the blur of camaera movement is more apparent here. or alternatively, go mad with the burn tool; you''re allowed to and blackening out a lot of the background would draw principal attention back to the girl. the ghost effect of the girl is a bit unnerving (her second head is creepy!) and the "i''m a little teapot" pose that she''s now doing feels a bit silly...  i do sympathise; i''ve tried shooting similar performers and it''s a right bitch!  6 for the drama and the high difficulty level.</td>', 'it''s a dramatic image, but i think it suffers a little from the camera being hand held (use a table if without tripod), and to be honest, the girl dancing around too much.  in terms of composition, i feel that you could get away with having her centred because the right half of the frame looks a bit redundant, and the blur of camaera movement is more apparent here. or alternatively, go mad with the burn tool; you''re allowed to and blackening out a lot of the background would draw principal attention back to the girl. the ghost effect of the girl is a bit unnerving (her second head is creepy!) and the "i''m a little teapot" pose that she''s now doing feels a bit silly...  i do sympathise; i''ve tried shooting similar performers and it''s a right bitch!  6 for the drama and the high difficulty level.', '2006-08-15 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728095, 379696, 16004, '<td valign="top">this feels a smidgeon over exposed, though it might be the background that gives that impression - just feels to light and bright really.  there''s also weird artefacts along the edge of the candle...  i like that the wick is nice and sharp, and it does work to focus the eye on the flame in the first instance.  but then my eye wanders around and there''s not a lot to absorb.  just doesn''t really grab me, i''m afriad.  sorry.  4.</td>', 'this feels a smidgeon over exposed, though it might be the background that gives that impression - just feels to light and bright really.  there''s also weird artefacts along the edge of the candle...  i like that the wick is nice and sharp, and it does work to focus the eye on the flame in the first instance.  but then my eye wanders around and there''s not a lot to absorb.  just doesn''t really grab me, i''m afriad.  sorry.  4.', '2006-08-15 03:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728104, 379764, 16004, '<td valign="top">regrettably, it''s far too blurry.  and even though it has a nice grain, it (paradoxically) looks like the noise reduction has been overdone...  it''s a weird mix of processing, really.  it''s a great concept, though. 4.</td>', 'regrettably, it''s far too blurry.  and even though it has a nice grain, it (paradoxically) looks like the noise reduction has been overdone...  it''s a weird mix of processing, really.  it''s a great concept, though. 4.', '2006-08-15 03:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728108, 380039, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s an amazingly dynamic and exciting effect, but it is let down somewhat by the blurry person doing it.  if you get her to wear a black coat, black gloves and maybe a black balaclava with no eye holes, and had the heart on it''s own, i think it would prove to be a remarkable piece of symbolic artwork.  but the unavoidable movement lessens the overall impact.  7.</td>', 'it''s an amazingly dynamic and exciting effect, but it is let down somewhat by the blurry person doing it.  if you get her to wear a black coat, black gloves and maybe a black balaclava with no eye holes, and had the heart on it''s own, i think it would prove to be a remarkable piece of symbolic artwork.  but the unavoidable movement lessens the overall impact.  7.', '2006-08-15 04:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728112, 378888, 16004, '<td valign="top">nice; i see the line of a back, and it''s very visually appealing.  the deep orange against the black is also strikingly effective, and looks immediately really cool.  the top of the flame loses its sharply defined edge evident in the rest (might have cropped it out myself) but otherwise very lovely.  8.</td>', 'nice; i see the line of a back, and it''s very visually appealing.  the deep orange against the black is also strikingly effective, and looks immediately really cool.  the top of the flame loses its sharply defined edge evident in the rest (might have cropped it out myself) but otherwise very lovely.  8.', '2006-08-15 04:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728144, 379847, 16004, '<td valign="top">super lovely, albeit slightly scary creepy, stylish image.  lovely ominous sky (oh, weird, i can see two eyes above your character in the clouds staring at the stick - creepy!).  the colours of the image are impressively striking and rich in hues, though in that sort of familiar icelandic way.  your PP skills are really top notch.  i love how the flames glow such a nice bright orange against the rest of the image.  the set up is great, the bent stick, the star wars garb, and the remote feeling environment all add to this.  the fact that your model looks like a younger thinner meatloaf lessens the darkness factor a bit, but other than that, great stuff. 9.</td>', 'super lovely, albeit slightly scary creepy, stylish image.  lovely ominous sky (oh, weird, i can see two eyes above your character in the clouds staring at the stick - creepy!).  the colours of the image are impressively striking and rich in hues, though in that sort of familiar icelandic way.  your PP skills are really top notch.  i love how the flames glow such a nice bright orange against the rest of the image.  the set up is great, the bent stick, the star wars garb, and the remote feeling environment all add to this.  the fact that your model looks like a younger thinner meatloaf lessens the darkness factor a bit, but other than that, great stuff. 9.', '2006-08-15 04:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728170, 380020, 16004, '<td valign="top">"i know" he said "lets do a barbeque - on a lake!".  how anyone comes to this sort of decision is beyond me, but kudos to you for being creative, original and a bit mad.  there is a lot to absorb in this picture; from the pretty flames, to the dramatic sky, the floating bloke and the niceness of the lake.  doesn''t feel too much though, each bit compliments the other. it feels a tad on the dark side (blokes head, specifically) so a spot light or torch might have helped. it''s all totally bonkers of course, and immensly likeable as a result.  8.</td>', '"i know" he said "lets do a barbeque - on a lake!".  how anyone comes to this sort of decision is beyond me, but kudos to you for being creative, original and a bit mad.  there is a lot to absorb in this picture; from the pretty flames, to the dramatic sky, the floating bloke and the niceness of the lake.  doesn''t feel too much though, each bit compliments the other. it feels a tad on the dark side (blokes head, specifically) so a spot light or torch might have helped. it''s all totally bonkers of course, and immensly likeable as a result.  8.', '2006-08-15 04:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728184, 380018, 27133, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  My first 10 for this challenge.</td>', 'Stunning!  My first 10 for this challenge.', '2006-08-15 04:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728185, 378149, 14437, '<td valign="top">Great colour.</td>', 'Great colour.', '2006-08-15 04:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728203, 379760, 16004, '<td valign="top">a gorgeous and exciting image.  i normally consider lightning pictures to be passe and havign seen so many, not really get stirred up by them.  THIS, however, is stunning.  the lightning itself is beautiful, but the way the underside of the cloud is illuminated is starkly beautiful.  i think the amount of sky in the top half is a bit excessive, to be honest, given the beauty of light and colours in the lower third.  it''s a really lovely image.  9.</td>', 'a gorgeous and exciting image.  i normally consider lightning pictures to be passe and havign seen so many, not really get stirred up by them.  THIS, however, is stunning.  the lightning itself is beautiful, but the way the underside of the cloud is illuminated is starkly beautiful.  i think the amount of sky in the top half is a bit excessive, to be honest, given the beauty of light and colours in the lower third.  it''s a really lovely image.  9.', '2006-08-15 04:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728211, 378165, 16004, '<td valign="top">erm.  yes.  good depth of field, nice to see rule of thirds being applied so well....<br/> <br/>i don''t know.  it''s a bit, you know, a bit tooo abstract, perhaps?  maybe?  it''s a nice blue.  very bright.  might have used the burn tool in the top left a bit.  i think you could do with a nice border to set it off.  i''m guessing it does actually meet the challenge.  so 2.</td>', 'erm.  yes.  good depth of field, nice to see rule of thirds being applied so well.... i don''t know.  it''s a bit, you know, a bit tooo abstract, perhaps?  maybe?  it''s a nice blue.  very bright.  might have used the burn tool in the top left a bit.  i think you could do with a nice border to set it off.  i''m guessing it does actually meet the challenge.  so 2.', '2006-08-15 04:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728227, 380050, 16004, '<td valign="top">okay, where there''s smoke there is fire, but i think in the spirit of the challenge fire itself is supposed to be the subject of the picture, rather than just alluded to.  also, the shot suffers due to little seeming to be in focus (apart from the ash tray and filter of the cigarette), bits of ash on the black background (which could have been cloned out) and the composition which includes a wonky ash tray.  3.</td>', 'okay, where there''s smoke there is fire, but i think in the spirit of the challenge fire itself is supposed to be the subject of the picture, rather than just alluded to.  also, the shot suffers due to little seeming to be in focus (apart from the ash tray and filter of the cigarette), bits of ash on the black background (which could have been cloned out) and the composition which includes a wonky ash tray.  3.', '2006-08-15 04:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728239, 379916, 16004, '<td valign="top">surprisingly few burners in this challenge, don''t you think?  i think this is a lovely shot of one; the flames are so well captured that they look tangibly touchable.  i also like the detail and the texture of the black metal element.  it''s a very lovely macro - 8.</td>', 'surprisingly few burners in this challenge, don''t you think?  i think this is a lovely shot of one; the flames are so well captured that they look tangibly touchable.  i also like the detail and the texture of the black metal element.  it''s a very lovely macro - 8.', '2006-08-15 05:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728305, 380061, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and the smoke obscuring the hand helps :o)</td>', 'I like the DOF and the smoke obscuring the hand helps :o)', '2006-08-15 06:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
