(2730351, 379839, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s always bottoms with you Americans!<br/> <br/>Anyway, you need some Dr Scholl on those and some strong antiperspirant. Compositionally it''s adequate, but lacks strength - it''s all a bit, well, just there in front of you. Just putting one foot in front of the other (excuse the pun) would have helped make the shot more dynamic. Good flames and exposure.</td>', 'It''s always bottoms with you Americans! Anyway, you need some Dr Scholl on those and some strong antiperspirant. Compositionally it''s adequate, but lacks strength - it''s all a bit, well, just there in front of you. Just putting one foot in front of the other (excuse the pun) would have helped make the shot more dynamic. Good flames and exposure.', '2006-08-15 18:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730363, 379920, 8860, '<td valign="top">Love the blend of life and death of the flame here. Good comp if a little overexposed.</td>', 'Love the blend of life and death of the flame here. Good comp if a little overexposed.', '2006-08-15 18:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730372, 378078, 8860, '<td valign="top">Bring woman to me - me hungry for woman - me want it now. <br/> <br/>You can drag her by the hair of you like but please organise my request as soon as convenient. Thanks.</td>', 'Bring woman to me - me hungry for woman - me want it now.  You can drag her by the hair of you like but please organise my request as soon as convenient. Thanks.', '2006-08-15 18:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730388, 379847, 41554, '<td valign="top">Wow, very dark, with a mystical mood. I think the sky is perfect, and generally the composition is very good, but I would hide the model''s face (maybe with a hood) and get rid of the wood stick, I find it distracting. But it is a very nice image anyway.</td>', 'Wow, very dark, with a mystical mood. I think the sky is perfect, and generally the composition is very good, but I would hide the model''s face (maybe with a hood) and get rid of the wood stick, I find it distracting. But it is a very nice image anyway.', '2006-08-15 18:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2730396, 380022, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, like the red tones, but I feel the flame is almost lost behind the ice. Also, if the idea is to center the subject, I would use a tighter crop on the right.</td>', 'Nice idea, like the red tones, but I feel the flame is almost lost behind the ice. Also, if the idea is to center the subject, I would use a tighter crop on the right.', '2006-08-15 18:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
