(2730520, 379916, 41554, '<td valign="top">This picture is ok, but I feel it lacks a focus point... I find it difficult to follow the fire "curves". Nice idea though, may work really well with a different angle/perspective.</td>', 'This picture is ok, but I feel it lacks a focus point... I find it difficult to follow the fire "curves". Nice idea though, may work really well with a different angle/perspective.', '2006-08-15 18:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
