(2730532, 378078, 41554, '<td valign="top">Hey what''s with the skin she''s wearing? There really was no need!!! :-)<br/>Seriously though, this is a good idea, and it has been well executed. The use of the fire as the single light source really adds to the prehistoric mood...</td>', 'Hey what''s with the skin she''s wearing? There really was no need!!! :-)Seriously though, this is a good idea, and it has been well executed. The use of the fire as the single light source really adds to the prehistoric mood...', '2006-08-15 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
