(2731274, 379962, 53316, '<td valign="top">I find the border a bit off as a more orange or red tone would have complimented the photo more.  But that is just a nitpick.  Regarding the image, I love how you have captured the sharp detail in the coals and a soft, abstract quality to the flame.  I really like that balance.</td>', 'I find the border a bit off as a more orange or red tone would have complimented the photo more.  But that is just a nitpick.  Regarding the image, I love how you have captured the sharp detail in the coals and a soft, abstract quality to the flame.  I really like that balance.', '2006-08-15 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
