(2731360, 379668, 60614, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot.  And that is coming from a non-smoker.  I love the tones and crispness of this photo.  Excellent.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot.  And that is coming from a non-smoker.  I love the tones and crispness of this photo.  Excellent.', '2006-08-15 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2731373, 379797, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, this purple shot in a sea of reds and oranges is pretty nifty.  Plus I really love the "surreal" or abstract nature of it.  I keep wanting to figure out if that''s a hand in the bottle-shaped ice in the middle.  That''s a bit distracting to me visually, but is interesting to look at.<br/> <br/>Technically the only thing I notice is the gray area to the left of the middle ice piece.  Looks like you played around with colors and had to desaturate one that was not working.  I wouldn''t vote down for the "is that a hand" thing - even though distracting, this IS after all understood to be surreal - but I do feel I have to mark down a tiny bit for the gray.  It just detracts too much, unfortunately.<br/> <br/>But with the beautiful purple swirls and beautifully arranged ice on top of a nicely done background, the visual impact was such that this is definitely one of my favorites.  So don''t get me wrong about the "marking down" bit... this still got a great score from me.</td>', 'Wow, this purple shot in a sea of reds and oranges is pretty nifty.  Plus I really love the "surreal" or abstract nature of it.  I keep wanting to figure out if that''s a hand in the bottle-shaped ice in the middle.  That''s a bit distracting to me visually, but is interesting to look at. Technically the only thing I notice is the gray area to the left of the middle ice piece.  Looks like you played around with colors and had to desaturate one that was not working.  I wouldn''t vote down for the "is that a hand" thing - even though distracting, this IS after all understood to be surreal - but I do feel I have to mark down a tiny bit for the gray.  It just detracts too much, unfortunately. But with the beautiful purple swirls and beautifully arranged ice on top of a nicely done background, the visual impact was such that this is definitely one of my favorites.  So don''t get me wrong about the "marking down" bit... this still got a great score from me.', '2006-08-15 23:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2731374, 380056, 60614, '<td valign="top">Nice usage of thirds.</td>', 'Nice usage of thirds.', '2006-08-15 23:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2731385, 379003, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the image as it is, but would be very interested to see how it might look with the reflection part cropped off.  I know the reflections are sort of the point, hence the title, but I just *adore* the top part of the image and think it could do very well on its own.  Not marking down or anything for that though, just would be curious to see.</td>', 'I like the image as it is, but would be very interested to see how it might look with the reflection part cropped off.  I know the reflections are sort of the point, hence the title, but I just *adore* the top part of the image and think it could do very well on its own.  Not marking down or anything for that though, just would be curious to see.', '2006-08-15 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2731391, 378165, 53316, '<td valign="top">Trying to vote and comment on as many images as possible so here goes.<br/> <br/>This very much does not meet the challenge to me.<br/> <br/>I''d try to be more helpful but since I''ve seen another image almost identical to this one in another recent challenge I''m a bit confused.</td>', 'Trying to vote and comment on as many images as possible so here goes. This very much does not meet the challenge to me. I''d try to be more helpful but since I''ve seen another image almost identical to this one in another recent challenge I''m a bit confused.', '2006-08-15 23:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
