(2731421, 379859, 53316, '<td valign="top">So you''re probably getting marked down by a lot of people since it''s a candid.... but I think it is a fantastic candid.  I love the colors and the lighting.  Gives it a very lively feel, which is appropriate for a party.  I like the interesting angle that you chose for the cake.  I think you did a great job with the timing of the shot, having some candles blown out and others  still lit but obviously being blown out. I do not mind at all that the head of the person is cropped out, and I actually sort of like it this way (more focus on the cake, and therefore the "fire", and less focus on a particular person.)</td>', 'So you''re probably getting marked down by a lot of people since it''s a candid.... but I think it is a fantastic candid.  I love the colors and the lighting.  Gives it a very lively feel, which is appropriate for a party.  I like the interesting angle that you chose for the cake.  I think you did a great job with the timing of the shot, having some candles blown out and others  still lit but obviously being blown out. I do not mind at all that the head of the person is cropped out, and I actually sort of like it this way (more focus on the cake, and therefore the "fire", and less focus on a particular person.)', '2006-08-15 23:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
