(2733950, 379845, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ah, there we go... A shot where there is orange glow inside.  Good job with that, as I feel that shots of smoking things that aren''t really glowing don''t seem as much to fit the challenge.<br/> <br/>I like the title and composition.  Great lighting as I love how the bottom part blends into the background.  The smoke rising is just the right final touch.</td>', 'Ah, there we go... A shot where there is orange glow inside.  Good job with that, as I feel that shots of smoking things that aren''t really glowing don''t seem as much to fit the challenge. I like the title and composition.  Great lighting as I love how the bottom part blends into the background.  The smoke rising is just the right final touch.', '2006-08-16 13:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2733958, 379575, 53316, '<td valign="top">Haha, great title.  Maybe another one would have fit the mood of the photo better but this on certainly draws me in trying to spot the figure in the flame.  I see it and it definitely makes for an interesting (in a good way) take on this concept!</td>', 'Haha, great title.  Maybe another one would have fit the mood of the photo better but this on certainly draws me in trying to spot the figure in the flame.  I see it and it definitely makes for an interesting (in a good way) take on this concept!', '2006-08-16 13:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2733962, 379944, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, elegant indeed.  I love how there is a clear line of where the flame starts - not something I''ve seen in a lot of shots. I think it helps add to the elegance, as well as the soft, almost silky feel of the flame.</td>', 'Wow, elegant indeed.  I love how there is a clear line of where the flame starts - not something I''ve seen in a lot of shots. I think it helps add to the elegance, as well as the soft, almost silky feel of the flame.', '2006-08-16 13:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2733966, 379746, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the composition... I feel maybe better lighting in the background would have brought out the colors there.  Overall a decent shot and a good take on the challenge.</td>', 'I like the composition... I feel maybe better lighting in the background would have brought out the colors there.  Overall a decent shot and a good take on the challenge.', '2006-08-16 13:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2733990, 378718, 53316, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the scene in War of the Worlds where they''re on the hill fighting... <br/> <br/>The only thing I can see that I do not like is the long shadow from the figure - other than that I think this is a great shot.</td>', 'Reminds me of the scene in War of the Worlds where they''re on the hill fighting...  The only thing I can see that I do not like is the long shadow from the figure - other than that I think this is a great shot.', '2006-08-16 13:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734044, 379893, 4267, '<td valign="top">they say where there is smoke there is fire... but not this time</td>', 'they say where there is smoke there is fire... but not this time', '2006-08-16 14:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734051, 379916, 63894, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2006-08-16 14:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734172, 379854, 54731, '<td valign="top">Looks like ISO should have been a little lower, the fire lost detail and the skin is nosisy... 6 for the idea :)</td>', 'Looks like ISO should have been a little lower, the fire lost detail and the skin is nosisy... 6 for the idea :)', '2006-08-16 15:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734186, 380004, 24913, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and photo. Too bad most people won''t get what it is... Oh the perks of being a geek :)</td>', 'Nice idea and photo. Too bad most people won''t get what it is... Oh the perks of being a geek :)', '2006-08-16 15:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734187, 378864, 54731, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks pretty dangerous! And the fire is very well captured, I just wish you didn''t have the other two barrels on the side.</td>', 'Wow, looks pretty dangerous! And the fire is very well captured, I just wish you didn''t have the other two barrels on the side.', '2006-08-16 15:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734191, 377877, 54731, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is but looks interesting</td>', 'Not sure what this is but looks interesting', '2006-08-16 15:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734225, 380021, 50231, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image! Great light, focus and model. With that said I don''t see the fire. The challenge description was real clear on fire. So I can''t in good conscience rate this as high as I would like merely because of the fact that there is no fire in the image. Capturing a portrait is one thing and capturing real FIRE is quite another. I wish you would have at least tried to capture fire with your image. I am sorry for this but I feel it only fair. 3<br/> <br/>Wazz<br/> <br/>Jeesh this image is making me crazy. OK I see the fire yeah I get it and I changed my vote to 6 but that is it ...<br/> <br/>OK last time I just can''t help myself. It is a wonderful image but this is it 7<br/> <br/>I''m a dick ... :-P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-21 22:26:25.</i></td>', 'Fantastic image! Great light, focus and model. With that said I don''t see the fire. The challenge description was real clear on fire. So I can''t in good conscience rate this as high as I would like merely because of the fact that there is no fire in the image. Capturing a portrait is one thing and capturing real FIRE is quite another. I wish you would have at least tried to capture fire with your image. I am sorry for this but I feel it only fair. 3 Wazz Jeesh this image is making me crazy. OK I see the fire yeah I get it and I changed my vote to 6 but that is it ... OK last time I just can''t help myself. It is a wonderful image but this is it 7 I''m a dick ... :-P', '2006-08-16 15:13:42.000000', '2006-08-21 23:26:25.000000', 1),
(2734482, 380004, 15767, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2006-08-16 16:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734542, 379575, 62678, '<td valign="top">great title</td>', 'great title', '2006-08-16 16:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734628, 379898, 56828, '<td valign="top">nice sharp photo.</td>', 'nice sharp photo.', '2006-08-16 16:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734630, 380001, 56828, '<td valign="top">Hard shot to capture..good job.</td>', 'Hard shot to capture..good job.', '2006-08-16 16:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734635, 379939, 56828, '<td valign="top">Hard capture...good job.</td>', 'Hard capture...good job.', '2006-08-16 16:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734638, 379549, 56828, '<td valign="top">great composition...nice location for the tiki torch.</td>', 'great composition...nice location for the tiki torch.', '2006-08-16 16:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734678, 379864, 56828, '<td valign="top">great focus on this shot.</td>', 'great focus on this shot.', '2006-08-16 17:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734685, 379791, 56828, '<td valign="top">The soft focus on the flame works well in this photo.</td>', 'The soft focus on the flame works well in this photo.', '2006-08-16 17:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734775, 379920, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very lovely patterns.  The black smoke is interesting and creative.  I would have liked to see just a *tiny* bit more of the object in the lower right, but that''s not a big deal.</td>', 'Very lovely patterns.  The black smoke is interesting and creative.  I would have liked to see just a *tiny* bit more of the object in the lower right, but that''s not a big deal.', '2006-08-16 17:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734778, 378066, 53316, '<td valign="top">What an amazing combination of foreground and bckground.  The "gleam" on the tooth at first looked like part of the streaks of fire.  I like how the background is visible but not completely - how it fades out on the left side.<br/> <br/>I think this is a *very* awesome image.</td>', 'What an amazing combination of foreground and bckground.  The "gleam" on the tooth at first looked like part of the streaks of fire.  I like how the background is visible but not completely - how it fades out on the left side. I think this is a *very* awesome image.', '2006-08-16 17:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734787, 378685, 53316, '<td valign="top">The top of the arm looks a little bit jagged - maybe an increased file size would help? I''m not sure.  I generally like borders like this one but here it seems to feel a bit like it is cutting off the arm.  Aside from that, though it is a nice image. I like the colors and lighting, and especially how the flames seem to be softly dancing.</td>', 'The top of the arm looks a little bit jagged - maybe an increased file size would help? I''m not sure.  I generally like borders like this one but here it seems to feel a bit like it is cutting off the arm.  Aside from that, though it is a nice image. I like the colors and lighting, and especially how the flames seem to be softly dancing.', '2006-08-16 17:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734793, 379849, 53316, '<td valign="top">I find this image too confusing visually for me (I think the main culprits are the area of the glass as well as the border that makes the flame seem to stop very unnaturally).  But the combination of fire and liquid is very, very awesome, and I like the timing of the shot.</td>', 'I find this image too confusing visually for me (I think the main culprits are the area of the glass as well as the border that makes the flame seem to stop very unnaturally).  But the combination of fire and liquid is very, very awesome, and I like the timing of the shot.', '2006-08-16 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2734899, 379549, 64145, '<td valign="top">I very much like the liquidity of the flame</td>', 'I very much like the liquidity of the flame', '2006-08-16 18:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735254, 379847, 9780, '<td valign="top">#1 Nothing more to say</td>', '#1 Nothing more to say', '2006-08-16 21:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735261, 379933, 9780, '<td valign="top">So scary. Nice capture.</td>', 'So scary. Nice capture.', '2006-08-16 21:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735385, 379974, 64151, '<td valign="top">i think this is so cool. i love how it looks</td>', 'i think this is so cool. i love how it looks', '2006-08-16 22:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735430, 380020, 22970, '<td valign="top">Have to say this is creative. I would of like to have seen more detail in the face. Props for creativity.</td>', 'Have to say this is creative. I would of like to have seen more detail in the face. Props for creativity.', '2006-08-16 23:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735434, 380018, 22970, '<td valign="top">I believe the title is the only thing that ties your photograph to the challenge. A shame because it is a good sky shot.</td>', 'I believe the title is the only thing that ties your photograph to the challenge. A shame because it is a good sky shot.', '2006-08-16 23:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735438, 380061, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very busy and the composition could of been better. Wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Very busy and the composition could of been better. Wish you well in the challenge.', '2006-08-16 23:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735440, 379755, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice balance. Nice color in the fire and I like the border. Good Job.</td>', 'Nice balance. Nice color in the fire and I like the border. Good Job.', '2006-08-16 23:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735449, 379588, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very subtle, pleasing to the eye. Simple but good.</td>', 'Very subtle, pleasing to the eye. Simple but good.', '2006-08-16 23:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735509, 379908, 10985, '<td valign="top">Impressive!</td>', 'Impressive!', '2006-08-16 23:46:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2735514, 379760, 10985, '<td valign="top">Awe inspiring. I would have clone out the little building (?) on the very left.</td>', 'Awe inspiring. I would have clone out the little building (?) on the very left.', '2006-08-16 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735516, 379763, 10985, '<td valign="top">Indeed. Maybe a little overexposed in some areas.</td>', 'Indeed. Maybe a little overexposed in some areas.', '2006-08-16 23:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735520, 379920, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very elegant smoke. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Very elegant smoke. Nicely captured.', '2006-08-16 23:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735523, 379753, 10985, '<td valign="top">Then one really becomes absente (absent)!</td>', 'Then one really becomes absente (absent)!', '2006-08-16 23:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735525, 377797, 10985, '<td valign="top">Quite impressive. It has a commercial feel to it. Well done. (Maybe the reflection should be a little less white on the pepper.)</td>', 'Quite impressive. It has a commercial feel to it. Well done. (Maybe the reflection should be a little less white on the pepper.)', '2006-08-16 23:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735527, 380021, 10985, '<td valign="top">A little overexposure in the face, but I love the movement of her hair. Very flame-like.</td>', 'A little overexposure in the face, but I love the movement of her hair. Very flame-like.', '2006-08-16 23:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735530, 379795, 10985, '<td valign="top">No fear...</td>', 'No fear...', '2006-08-16 23:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735536, 376056, 10985, '<td valign="top">Now this subject is difficult to be original with, but you managed that very well. Excellent point of view and repetition.</td>', 'Now this subject is difficult to be original with, but you managed that very well. Excellent point of view and repetition.', '2006-08-16 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735538, 379670, 10985, '<td valign="top">Quite impressive. It almost looks like a vehicle moving fast.</td>', 'Quite impressive. It almost looks like a vehicle moving fast.', '2006-08-16 23:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735542, 378864, 10985, '<td valign="top">I most certainly hope you didn''t start that for the shot. :S<br/> <br/>But it''s very impressive and "magnetic".</td>', 'I most certainly hope you didn''t start that for the shot. :S But it''s very impressive and "magnetic".', '2006-08-16 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735546, 379690, 10985, '<td valign="top">I won''t answer yes, because many must have done that. But the feeling is conveyed very well and the flames are stunning.</td>', 'I won''t answer yes, because many must have done that. But the feeling is conveyed very well and the flames are stunning.', '2006-08-16 23:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735550, 380059, 10985, '<td valign="top">Don''t tell me no dahlia was hurt in the making, I wouldn''t believe that... Excellent complementary colors and dynamic angle.</td>', 'Don''t tell me no dahlia was hurt in the making, I wouldn''t believe that... Excellent complementary colors and dynamic angle.', '2006-08-16 23:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735551, 378685, 10985, '<td valign="top">Ouch! Excellent set-up. Well composed, well lit, well done!</td>', 'Ouch! Excellent set-up. Well composed, well lit, well done!', '2006-08-16 23:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735553, 379668, 10985, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective, which is hard to do with such a mundane subject.</td>', 'Simple yet effective, which is hard to do with such a mundane subject.', '2006-08-16 23:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735559, 377165, 10985, '<td valign="top">Mmm... Nice clean shot.</td>', 'Mmm... Nice clean shot.', '2006-08-16 23:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735560, 378764, 10985, '<td valign="top">The cost of happiness...</td>', 'The cost of happiness...', '2006-08-16 23:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735562, 379843, 10985, '<td valign="top">Like a movie scene. Quite credible and well done.</td>', 'Like a movie scene. Quite credible and well done.', '2006-08-16 23:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735563, 380065, 10985, '<td valign="top">Ever changing...</td>', 'Ever changing...', '2006-08-17 00:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735569, 378078, 10985, '<td valign="top">Original and quite detailed. Nice glow and composition.</td>', 'Original and quite detailed. Nice glow and composition.', '2006-08-17 00:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735572, 378165, 10985, '<td valign="top">You''re probably going to get hit for this, but I like the daring aspect of it.</td>', 'You''re probably going to get hit for this, but I like the daring aspect of it.', '2006-08-17 00:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735577, 378066, 10985, '<td valign="top">Great dynamics and muted tones. Great composition and stop action.</td>', 'Great dynamics and muted tones. Great composition and stop action.', '2006-08-17 00:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735578, 380056, 10985, '<td valign="top">As I said to someone else, I certainly hope you didn''t start this for a photo. <br/> <br/>Sad and scary.</td>', 'As I said to someone else, I certainly hope you didn''t start this for a photo.  Sad and scary.', '2006-08-17 00:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735579, 378694, 10985, '<td valign="top">Another daring blue fire.</td>', 'Another daring blue fire.', '2006-08-17 00:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735581, 379990, 10985, '<td valign="top">as in Zorro? Well done!</td>', 'as in Zorro? Well done!', '2006-08-17 00:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735583, 379435, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very creative and compelling.</td>', 'Very creative and compelling.', '2006-08-17 00:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735585, 379847, 10985, '<td valign="top">A fantasy world well recreated. Excellent sky, too!</td>', 'A fantasy world well recreated. Excellent sky, too!', '2006-08-17 00:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735586, 379445, 10985, '<td valign="top">Was it a plane? Was it Superman?  ;o)</td>', 'Was it a plane? Was it Superman?  ;o)', '2006-08-17 00:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735588, 379723, 10985, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and mysterious.</td>', 'Beautiful and mysterious.', '2006-08-17 00:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735589, 379923, 10985, '<td valign="top">So crisp, almost too much, as if oversharpened. But still mesmerizing.</td>', 'So crisp, almost too much, as if oversharpened. But still mesmerizing.', '2006-08-17 00:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735592, 379588, 10985, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Excellent work.</td>', 'Beautiful! Excellent work.', '2006-08-17 00:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735594, 377877, 10985, '<td valign="top">Like a dance of ghosts. Mesmerizing!</td>', 'Like a dance of ghosts. Mesmerizing!', '2006-08-17 00:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735595, 379665, 10985, '<td valign="top">Oh great! Excellent moment and simple effectiveness.</td>', 'Oh great! Excellent moment and simple effectiveness.', '2006-08-17 00:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735598, 379916, 10985, '<td valign="top">A beauty!</td>', 'A beauty!', '2006-08-17 00:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735606, 379038, 10985, '<td valign="top">Even the blue sky is almost completely hidden. Sad sight!</td>', 'Even the blue sky is almost completely hidden. Sad sight!', '2006-08-17 00:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735608, 380004, 10985, '<td valign="top">Creative shot of this mundane object. I like you composition and the darkness all around.</td>', 'Creative shot of this mundane object. I like you composition and the darkness all around.', '2006-08-17 00:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735611, 380057, 10985, '<td valign="top">Bad girl! Stunning shot. Top 10 for sure.</td>', 'Bad girl! Stunning shot. Top 10 for sure.', '2006-08-17 00:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735616, 379934, 10985, '<td valign="top">PS for the dancing smoke? Quite impressive!</td>', 'PS for the dancing smoke? Quite impressive!', '2006-08-17 00:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735620, 380031, 10985, '<td valign="top">Hey, well done. Great work on the bulb halo.</td>', 'Hey, well done. Great work on the bulb halo.', '2006-08-17 00:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735623, 379797, 10985, '<td valign="top">Surreal is the word. Excellent colors. Did you invert them?</td>', 'Surreal is the word. Excellent colors. Did you invert them?', '2006-08-17 00:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735626, 379114, 10985, '<td valign="top">Cool shot (well, I mean...). This reminds me of a volcano. I love the little dancing embers.</td>', 'Cool shot (well, I mean...). This reminds me of a volcano. I love the little dancing embers.', '2006-08-17 00:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735631, 379547, 10985, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition.', '2006-08-17 00:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735634, 379974, 10985, '<td valign="top">A simple but compelling shot.</td>', 'A simple but compelling shot.', '2006-08-17 00:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735919, 380065, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice colour in the flame and the title makes the viewer really think instead of sitting back an saying ''its just another flame'' :o)</td>', 'Nice colour in the flame and the title makes the viewer really think instead of sitting back an saying ''its just another flame'' :o)', '2006-08-17 02:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735921, 380001, 48389, '<td valign="top">Looks like this guy knows what he''s doing, like the composition and there''s good colour in the flames :o)</td>', 'Looks like this guy knows what he''s doing, like the composition and there''s good colour in the flames :o)', '2006-08-17 02:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2735923, 379934, 48389, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I even want to know how this was done!! I like that you''ve managed to keep some detail in the flame, the composition is good and the smoke adds to the image :o)</td>', 'I''m not sure I even want to know how this was done!! I like that you''ve managed to keep some detail in the flame, the composition is good and the smoke adds to the image :o)', '2006-08-17 02:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736046, 379908, 33672, '<td valign="top">great capture and interesting comp.Smoke and DOF give it a 3-D effect.</td>', 'great capture and interesting comp.Smoke and DOF give it a 3-D effect.', '2006-08-17 02:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736047, 379440, 31307, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you chose selective desat for this one.  The fire itself loses a lot of emphasis in this shot, I feel.</td>', 'Not sure why you chose selective desat for this one.  The fire itself loses a lot of emphasis in this shot, I feel.', '2006-08-17 02:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736049, 379547, 31307, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Nice metering.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Nice metering.', '2006-08-17 02:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736102, 379847, 45475, '<td valign="top">Gosh this is wonderful. Almost doesn''t look real. Good tones, contrast and story. So well done.</td>', 'Gosh this is wonderful. Almost doesn''t look real. Good tones, contrast and story. So well done.', '2006-08-17 03:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736105, 379934, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh, you''ve got to be kidding me... this is pure brilliance! Fantastic original effort for the challenge, I hope you do well with this.</td>', 'Oh, you''ve got to be kidding me... this is pure brilliance! Fantastic original effort for the challenge, I hope you do well with this.', '2006-08-17 03:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736107, 378851, 45475, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Imaginative, I love it. Skillful photography + good storytelling = 10</td>', 'Back to comment: Imaginative, I love it. Skillful photography + good storytelling = 10', '2006-08-17 03:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736108, 379920, 45475, '<td valign="top">Veramente un scatto perfetto. Riesco solo a dire: stupenda. Spero che prenda un ribbon, complimenti - 10! :)<br/> <br/>Came back to comment. Gee, ummm, I hope you''re italian and it''s not just the title ;-D</td>', 'Veramente un scatto perfetto. Riesco solo a dire: stupenda. Spero che prenda un ribbon, complimenti - 10! :) Came back to comment. Gee, ummm, I hope you''re italian and it''s not just the title ;-D', '2006-08-17 03:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736109, 379858, 45475, '<td valign="top">Came back to add to favs and comment: This has got to be a ribbon, or at the very least, a top 5. If I was to nitpick about anything at all, it would be the border - not the photography. Only because (as thin as it is) it distracts me somewhat from the illusion of firey dice free-falling in ''space''. Good luck in the challenge, hope to see you on the front page :)</td>', 'Came back to add to favs and comment: This has got to be a ribbon, or at the very least, a top 5. If I was to nitpick about anything at all, it would be the border - not the photography. Only because (as thin as it is) it distracts me somewhat from the illusion of firey dice free-falling in ''space''. Good luck in the challenge, hope to see you on the front page :)', '2006-08-17 03:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736110, 377877, 45475, '<td valign="top">Now this... this is exquisite. Can''t wait to see the techs after the challenge. Fav.</td>', 'Now this... this is exquisite. Can''t wait to see the techs after the challenge. Fav.', '2006-08-17 03:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736111, 379791, 45475, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier and back now to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful. I love the fact that you chose a textured glass. For me, it adds a little more interest and sets it apart from similar shots. I wish there had been more light at the base, but since I can relate to the difficulties with these shots, I''m not about to vote you down for it. - 10</td>', 'Voted earlier and back now to comment. Beautiful. I love the fact that you chose a textured glass. For me, it adds a little more interest and sets it apart from similar shots. I wish there had been more light at the base, but since I can relate to the difficulties with these shots, I''m not about to vote you down for it. - 10', '2006-08-17 03:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736112, 379454, 45475, '<td valign="top">WOW! That''s hot! This is a fab entry, well done to you :) 9 (better make that a 10)</td>', 'WOW! That''s hot! This is a fab entry, well done to you :) 9 (better make that a 10)', '2006-08-17 03:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736113, 379755, 45475, '<td valign="top">This is cool :) I had hoped someone would do the Sambuca and you''ve done it well. Unsure if it''s just that my eyes are failing me today, but the focus seems a touch soft? Love it all the same :)</td>', 'This is cool :) I had hoped someone would do the Sambuca and you''ve done it well. Unsure if it''s just that my eyes are failing me today, but the focus seems a touch soft? Love it all the same :)', '2006-08-17 03:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
