(2736752, 379763, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the background a lot - it is a very nice color that compliments the green in the pasta.  Your concept is unique and interesting.  There is haloing around the fork, however, and that is a little distracting.  Overall a nice, appealing shot.</td>', 'I like the background a lot - it is a very nice color that compliments the green in the pasta.  Your concept is unique and interesting.  There is haloing around the fork, however, and that is a little distracting.  Overall a nice, appealing shot.', '2006-08-17 14:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736756, 378888, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hm, I think the title is very appropriate, because the first thing I see when I look at this is the back of a pair of flare-leg jeans. :-)<br/> <br/>The photo is simple and elegant, but it says "fire" a little bit less to me than it would if the flame were a little more complex.  However, I really like the composition and I think overall this is a great shot.</td>', 'Hm, I think the title is very appropriate, because the first thing I see when I look at this is the back of a pair of flare-leg jeans. :-) The photo is simple and elegant, but it says "fire" a little bit less to me than it would if the flame were a little more complex.  However, I really like the composition and I think overall this is a great shot.', '2006-08-17 14:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736765, 378628, 53316, '<td valign="top">Your title is a little cumbersome for me, as is the border. But for the shot itself, I think you captured the act of striking a match very well.  I especially like how the match fades into the background.</td>', 'Your title is a little cumbersome for me, as is the border. But for the shot itself, I think you captured the act of striking a match very well.  I especially like how the match fades into the background.', '2006-08-17 14:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736770, 379447, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aw, wow - beautiful colors.  And I love the way that the black surrounds part of the image.  I am such a fan of rainbow colors and I love what this sky shows.  I also like how the torch is brightly lit without being too bright or taking away from the background.<br/> <br/>Of course it would have been so much better at a larger size (max 640 pixels allowed) so I could see all of the beauty and appreciate it more!</td>', 'Aw, wow - beautiful colors.  And I love the way that the black surrounds part of the image.  I am such a fan of rainbow colors and I love what this sky shows.  I also like how the torch is brightly lit without being too bright or taking away from the background. Of course it would have been so much better at a larger size (max 640 pixels allowed) so I could see all of the beauty and appreciate it more!', '2006-08-17 14:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736773, 380038, 53316, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but perhaps a different color background would help give this image some impact (as is, it is a little flat for me)</td>', 'Good concept, but perhaps a different color background would help give this image some impact (as is, it is a little flat for me)', '2006-08-17 14:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736777, 379974, 53316, '<td valign="top">Elegant, simple, beautiful.  Your title pulled me into the image and made me better appreciate the composition.</td>', 'Elegant, simple, beautiful.  Your title pulled me into the image and made me better appreciate the composition.', '2006-08-17 14:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
