(2736806, 379930, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful setup. I love the way the light shines in that star pattern, from the candle and also on the vase.</td>', 'Very beautiful setup. I love the way the light shines in that star pattern, from the candle and also on the vase.', '2006-08-17 14:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736810, 380055, 53316, '<td valign="top">You may have gotten negative comments about this but let me say that I love the grain/noise! I think it can definitely work for this type of shot.  I feel like this doesn''t meet the challenge as much as I would like, because even though it''s related to fire, it does not involve fire.  But, on its own, I think it is a really nice shot - composed well, good colors and lighting.. I love the subject-as-negative-space thing going on here.</td>', 'You may have gotten negative comments about this but let me say that I love the grain/noise! I think it can definitely work for this type of shot.  I feel like this doesn''t meet the challenge as much as I would like, because even though it''s related to fire, it does not involve fire.  But, on its own, I think it is a really nice shot - composed well, good colors and lighting.. I love the subject-as-negative-space thing going on here.', '2006-08-17 14:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
