(2737056, 379668, 62009, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-08-17 15:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737059, 380001, 62009, '<td valign="top">I might have cloned out the glare in the helmet</td>', 'I might have cloned out the glare in the helmet', '2006-08-17 15:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737061, 380056, 62009, '<td valign="top">could be a bit brighter</td>', 'could be a bit brighter', '2006-08-17 15:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737110, 379933, 50935, '<td valign="top">nice capture.</td>', 'nice capture.', '2006-08-17 15:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737156, 379923, 24913, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail and clarity!</td>', 'Amazing detail and clarity!', '2006-08-17 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737167, 380053, 61244, '<td valign="top">unfortunately there is no fire - <br/>smoke usually means fire but not always</td>', 'unfortunately there is no fire - smoke usually means fire but not always', '2006-08-17 16:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737170, 379762, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp focus you have on the match itself.  Great use of contrast and reds.</td>', 'I like the sharp focus you have on the match itself.  Great use of contrast and reds.', '2006-08-17 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737172, 378066, 56828, '<td valign="top">Your background adds a great effect to the shot.</td>', 'Your background adds a great effect to the shot.', '2006-08-17 16:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737189, 378764, 56828, '<td valign="top">nice unique shot.</td>', 'nice unique shot.', '2006-08-17 16:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737195, 380057, 56828, '<td valign="top">Don''t quite get the title, but a great photo.  I just bumped it up an extra point.   Man Firemen get all the ladies....</td>', 'Don''t quite get the title, but a great photo.  I just bumped it up an extra point.   Man Firemen get all the ladies....', '2006-08-17 16:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737204, 380020, 50935, '<td valign="top">Wow! looks like fun on a perfect evening. awesome shot!!! One of the best. I see a ribbon in the near future.</td>', 'Wow! looks like fun on a perfect evening. awesome shot!!! One of the best. I see a ribbon in the near future.', '2006-08-17 16:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737206, 378066, 50935, '<td valign="top">Great shot and composition. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Great shot and composition. One of my top picks.', '2006-08-17 16:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737208, 379847, 50935, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Nice composition. One of my top picks.', '2006-08-17 16:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737211, 380018, 50935, '<td valign="top">You should do very well with this. Nice or better yet Great shot.</td>', 'You should do very well with this. Nice or better yet Great shot.', '2006-08-17 16:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737213, 378864, 50935, '<td valign="top">love detail on this</td>', 'love detail on this', '2006-08-17 16:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737216, 380021, 50935, '<td valign="top">lovely .... flowing. One of my top picks.</td>', 'lovely .... flowing. One of my top picks.', '2006-08-17 16:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737221, 380057, 50935, '<td valign="top">Can''t be any better than... Awesome shot. This must have taken some time to take. The models, costume, etc. 10</td>', 'Can''t be any better than... Awesome shot. This must have taken some time to take. The models, costume, etc. 10', '2006-08-17 16:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737252, 380059, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fabulous colors here and the focus is great.  I wish there was a bit more light coming in on the side just to brighten it up a touch more.  Also I think composing it so that black portion in the bottom left corner was gone would give the image a more seamless look - tilting the subject (or camera) so that it appears to be rising up out of the corner rather than just cropping and losing some of the interesting features would probably be best.  Other than that I think its a great entry.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Fabulous colors here and the focus is great.  I wish there was a bit more light coming in on the side just to brighten it up a touch more.  Also I think composing it so that black portion in the bottom left corner was gone would give the image a more seamless look - tilting the subject (or camera) so that it appears to be rising up out of the corner rather than just cropping and losing some of the interesting features would probably be best.  Other than that I think its a great entry.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-17 16:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737260, 380016, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fire here.  Love the contrasts in color and the lighting looks good.  The focus seems to be off in some areas, to be expected when dealing with fire as a subject I think.  Nice composition but I''m not sure I like the white border, even though its rather thin it still seems to draw attention to itself rather than just frame the image.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Beautiful fire here.  Love the contrasts in color and the lighting looks good.  The focus seems to be off in some areas, to be expected when dealing with fire as a subject I think.  Nice composition but I''m not sure I like the white border, even though its rather thin it still seems to draw attention to itself rather than just frame the image.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-17 16:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737268, 380057, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice entry.  Photos with an easily recognizable story are fun.  Good colors here, lighting looks good too.  There''s some weirdness in the uniform, not sure what, has a strange muted aspect like its been neat imaged, maybe some other PP was done to it.  I''m not sure if seeing the man''s eyes would be better or not, the fact that they are shadowed makes me want to see them yet it does lend a bit of mystery and anonymity to him.  The blurry heel of the woman''s left foot is a tad distracting so if more of it were in shadow the image would be even better.  Only other thing is the bit of string from the woman''s underwear or lingerie that is showing on her thigh.  Normally probably not a big thing, but due to the position she''s in and the light highlighting that area it becomes noticeable and a little distracting.  Overall a very good image that coupled with the title has a great story to tell - without the title all sorts of other stories can easily be found it in too which is a great thing.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Nice entry.  Photos with an easily recognizable story are fun.  Good colors here, lighting looks good too.  There''s some weirdness in the uniform, not sure what, has a strange muted aspect like its been neat imaged, maybe some other PP was done to it.  I''m not sure if seeing the man''s eyes would be better or not, the fact that they are shadowed makes me want to see them yet it does lend a bit of mystery and anonymity to him.  The blurry heel of the woman''s left foot is a tad distracting so if more of it were in shadow the image would be even better.  Only other thing is the bit of string from the woman''s underwear or lingerie that is showing on her thigh.  Normally probably not a big thing, but due to the position she''s in and the light highlighting that area it becomes noticeable and a little distracting.  Overall a very good image that coupled with the title has a great story to tell - without the title all sorts of other stories can easily be found it in too which is a great thing.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-17 16:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737293, 380031, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the simple centered composition, the colors are nice and the border works well.  I think the focus needs a bit of work though, the gold/brass portions should be very sharp and clear but they have a lot of softness to them, my guess is because of low light levels.  The lack of sharp focus really impacts this negatively for me, I''m giving a 5.  Were it much sharper (not just sharpened) I''d probably give a 7.</td>', 'I like the simple centered composition, the colors are nice and the border works well.  I think the focus needs a bit of work though, the gold/brass portions should be very sharp and clear but they have a lot of softness to them, my guess is because of low light levels.  The lack of sharp focus really impacts this negatively for me, I''m giving a 5.  Were it much sharper (not just sharpened) I''d probably give a 7.', '2006-08-17 17:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737297, 377724, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great action here, high drama.  I love the stopped motion aspect of this.  Nice detailing and you''ve controlled most of the natural light.  The focus looks good though a bit soft on the body of the fire-eater/spitter.  I do wish you''d been able to get more of a side view of him so half of his face and his red mohawk? would be even more visible.  Not sure if that turn to the side would also have a better background or not.  Finally I wish the fireball wasn''t cut off at the top.  Still this is a fun image.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Great action here, high drama.  I love the stopped motion aspect of this.  Nice detailing and you''ve controlled most of the natural light.  The focus looks good though a bit soft on the body of the fire-eater/spitter.  I do wish you''d been able to get more of a side view of him so half of his face and his red mohawk? would be even more visible.  Not sure if that turn to the side would also have a better background or not.  Finally I wish the fireball wasn''t cut off at the top.  Still this is a fun image.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-17 17:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737309, 380021, 61313, '<td valign="top">Great Shot, Beautiful Model</td>', 'Great Shot, Beautiful Model', '2006-08-17 17:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737326, 379847, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful backdrop to compliment your fire.   Wow!  So far, my pick for the top spot!  10</td>', 'What a beautiful backdrop to compliment your fire.   Wow!  So far, my pick for the top spot!  10', '2006-08-17 17:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737329, 379665, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed.  Everything about yoru fire and the matches is so clean and sharp.  Great job on this one.</td>', 'Nicely executed.  Everything about yoru fire and the matches is so clean and sharp.  Great job on this one.', '2006-08-17 17:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737332, 379760, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful.   I am in awe of amazing lightning photos -- which this one is!  Loveit for this challenge too.</td>', 'This is very beautiful.   I am in awe of amazing lightning photos -- which this one is!  Loveit for this challenge too.', '2006-08-17 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737385, 377877, 63870, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and artistic.</td>', 'Beautiful and artistic.', '2006-08-17 17:57:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2737442, 380057, 51146, '<td valign="top">Now that is HOT!</td>', 'Now that is HOT!', '2006-08-17 18:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737538, 378165, 47541, '<td valign="top">Blue for brown huh?  if it weren''t for seeing the same/similar shot in 3 challenges I''d take this seriously.</td>', 'Blue for brown huh?  if it weren''t for seeing the same/similar shot in 3 challenges I''d take this seriously.', '2006-08-17 19:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737539, 380037, 47541, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the fire!  I know where it is but I think for this challenge you need to show fire itself</td>', 'I can''t see the fire!  I know where it is but I think for this challenge you need to show fire itself', '2006-08-17 19:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737540, 379349, 47541, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W was not a good choice for this challenge.  The OOF feel also doesnt aid this shot.</td>', 'B&W was not a good choice for this challenge.  The OOF feel also doesnt aid this shot.', '2006-08-17 19:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737544, 379297, 47541, '<td valign="top">Feels like a snaphot</td>', 'Feels like a snaphot', '2006-08-17 19:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737546, 378694, 47541, '<td valign="top">Too close to the flame!  It''s just a blur :(</td>', 'Too close to the flame!  It''s just a blur :(', '2006-08-17 19:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737555, 377891, 47541, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer it if the top and bottom had the same amount of light showing, also if the middle wasn''t black, ie: if it looked like one candle.</td>', 'I''d prefer it if the top and bottom had the same amount of light showing, also if the middle wasn''t black, ie: if it looked like one candle.', '2006-08-17 19:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737561, 380053, 47541, '<td valign="top">Too much glare from the sun</td>', 'Too much glare from the sun', '2006-08-17 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737574, 380049, 47541, '<td valign="top">No bugs died in the making of this photo (I hope)!  Cropped a bit too tight at the top as I feel it would be better to show all of the flame and concentrate less on the bug</td>', 'No bugs died in the making of this photo (I hope)!  Cropped a bit too tight at the top as I feel it would be better to show all of the flame and concentrate less on the bug', '2006-08-17 19:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737577, 379713, 47541, '<td valign="top">Lacks the "wow'' factor required for this challenge</td>', 'Lacks the "wow'' factor required for this challenge', '2006-08-17 19:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737579, 379730, 47541, '<td valign="top">Good idea but this has a snapshot feel to it</td>', 'Good idea but this has a snapshot feel to it', '2006-08-17 19:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737580, 379617, 47541, '<td valign="top">The poster takes up too much of the photo IMO and it makes the fire element seem almost incidental</td>', 'The poster takes up too much of the photo IMO and it makes the fire element seem almost incidental', '2006-08-17 19:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737582, 379864, 47541, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I''d like to have seen something other than the flame in the shot to give it some context</td>', 'Good idea but I''d like to have seen something other than the flame in the shot to give it some context', '2006-08-17 19:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737583, 377109, 47541, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W doesn''t help this shot</td>', 'B&W doesn''t help this shot', '2006-08-17 19:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737585, 379980, 47541, '<td valign="top">I''m just confused as to what I''m looking at - other than the title I can''t see the link to fire</td>', 'I''m just confused as to what I''m looking at - other than the title I can''t see the link to fire', '2006-08-17 19:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737586, 378718, 47541, '<td valign="top">Not as good as some of the other "army men" shots I''ve seen - I think the poor lighting on the soldier is the main problem</td>', 'Not as good as some of the other "army men" shots I''ve seen - I think the poor lighting on the soldier is the main problem', '2006-08-17 19:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737589, 380055, 47541, '<td valign="top">Good idea and I think you would have pulled it off if the ceiling light wasn''t in shot but was behind the fireman to enhance the silhouette</td>', 'Good idea and I think you would have pulled it off if the ceiling light wasn''t in shot but was behind the fireman to enhance the silhouette', '2006-08-17 19:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737592, 379746, 47541, '<td valign="top">The flames "on" the cards don''''t really come across as flames!?!</td>', 'The flames "on" the cards don''''t really come across as flames!?!', '2006-08-17 19:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737598, 380057, 47541, '<td valign="top">I think the title lets the image down to be honest - a nice tounge-in-cheek image</td>', 'I think the title lets the image down to be honest - a nice tounge-in-cheek image', '2006-08-17 19:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737600, 379974, 47541, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really get across the flames in a "wow" kind of way</td>', 'Doesn''t really get across the flames in a "wow" kind of way', '2006-08-17 19:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737601, 379760, 47541, '<td valign="top">The lightning is great but...level the horizon and crop out lots of the sky where it is just dark</td>', 'The lightning is great but...level the horizon and crop out lots of the sky where it is just dark', '2006-08-17 20:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737604, 379417, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  The border is a bit distracting given the simple content of the image and the flame could do with being a bit crisper</td>', 'Nice and simple.  The border is a bit distracting given the simple content of the image and the flame could do with being a bit crisper', '2006-08-17 20:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737605, 379859, 47541, '<td valign="top">Too busy around the candles - would like to see less of the other stuff</td>', 'Too busy around the candles - would like to see less of the other stuff', '2006-08-17 20:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737608, 379990, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great but two things let this down - the ''bluring" in the flame just above your head and the lack of fire in the middle of the "Z"</td>', 'Great but two things let this down - the ''bluring" in the flame just above your head and the lack of fire in the middle of the "Z"', '2006-08-17 20:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737610, 379942, 47541, '<td valign="top">Has too much of a snapshot feel</td>', 'Has too much of a snapshot feel', '2006-08-17 20:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737724, 379191, 47541, '<td valign="top">It is nice and simple which I like but I think it could do with being cropped tighter</td>', 'It is nice and simple which I like but I think it could do with being cropped tighter', '2006-08-17 21:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737728, 378864, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great - I''d like more of the flame in shot though - cutting it off at the top pulls my attention to the drums and away from the fire</td>', 'Great - I''d like more of the flame in shot though - cutting it off at the top pulls my attention to the drums and away from the fire', '2006-08-17 21:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737734, 380064, 47541, '<td valign="top">A slightly faster shutter speed would have made this better i think</td>', 'A slightly faster shutter speed would have made this better i think', '2006-08-17 21:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737736, 379991, 47541, '<td valign="top">It''s ok but lacks something to focus on and go "wow"</td>', 'It''s ok but lacks something to focus on and go "wow"', '2006-08-17 21:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737740, 379659, 47541, '<td valign="top">Although the title says you cut it off intentionally that doesn''t change the fact that the image would be better if you hadn''t.</td>', 'Although the title says you cut it off intentionally that doesn''t change the fact that the image would be better if you hadn''t.', '2006-08-17 21:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737743, 379579, 47541, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I''d like to see the top of the flame in shot though</td>', 'Very nice - I''d like to see the top of the flame in shot though', '2006-08-17 21:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737759, 380059, 47541, '<td valign="top">Good idea - I think rotating so the flower is level and not cut off would make this even better</td>', 'Good idea - I think rotating so the flower is level and not cut off would make this even better', '2006-08-17 21:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737762, 380038, 47541, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark and the glass seems titled</td>', 'A bit too dark and the glass seems titled', '2006-08-17 21:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737765, 380022, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the flame is not "in'' the glass enough - it looks like there is a candle behind the glass and I''m sure that''s not the look you were going for</td>', 'Great idea but the flame is not "in'' the glass enough - it looks like there is a candle behind the glass and I''m sure that''s not the look you were going for', '2006-08-17 21:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737766, 379846, 47541, '<td valign="top">This has the feel of a snapshot of a campfire :(</td>', 'This has the feel of a snapshot of a campfire :(', '2006-08-17 21:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737768, 379469, 47541, '<td valign="top">This should have been cropped a lot tighter and the vast blackness draws my eye away from the card</td>', 'This should have been cropped a lot tighter and the vast blackness draws my eye away from the card', '2006-08-17 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737771, 379584, 47541, '<td valign="top">The colour of the fire needs to be enhanced so it jumps out more</td>', 'The colour of the fire needs to be enhanced so it jumps out more', '2006-08-17 21:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737775, 379877, 47541, '<td valign="top">It took a while for me to understand that there is wok on the burners - I think it''s the general darkeness that let''s this image down a bit</td>', 'It took a while for me to understand that there is wok on the burners - I think it''s the general darkeness that let''s this image down a bit', '2006-08-17 21:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737778, 379117, 47541, '<td valign="top">Funny but given the title I''d like to see homer lit up and in colour - a long exposure and a flashlight on homer after the fire painting?</td>', 'Funny but given the title I''d like to see homer lit up and in colour - a long exposure and a flashlight on homer after the fire painting?', '2006-08-17 21:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737779, 379795, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice material but feels like a snapshot</td>', 'Nice material but feels like a snapshot', '2006-08-17 21:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737781, 379879, 47541, '<td valign="top">Too close for my liking as the "5" on the bill catches my eye more than the flame</td>', 'Too close for my liking as the "5" on the bill catches my eye more than the flame', '2006-08-17 21:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737783, 379447, 47541, '<td valign="top">Straighten the torch up and crop out the thing at the bottom</td>', 'Straighten the torch up and crop out the thing at the bottom', '2006-08-17 21:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737784, 377432, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the flames</td>', 'Nice capture of the flames', '2006-08-17 21:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737787, 378683, 47541, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer a much tighter crop so we could see some of the detail on the mans face</td>', 'I''d prefer a much tighter crop so we could see some of the detail on the mans face', '2006-08-17 21:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737788, 379930, 47541, '<td valign="top">the flower in the frame seems to add nothing to this shot</td>', 'the flower in the frame seems to add nothing to this shot', '2006-08-17 21:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737789, 379435, 47541, '<td valign="top">A different angle on a common theme - I don''t like the textured background though - I''d also like more of the flame tails in shot</td>', 'A different angle on a common theme - I don''t like the textured background though - I''d also like more of the flame tails in shot', '2006-08-17 21:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737791, 380004, 47541, '<td valign="top">I''d like this cropped tighter to see more detail in the fire area</td>', 'I''d like this cropped tighter to see more detail in the fire area', '2006-08-17 21:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737794, 379003, 47541, '<td valign="top">the reflections are great and I''d maybe have just included them as the candles themselves seem a bit busy in comparison</td>', 'the reflections are great and I''d maybe have just included them as the candles themselves seem a bit busy in comparison', '2006-08-17 21:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737795, 379586, 47541, '<td valign="top">The exposure was a bit too long as the flames have lost a lot of their detail which is a shame</td>', 'The exposure was a bit too long as the flames have lost a lot of their detail which is a shame', '2006-08-17 21:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
