(2737839, 379927, 55838, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  I think this one is my favorite (don''t tell my husband<br/>since he entered Fire II).  I love the gray tones and the contrasting bright fire.  I can feel the warmth in all that chill.  Bumping you up to 9.  Good luck.</td>', 'Gorgeous!  I think this one is my favorite (don''t tell my husbandsince he entered Fire II).  I love the gray tones and the contrasting bright fire.  I can feel the warmth in all that chill.  Bumping you up to 9.  Good luck.', '2006-08-17 21:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
