(2738432, 378685, 21606, '<td valign="top">Nice. Reminds me of x-men. Top 5.</td>', 'Nice. Reminds me of x-men. Top 5.', '2006-08-18 00:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738815, 379843, 53316, '<td valign="top">I really love all the different elements here - it just does not seem to me that they blend together very well.  But still, it is a nice photo and definitely a take on the challenge that I like.</td>', 'I really love all the different elements here - it just does not seem to me that they blend together very well.  But still, it is a nice photo and definitely a take on the challenge that I like.', '2006-08-18 02:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738819, 379445, 53316, '<td valign="top">The border''s a bit distracting to me but the shot itself is very nice.  I like how it looks like a comet.</td>', 'The border''s a bit distracting to me but the shot itself is very nice.  I like how it looks like a comet.', '2006-08-18 02:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738822, 379731, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. Awesome concept.  Awesome execution.  I love how the brown fades into the background... maybe the matches on the left could be a bit less tilted to the left? But that''s not a big thing.  You have really captured, I think, what your title says, and you definitely evoked emotions from me.</td>', 'Oh wow. Awesome concept.  Awesome execution.  I love how the brown fades into the background... maybe the matches on the left could be a bit less tilted to the left? But that''s not a big thing.  You have really captured, I think, what your title says, and you definitely evoked emotions from me.', '2006-08-18 02:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738824, 379879, 53316, '<td valign="top">A sharper focus may have helped, but more than that I think there''s a problem with how the flame sort of becomes the background.  At least for me, there''s not enough of a distinction there.  But I do like the composition and concept.</td>', 'A sharper focus may have helped, but more than that I think there''s a problem with how the flame sort of becomes the background.  At least for me, there''s not enough of a distinction there.  But I do like the composition and concept.', '2006-08-18 02:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738829, 379696, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great title. I love the colors as well as the horizontal background and the overall composition.  I think I like the candle being soft... maybe others would prefer it in sharper focus, but I think this image works really well when viewed in a more abstract way.  There''s a little bit of haloing that I notice around the candle - should try a larger file size if you can.  I really like this image.</td>', 'Great title. I love the colors as well as the horizontal background and the overall composition.  I think I like the candle being soft... maybe others would prefer it in sharper focus, but I think this image works really well when viewed in a more abstract way.  There''s a little bit of haloing that I notice around the candle - should try a larger file size if you can.  I really like this image.', '2006-08-18 02:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738831, 378074, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ooooh pretty.  Reminds me of calligraphy.  Noise is a bit distracting for me but overall a nice photo.</td>', 'Ooooh pretty.  Reminds me of calligraphy.  Noise is a bit distracting for me but overall a nice photo.', '2006-08-18 02:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738837, 379844, 53316, '<td valign="top">Probably would have been a better shot without so much softening.. but as digital art, I really love it.</td>', 'Probably would have been a better shot without so much softening.. but as digital art, I really love it.', '2006-08-18 02:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738838, 377797, 53316, '<td valign="top">Border makes me feel as though the flames are being unnaturally cut off at the top and left.  Otherwise, I like the shot - especially how the pepper seems to go through the fire.</td>', 'Border makes me feel as though the flames are being unnaturally cut off at the top and left.  Otherwise, I like the shot - especially how the pepper seems to go through the fire.', '2006-08-18 02:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738840, 378764, 53316, '<td valign="top">A nice change from the black-background shots.  Very dynamic, good colors and lighting.. makes me wish I had been there! (And I''m not a racing fan, so that says a lot about what I think of this shot)</td>', 'A nice change from the black-background shots.  Very dynamic, good colors and lighting.. makes me wish I had been there! (And I''m not a racing fan, so that says a lot about what I think of this shot)', '2006-08-18 02:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738841, 379547, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  The magenta color is kind of throwing me off a little, but that is not a huge issue.  I love the composition, and the colors on the lake contrasted with the fire.</td>', 'Very beautiful.  The magenta color is kind of throwing me off a little, but that is not a huge issue.  I love the composition, and the colors on the lake contrasted with the fire.', '2006-08-18 02:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738842, 379862, 53316, '<td valign="top">A larger file size should help with noise. I think this woul dhave been better if the candle had been standing straight up instead of leaning. But I love the shape of the flame, and how the candle blends into the background so nicely.</td>', 'A larger file size should help with noise. I think this woul dhave been better if the candle had been standing straight up instead of leaning. But I love the shape of the flame, and how the candle blends into the background so nicely.', '2006-08-18 02:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738844, 379549, 53316, '<td valign="top">You should try a larger filesize.. no real issues here but it will help in future.  I love the swirling flame and the interesting but not distracting background.</td>', 'You should try a larger filesize.. no real issues here but it will help in future.  I love the swirling flame and the interesting but not distracting background.', '2006-08-18 02:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738846, 379681, 53316, '<td valign="top">More contrast may have helped? However, I absolutely love the shapes here, especially the shape of the light around the flame.</td>', 'More contrast may have helped? However, I absolutely love the shapes here, especially the shape of the light around the flame.', '2006-08-18 02:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738849, 379846, 53316, '<td valign="top">More focus needed, I think.  I like the colors of the flame.</td>', 'More focus needed, I think.  I like the colors of the flame.', '2006-08-18 02:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738851, 379991, 53316, '<td valign="top">What can I say besides.. "beautiful"?</td>', 'What can I say besides.. "beautiful"?', '2006-08-18 02:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738905, 380021, 64232, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of fire.....thinking outside of the box. I love this picture.</td>', 'Nice interpretation of fire.....thinking outside of the box. I love this picture.', '2006-08-18 04:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
