(2740742, 380018, 54585, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting from the sun, which is fire.</td>', 'Very nice lighting from the sun, which is fire.', '2006-08-18 23:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740743, 379447, 54585, '<td valign="top">Nice color in the sky, but the tiki seems overexposed for the shot.</td>', 'Nice color in the sky, but the tiki seems overexposed for the shot.', '2006-08-18 23:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740748, 379584, 54585, '<td valign="top">A lot of fire here, but the color seems off.  Other than a big blaze I''m not sure what we''re looking at.</td>', 'A lot of fire here, but the color seems off.  Other than a big blaze I''m not sure what we''re looking at.', '2006-08-18 23:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740754, 379665, 54585, '<td valign="top">Neat idea</td>', 'Neat idea', '2006-08-18 23:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740765, 379003, 54585, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked it better without the mirror on the left and maybe just the reflection off the table.</td>', 'I think I would have liked it better without the mirror on the left and maybe just the reflection off the table.', '2006-08-18 23:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740921, 378082, 53316, '<td valign="top">The unlit match looks a bit out of place to me, but other than that I really like the shot.  I especially like how the matches are in different stages of being burnt - visually is very engaging to me.  That''s why the unlit match is there, thematically, I''m supposing, but it does not work visually for me.</td>', 'The unlit match looks a bit out of place to me, but other than that I really like the shot.  I especially like how the matches are in different stages of being burnt - visually is very engaging to me.  That''s why the unlit match is there, thematically, I''m supposing, but it does not work visually for me.', '2006-08-19 01:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740925, 380046, 53316, '<td valign="top">Eeee!   I like this shot for technical reasons, and the content definitely makes an impact.  Very creepy and dramatic and effective.</td>', 'Eeee!   I like this shot for technical reasons, and the content definitely makes an impact.  Very creepy and dramatic and effective.', '2006-08-19 01:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740941, 379673, 53316, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Absolutely lovely.  Maybe I would prefer it cropped tighter on top to remove the smaller figures? To me, they do not fit so much in the overall composition.  Still though, I like the photo, and the smaller figures do not really detract from the shot too much.<br/> <br/>One thing to keep in mind for future is to keep your file size to as close to 150KB as possible to increase image quality.</td>', 'Lovely.  Absolutely lovely.  Maybe I would prefer it cropped tighter on top to remove the smaller figures? To me, they do not fit so much in the overall composition.  Still though, I like the photo, and the smaller figures do not really detract from the shot too much. One thing to keep in mind for future is to keep your file size to as close to 150KB as possible to increase image quality.', '2006-08-19 01:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740947, 380016, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! I love the colors and the overall shape of the flame.  I think your title is appropriate as there is so much motion and life in this photo.  The white is a bit distracting for me, but not too bad.</td>', 'Awesome shot! I love the colors and the overall shape of the flame.  I think your title is appropriate as there is so much motion and life in this photo.  The white is a bit distracting for me, but not too bad.', '2006-08-19 01:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740960, 378870, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness. So amazingly, amazingly wonderful.  There are some things that I think voters as a whole will not like... maybe how the colors don''t "pop" enough or maybe this part or that part needs to be in more focus or something else.  But I think this is an outstanding shot.  It meets the challenge in such a creative way.  The colors, while understated, fit very well what the image is, I feel, trying to portray.  The iris is dramatic but draws attention toward the reflection of the candle rather than keeping it all for itself.<br/> <br/>So, to sum up... amazing.<br/> <br/>(I personally would have cropped this really tight around the iris.  But I think that''s why I don''t score very well, hehe ;-) This is totally not a criticism or complaint or anything... in fact I think you cropped it wonderfully.  I hope all that makes sense.)</td>', 'Oh my goodness. So amazingly, amazingly wonderful.  There are some things that I think voters as a whole will not like... maybe how the colors don''t "pop" enough or maybe this part or that part needs to be in more focus or something else.  But I think this is an outstanding shot.  It meets the challenge in such a creative way.  The colors, while understated, fit very well what the image is, I feel, trying to portray.  The iris is dramatic but draws attention toward the reflection of the candle rather than keeping it all for itself. So, to sum up... amazing. (I personally would have cropped this really tight around the iris.  But I think that''s why I don''t score very well, hehe ;-) This is totally not a criticism or complaint or anything... in fact I think you cropped it wonderfully.  I hope all that makes sense.)', '2006-08-19 01:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740961, 378694, 53316, '<td valign="top">Nice title... seems like a newspaper headline and I like how that is paired with such an abstract image.  I like this... I don''t think that it really shows "fire" (would not do that without your title) but I do think it''s a nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice title... seems like a newspaper headline and I like how that is paired with such an abstract image.  I like this... I don''t think that it really shows "fire" (would not do that without your title) but I do think it''s a nice abstract.', '2006-08-19 01:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740965, 379792, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, colors, and focus.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, colors, and focus.', '2006-08-19 01:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740986, 379588, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, very pretty and elegant.  I like the colors.</td>', 'Ooooh, very pretty and elegant.  I like the colors.', '2006-08-19 02:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740993, 377877, 53316, '<td valign="top">Whoo! Awesome colors! I love the way this photo says both "hot" and "cool" at the same time. And great choice of border color as well.</td>', 'Whoo! Awesome colors! I love the way this photo says both "hot" and "cool" at the same time. And great choice of border color as well.', '2006-08-19 02:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740995, 379509, 53316, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would have helped eliminate some of the background, which I find somewhat distracting.  But I love the way she appears in different places at the same time - really cool.</td>', 'A tighter crop would have helped eliminate some of the background, which I find somewhat distracting.  But I love the way she appears in different places at the same time - really cool.', '2006-08-19 02:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2740998, 379584, 53316, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit flat to me but I think the composition is wonderful, and overall this is a good shot.</td>', 'The colors seem a bit flat to me but I think the composition is wonderful, and overall this is a good shot.', '2006-08-19 02:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741003, 379916, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhh... amazing title, and composition, and gradients.. and focus...<br/> <br/>I should try commenting when I''m more awake, heh.<br/> <br/>But yes. I like this image a lot. :-)</td>', 'Ohhhhh... amazing title, and composition, and gradients.. and focus... I should try commenting when I''m more awake, heh. But yes. I like this image a lot. :-)', '2006-08-19 02:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741012, 379927, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think what makes this image so awesome is this:  the surroundings are so beautiful and impressive looking, but that has the potential to draw attention away from the fire in a composition like this.  But the colors of the surroundings are understated (while still being pretty), so the fire is what the eye is drawn to more.</td>', 'I think what makes this image so awesome is this:  the surroundings are so beautiful and impressive looking, but that has the potential to draw attention away from the fire in a composition like this.  But the colors of the surroundings are understated (while still being pretty), so the fire is what the eye is drawn to more.', '2006-08-19 02:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741020, 376056, 53316, '<td valign="top">Border is too big for my tastes. But as for the photo itself, I really like it.  Very good composition.</td>', 'Border is too big for my tastes. But as for the photo itself, I really like it.  Very good composition.', '2006-08-19 02:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741027, 377165, 53316, '<td valign="top">LOL - great title.  I love the way the flames from the two ends merge and form one flame (the black spot in the middle really intrigued me)</td>', 'LOL - great title.  I love the way the flames from the two ends merge and form one flame (the black spot in the middle really intrigued me)', '2006-08-19 02:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741095, 379114, 53316, '<td valign="top">While I wish the foreground were in more focus, I do love the patterns that the light makes.</td>', 'While I wish the foreground were in more focus, I do love the patterns that the light makes.', '2006-08-19 03:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741314, 380057, 27133, '<td valign="top">Yep...the ribbon for sure!</td>', 'Yep...the ribbon for sure!', '2006-08-19 08:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741520, 379412, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and I like the composition, only thing that distracts me is the blown out bit (flame?) at the top of the heart (MHO)</td>', 'Nice idea and I like the composition, only thing that distracts me is the blown out bit (flame?) at the top of the heart (MHO)', '2006-08-19 11:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741524, 379849, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the ''splash'' effect you have achieved and the fire looks good mixed in amongst the liquid :o)</td>', 'I like the ''splash'' effect you have achieved and the fire looks good mixed in amongst the liquid :o)', '2006-08-19 11:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741526, 379920, 48389, '<td valign="top">Really good colour in the flame and I like the rising black smoke :o)</td>', 'Really good colour in the flame and I like the rising black smoke :o)', '2006-08-19 11:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2741527, 378149, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but would like to see more of a flame rather than a blue ''band'' (MHO)</td>', 'I like the idea but would like to see more of a flame rather than a blue ''band'' (MHO)', '2006-08-19 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
