(2742485, 379659, 40370, '<td valign="top">The "don''t try" part is cool but I''d rather have the title say "this is a" instead of the cropping intention. I think I''d appreciate this image more if I knew what I was seeing. All the sparks or flying debris add an element that a lot of other entries don''t have.</td>', 'The "don''t try" part is cool but I''d rather have the title say "this is a" instead of the cropping intention. I think I''d appreciate this image more if I knew what I was seeing. All the sparks or flying debris add an element that a lot of other entries don''t have.', '2006-08-19 22:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
