(2743636, 379934, 38032, '<td valign="top">I almost missed the smoke here. The tongue is in great focus as well as the matches but the fire itself seems just a bit too blurry or  monochromatic or something.  The setup must have been fun for this and for the most part it works - the way it''s lit the smoke looks great - the nostrils  and fire itself are my only cricisms here  - the overall feeling of this would probably be better  without the light on the nose.</td>', 'I almost missed the smoke here. The tongue is in great focus as well as the matches but the fire itself seems just a bit too blurry or  monochromatic or something.  The setup must have been fun for this and for the most part it works - the way it''s lit the smoke looks great - the nostrils  and fire itself are my only cricisms here  - the overall feeling of this would probably be better  without the light on the nose.', '2006-08-20 14:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
