(2743991, 379114, 11923, '<td valign="top">Love the streams, nice color too.  The rock? looks rather unfocused but I think its fine since most of the action and thus attention is centered on the light streams which have nice focus and clarity.  Composition is good, though I think I''d prefer the image without the rock thing altogether and have it be a more abstract photo with the light twirls.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Love the streams, nice color too.  The rock? looks rather unfocused but I think its fine since most of the action and thus attention is centered on the light streams which have nice focus and clarity.  Composition is good, though I think I''d prefer the image without the rock thing altogether and have it be a more abstract photo with the light twirls.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-20 18:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743992, 379908, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Certainly meets the challenge and has an interesting subject besides the fire aspect.  I wish the lighting was just a bit brighter and the focus a little deeper but its still an image I can find myself looking at for awhile.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Great image.  Certainly meets the challenge and has an interesting subject besides the fire aspect.  I wish the lighting was just a bit brighter and the focus a little deeper but its still an image I can find myself looking at for awhile.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-20 18:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743993, 378078, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this image.  Nice story-telling, the clarity around the fire is great.  Good tones.  I wish I could see the woman''s face more and have her a bit more in focus as well.  I gave a 6</td>', 'I like the idea behind this image.  Nice story-telling, the clarity around the fire is great.  Good tones.  I wish I could see the woman''s face more and have her a bit more in focus as well.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-20 18:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743994, 380053, 29748, '<td valign="top">The smoke gets lost in the clouds here, without the title, I wouldnt understand.</td>', 'The smoke gets lost in the clouds here, without the title, I wouldnt understand.', '2006-08-20 18:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743995, 378864, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Nice fire cloud.  Definitely meets the challenge.  Interested in finding out how you took this without (presumedly) killing yourself and others!  I like the color scheme and the definition in the firecloud is nice.  I would probably crop about half an inch off the top to give the cloud a uniform feel and maybe just a little more fill light coming in from the left.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Wow!  Nice fire cloud.  Definitely meets the challenge.  Interested in finding out how you took this without (presumedly) killing yourself and others!  I like the color scheme and the definition in the firecloud is nice.  I would probably crop about half an inch off the top to give the cloud a uniform feel and maybe just a little more fill light coming in from the left.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-20 18:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743996, 378764, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, control of the natural light is good.  Certainly meets the challenge.  I think technically its a great image, the subject doesn''t draw me in however.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Great clarity, control of the natural light is good.  Certainly meets the challenge.  I think technically its a great image, the subject doesn''t draw me in however.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-20 18:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743997, 379845, 29748, '<td valign="top">simple elegance.</td>', 'simple elegance.', '2006-08-20 18:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743999, 379976, 29748, '<td valign="top">good idea</td>', 'good idea', '2006-08-20 18:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744000, 379965, 29748, '<td valign="top">your very brave</td>', 'your very brave', '2006-08-20 18:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744001, 380046, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image.  The flames look great, the skull thingie very scary.  I do wish the skull was a bit more prominent in the picture, I find myself needing to strain a bit to find the details in the face, so I''m not sure if maybe a slight fill light (or a bit stronger one if you were using one already) would help?.  Not too much through as part of the interest is the shadowed nature, just enough to bring out a bit more of the detail in the skull.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Great image.  The flames look great, the skull thingie very scary.  I do wish the skull was a bit more prominent in the picture, I find myself needing to strain a bit to find the details in the face, so I''m not sure if maybe a slight fill light (or a bit stronger one if you were using one already) would help?.  Not too much through as part of the interest is the shadowed nature, just enough to bring out a bit more of the detail in the skull.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-20 18:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744002, 380063, 29748, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2006-08-20 18:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
