(2744008, 379839, 29748, '<td valign="top">Great Idea, way to be creative.</td>', 'Great Idea, way to be creative.', '2006-08-20 18:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744012, 379939, 29748, '<td valign="top">Great timing.</td>', 'Great timing.', '2006-08-20 18:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744018, 378948, 29748, '<td valign="top">Weird looking</td>', 'Weird looking', '2006-08-20 18:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744022, 379858, 29748, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2006-08-20 18:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744029, 379440, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I like the choice of selective desaturation, really makes your subject stand out.  The image is very crisp and clean and the expression on the girl''s face is excellent, very emotive.  Obviously meets the challenge.  The few nitpics I have is the arms look overly processed a bit, particularly in the bicep area to me, sort of soft and slightly blurred.  I also wish I could see more of the girl''s face, especially with that happy look she has.  Quite lovely.  I gave 6</td>', 'Great image.  I like the choice of selective desaturation, really makes your subject stand out.  The image is very crisp and clean and the expression on the girl''s face is excellent, very emotive.  Obviously meets the challenge.  The few nitpics I have is the arms look overly processed a bit, particularly in the bicep area to me, sort of soft and slightly blurred.  I also wish I could see more of the girl''s face, especially with that happy look she has.  Quite lovely.  I gave 6', '2006-08-20 18:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744033, 379980, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the abstract nature of this.  The colors are great, the focus looks good on parts of it, I do wish the depth was deeper or touched on more of the brownish areas.   I like the contrast of the cool colors against the darker brown/blacks.  Composition is good, the image is a tad busy which makes it difficult to find a place for my eye to rest but in an overall sense it works together nicely.  I gave a 6</td>', 'I love the abstract nature of this.  The colors are great, the focus looks good on parts of it, I do wish the depth was deeper or touched on more of the brownish areas.   I like the contrast of the cool colors against the darker brown/blacks.  Composition is good, the image is a tad busy which makes it difficult to find a place for my eye to rest but in an overall sense it works together nicely.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-20 18:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744036, 379847, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent all around.  Great storytelling.  The technicals (focus, lighting, composition) are all great.  I don''t really see anything I would change to be honest.  Nothing jumps out either as a glaring issue or even a nitpick.  I''m bumping from 8 to 10.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent all around.  Great storytelling.  The technicals (focus, lighting, composition) are all great.  I don''t really see anything I would change to be honest.  Nothing jumps out either as a glaring issue or even a nitpick.  I''m bumping from 8 to 10.  Nicely done.', '2006-08-20 18:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744041, 379974, 11923, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful.  I think this is a great entry.  I''m not sure if you could''ve gotten the fire to look sharper and I''m not even sure that''s needed.  The softness is a great aspect in itself so its a tough call whether sharp would''ve made the image as appealing.  I definitely love the colors and the simple arching shapes are wonderful.  Very nicely envisioned and captured.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Simple and beautiful.  I think this is a great entry.  I''m not sure if you could''ve gotten the fire to look sharper and I''m not even sure that''s needed.  The softness is a great aspect in itself so its a tough call whether sharp would''ve made the image as appealing.  I definitely love the colors and the simple arching shapes are wonderful.  Very nicely envisioned and captured.  I gave a 7', '2006-08-20 18:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744045, 377797, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great composition, great fire, great colors.  I like the idea and the lighting looks to be just right.   There seems to be a bit of harshness in some areas with the lighting but overall its fine.  The focus is good, though seems soft on the ends of the pepper, possibly because of the lighting?  Not sure.  Nice entry.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Great composition, great fire, great colors.  I like the idea and the lighting looks to be just right.   There seems to be a bit of harshness in some areas with the lighting but overall its fine.  The focus is good, though seems soft on the ends of the pepper, possibly because of the lighting?  Not sure.  Nice entry.  I gave a 7', '2006-08-20 18:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744046, 380056, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice editorial/photojournalistic image.  Even though there''s quite a bit of smoke around, it could almost appear as if the fire is starting right before our eyes.  I love the contrast between the orange flames and the deep pine trees.  I also like the rawness of the image.  Maybe its just me but there''s almost a visible wince to this shot where I can only think of destruction that''ll soon engulf the rest of those trees.   Nicely captured, I hope you were at a safe distance.   I gave a 7</td>', 'Nice editorial/photojournalistic image.  Even though there''s quite a bit of smoke around, it could almost appear as if the fire is starting right before our eyes.  I love the contrast between the orange flames and the deep pine trees.  I also like the rawness of the image.  Maybe its just me but there''s almost a visible wince to this shot where I can only think of destruction that''ll soon engulf the rest of those trees.   Nicely captured, I hope you were at a safe distance.   I gave a 7', '2006-08-20 18:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744052, 377877, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love this.  There''s a very celestial feel to this for me.  The colors are great and the composition is very nice.  It looks like this was done on a mirror, so the reflection is inevitable but I think I''d like it even better if there were nothing but black at the base, so everything is growing upwards.  I think the softish focus works here and the lighting is perfect.  I don''t know how the fire was controlled or if any special substance was used but I think it''d be cool (if its possible) to get some sort of graceful figure/figuring in the middle of the flames without it burning up. Added dimension and all that as this really gives me the impression of a sort of Venus rising.  Anyway, great job!  I gave a 7</td>', 'I love this.  There''s a very celestial feel to this for me.  The colors are great and the composition is very nice.  It looks like this was done on a mirror, so the reflection is inevitable but I think I''d like it even better if there were nothing but black at the base, so everything is growing upwards.  I think the softish focus works here and the lighting is perfect.  I don''t know how the fire was controlled or if any special substance was used but I think it''d be cool (if its possible) to get some sort of graceful figure/figuring in the middle of the flames without it burning up. Added dimension and all that as this really gives me the impression of a sort of Venus rising.  Anyway, great job!  I gave a 7', '2006-08-20 18:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744056, 379547, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the seascape and the way the orange/pink/red tones of the fire contrast with the cooler blues of the water.   The silhouetting is very nice and keeps that part of the image simple so the fire can play center stage.  Nice focus and the composition is great.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the seascape and the way the orange/pink/red tones of the fire contrast with the cooler blues of the water.   The silhouetting is very nice and keeps that part of the image simple so the fire can play center stage.  Nice focus and the composition is great.  I gave a 7', '2006-08-20 18:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744061, 379760, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great capture of an overcast day burned to make it look like a thunderstorm!<br/>; )<br/> <br/>Fantastic sense of scale with some great turmoil in the clouds. A little scary too.</td>', 'Great capture of an overcast day burned to make it look like a thunderstorm!; ) Fantastic sense of scale with some great turmoil in the clouds. A little scary too.', '2006-08-20 18:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744062, 379792, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like this image, there''s nice clarity and contrast with the main subject and the lighting is excellent there.  I do think this would be more powerful if the hand was cropped out.  There is a lot of life, clarity and action in the sparks and whatnot so it makes the duller, less lit fingers look subpar in comparison.   Cropping the fingers out instantly keeps the attention on the spark area and leaves it there, nothing for the eye to wander to.  I gave a 5 but without the fingers I would''ve rated it in the 6 for sure possibly 7.</td>', 'I like this image, there''s nice clarity and contrast with the main subject and the lighting is excellent there.  I do think this would be more powerful if the hand was cropped out.  There is a lot of life, clarity and action in the sparks and whatnot so it makes the duller, less lit fingers look subpar in comparison.   Cropping the fingers out instantly keeps the attention on the spark area and leaves it there, nothing for the eye to wander to.  I gave a 5 but without the fingers I would''ve rated it in the 6 for sure possibly 7.', '2006-08-20 18:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744064, 380056, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely isolated subject. Good one.</td>', 'Nicely isolated subject. Good one.', '2006-08-20 18:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744067, 379447, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the sunset in the background and the fact that the torch has a nice bit of clarity is good.  I wish the lighting wasn''t quite so harsh on the torch though.  The small size of the image detracts a bit as well.  If a reshoot is possible, I''d suggest a slightly different perspective so that you don''t have those white things at the bottom of the torch, without having to crop out some of the deeper colors of the sky.  I gave a 5</td>', 'I like the sunset in the background and the fact that the torch has a nice bit of clarity is good.  I wish the lighting wasn''t quite so harsh on the torch though.  The small size of the image detracts a bit as well.  If a reshoot is possible, I''d suggest a slightly different perspective so that you don''t have those white things at the bottom of the torch, without having to crop out some of the deeper colors of the sky.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 18:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744069, 379933, 8860, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to simply plonk a flame in front of the camera then this is the way to do it as it looks very appealing. The profile of Beelezebub looks good. Nice texture, definition and depth of colour, but not keen on border though.</td>', 'If you''re going to simply plonk a flame in front of the camera then this is the way to do it as it looks very appealing. The profile of Beelezebub looks good. Nice texture, definition and depth of colour, but not keen on border though.', '2006-08-20 18:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744074, 378066, 11923, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment and I think this is a fantastic image.  Great movement and action.  I love the graffiti art in the background and your choice of highlighting it really works well.  The focus is excellent, the control of the lighting is perfect.  Everything that needs to be seen is very well lit but not so much that its harsh or unattractive.  I started this at a placeholder 5 but the more I look at it, the more I see different elements that have been handled very well and the more I like it.  Bumping to an 8 and adding a favorite.</td>', 'Coming back to comment and I think this is a fantastic image.  Great movement and action.  I love the graffiti art in the background and your choice of highlighting it really works well.  The focus is excellent, the control of the lighting is perfect.  Everything that needs to be seen is very well lit but not so much that its harsh or unattractive.  I started this at a placeholder 5 but the more I look at it, the more I see different elements that have been handled very well and the more I like it.  Bumping to an 8 and adding a favorite.', '2006-08-20 18:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744077, 380018, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''d be surprised if this doesn''t have a coloured gif alongside tomorrow. Great shot, well observed drama in the sky.</td>', 'I''d be surprised if this doesn''t have a coloured gif alongside tomorrow. Great shot, well observed drama in the sky.', '2006-08-20 18:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744078, 379924, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fun image.  I like the idea and the composition is spot on.  I wish the lighting was a bit better on the ball/tee and the focus was stronger on the flaming club though.  Something like this needs to be tack sharp to me simply because it has a simple set composition and the eye is riveted to the two subjects.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Fun image.  I like the idea and the composition is spot on.  I wish the lighting was a bit better on the ball/tee and the focus was stronger on the flaming club though.  Something like this needs to be tack sharp to me simply because it has a simple set composition and the eye is riveted to the two subjects.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 18:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744080, 379845, 11923, '<td valign="top">Some great focus here.  Certainly meets the challenge.  Good contrast between the subject and the background.  There''s some strange.. pixelling or something in the cigar after the label though that''s somewhat weird and I''m not sure why its there, compression maybe?  The lighting looks good and the composition is simple but effective.  The subject doesn''t interest me much though.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Some great focus here.  Certainly meets the challenge.  Good contrast between the subject and the background.  There''s some strange.. pixelling or something in the cigar after the label though that''s somewhat weird and I''m not sure why its there, compression maybe?  The lighting looks good and the composition is simple but effective.  The subject doesn''t interest me much though.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 18:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744084, 379939, 11923, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  Has some interesting colors too.  The lighting looks okay but the focus seems slightly off, not quite sharp enough to start with, maybe more fill light is needed. Not sure.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  Has some interesting colors too.  The lighting looks okay but the focus seems slightly off, not quite sharp enough to start with, maybe more fill light is needed. Not sure.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 18:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744086, 379114, 8860, '<td valign="top">Shame the casm wasn''t still her - very interesting nonetheless. Strong image and love the trails.</td>', 'Shame the casm wasn''t still her - very interesting nonetheless. Strong image and love the trails.', '2006-08-20 18:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744091, 380013, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like this image, the lines of the cage are great.  The contrast of the fire and the blackened iron/steel looks nice too.  Lighting looks okay, focus looks good but could probably be somewhat sharper.  I wish it had been rotated 90 degrees too.  When I tilt my head I can see the flame almost as a figure that''s trapped behind cage bars and that notion makes the image even more interesting to me.  Just a thought though!  I gave a 5</td>', 'I like this image, the lines of the cage are great.  The contrast of the fire and the blackened iron/steel looks nice too.  Lighting looks okay, focus looks good but could probably be somewhat sharper.  I wish it had been rotated 90 degrees too.  When I tilt my head I can see the flame almost as a figure that''s trapped behind cage bars and that notion makes the image even more interesting to me.  Just a thought though!  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 18:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744097, 379549, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice movement in the flame.  Good color.  Lighting is nice too.  I wish the focus were a bit sharper but I do like how the flame originator (the tiki) is more muted so the attention can center on the flame without distraction.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Nice movement in the flame.  Good color.  Lighting is nice too.  I wish the focus were a bit sharper but I do like how the flame originator (the tiki) is more muted so the attention can center on the flame without distraction.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744108, 379844, 11923, '<td valign="top">This has an interesting though creepy feeling for me.  I like the intensity of the red and the way it contrasts with the blue iris.  The flame in the eye is an interesting touch too.  It looks like the whites of the eye have been way overprocessed though, very unnatural and the area around the eye seems oversmoothed (this may not be the case but it looks that way to me!).   I like that you went in a more untraditional bent than some of the other entries, even if it isn''t as appealing to me personally.  I gave a 5</td>', 'This has an interesting though creepy feeling for me.  I like the intensity of the red and the way it contrasts with the blue iris.  The flame in the eye is an interesting touch too.  It looks like the whites of the eye have been way overprocessed though, very unnatural and the area around the eye seems oversmoothed (this may not be the case but it looks that way to me!).   I like that you went in a more untraditional bent than some of the other entries, even if it isn''t as appealing to me personally.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 18:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744114, 380037, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture that has a lot going for it.  Very much an emotive feel as it evokes thoughts of past BBQs with the family.  The setup on the BBQ is great and the composition of the rest of the image looks perfect.  The thing that caused me to rate this at an average 5 was the lighting and focus.  The focus looks like it might be pretty good in some areas, but with the very low light, its hard to see the definition in the many subjects available for the eye to investigate.  I don''t know if using the "bright" option in the bright/contrast of whatever post processing program you have would have helped or created other issues, but the low light definitely mutes the colors and focus of this.  Had it been brighter (sunnier too maybe?) I could easily see it as a good stock photo too.  As is, I did give a 5</td>', 'This is a nice picture that has a lot going for it.  Very much an emotive feel as it evokes thoughts of past BBQs with the family.  The setup on the BBQ is great and the composition of the rest of the image looks perfect.  The thing that caused me to rate this at an average 5 was the lighting and focus.  The focus looks like it might be pretty good in some areas, but with the very low light, its hard to see the definition in the many subjects available for the eye to investigate.  I don''t know if using the "bright" option in the bright/contrast of whatever post processing program you have would have helped or created other issues, but the low light definitely mutes the colors and focus of this.  Had it been brighter (sunnier too maybe?) I could easily see it as a good stock photo too.  As is, I did give a 5', '2006-08-20 18:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744124, 379602, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the way the flames are reflected/refracted in the glass goblet.  There''s nice colors shown and the lighting looks good.  The focus looks okay though I wish it were a bit sharper.  Simple in composition but has a number of areas of interest available.  I gave a 5 since it has a lot of potentially interesting things to investigate but it doesn''t keep my attention long, not sure what''s missing that would keep my attention invested more though.</td>', 'I love the way the flames are reflected/refracted in the glass goblet.  There''s nice colors shown and the lighting looks good.  The focus looks okay though I wish it were a bit sharper.  Simple in composition but has a number of areas of interest available.  I gave a 5 since it has a lot of potentially interesting things to investigate but it doesn''t keep my attention long, not sure what''s missing that would keep my attention invested more though.', '2006-08-20 19:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744129, 380043, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  The various colors are nice as are the shapes the fireworks are making.  Composition is okay, the focus seems somewhat soft though in some areas.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  The various colors are nice as are the shapes the fireworks are making.  Composition is okay, the focus seems somewhat soft though in some areas.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 19:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744132, 379731, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition for the most part but it looks too contrasty for me.  Not sure if this is a grunge attempt or not but the effect that the extra darkening adds doesn''t seem to enhance the photo in a positive way for me.  Perhaps its the subject matter, not sure, just seems like an extra tacked on with no real purpose (I''m sure there is one but the need didn''t come across to me as a viewer).  I gave a 5</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition for the most part but it looks too contrasty for me.  Not sure if this is a grunge attempt or not but the effect that the extra darkening adds doesn''t seem to enhance the photo in a positive way for me.  Perhaps its the subject matter, not sure, just seems like an extra tacked on with no real purpose (I''m sure there is one but the need didn''t come across to me as a viewer).  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 19:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744138, 379930, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image.  I like the subject choices and the coloring.  There are nice crystalline tones to it and the focus looks good for the most part, though a bit soft in some areas.  I''m not sure about the composition.  The two items are pretty straightforward in their presentation so I''m not sure if a different composition would add more drama and thus more interest to the image or not.  Seems a bit static and flat in the placing as is though.  I gave a 5</td>', 'This is a nice image.  I like the subject choices and the coloring.  There are nice crystalline tones to it and the focus looks good for the most part, though a bit soft in some areas.  I''m not sure about the composition.  The two items are pretty straightforward in their presentation so I''m not sure if a different composition would add more drama and thus more interest to the image or not.  Seems a bit static and flat in the placing as is though.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 19:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744143, 378074, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the movement, curves and shapes the flame is making.  Definitely meets the challenge and has some nice orange tones.  I do wish the flame was sharper though, better focused (not just by adding sharpening) so the lines and edges were more defined in their shape.  I gave a 5</td>', 'I like the movement, curves and shapes the flame is making.  Definitely meets the challenge and has some nice orange tones.  I do wish the flame was sharper though, better focused (not just by adding sharpening) so the lines and edges were more defined in their shape.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 19:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744147, 379435, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like this composition for the most part.  Love the way the fire drapes and flows.  The different nodules (are those matchsticks?) add a nice bit of uniformity to the image that also helps highlight the more organic feel of the fire.  I do not like the background.  It distracts me from the main subject with all its crinkle and creasing.  I don''t mind the color, though maybe a cooler color of blue or green might have added a better contrast and might not have distracted as much.  Not sure.  I gave a 5</td>', 'I like this composition for the most part.  Love the way the fire drapes and flows.  The different nodules (are those matchsticks?) add a nice bit of uniformity to the image that also helps highlight the more organic feel of the fire.  I do not like the background.  It distracts me from the main subject with all its crinkle and creasing.  I don''t mind the color, though maybe a cooler color of blue or green might have added a better contrast and might not have distracted as much.  Not sure.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 19:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744152, 379588, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like this image, the simple flame and the highlight on the translucence of the creamer/gravyboat cup thingie is great.  I like the color chosen for the background too.  I''m not sure what''s missing though that''d really make the image pop for me.  More light?  Not sure if that''d effect the flame and the glow of the background.  The focus seems okay, but perhaps if it were a bit sharper (initially not from sharpening since there seems to be some compression artifacting around the glass possibly from sharpening) that might help it pop more.   I guess I''m really looking for it to be defined from the background more.  Great idea though, glad I saw this one.  I gave it a 5</td>', 'I like this image, the simple flame and the highlight on the translucence of the creamer/gravyboat cup thingie is great.  I like the color chosen for the background too.  I''m not sure what''s missing though that''d really make the image pop for me.  More light?  Not sure if that''d effect the flame and the glow of the background.  The focus seems okay, but perhaps if it were a bit sharper (initially not from sharpening since there seems to be some compression artifacting around the glass possibly from sharpening) that might help it pop more.   I guess I''m really looking for it to be defined from the background more.  Great idea though, glad I saw this one.  I gave it a 5', '2006-08-20 19:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744159, 379575, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, at first I couldn''t tell what the heck you were referring to in your title but I see him now.  Nice catch.  The flames are very nice, great movement and shape.  The lighting looks good and the focus is good though I wish it were even sharper.  There''s complexity in the flames but simplicity in the composition.  I like it but it doesn''t reach out and grab me or give me that instant "wow" feeling.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Heh, at first I couldn''t tell what the heck you were referring to in your title but I see him now.  Nice catch.  The flames are very nice, great movement and shape.  The lighting looks good and the focus is good though I wish it were even sharper.  There''s complexity in the flames but simplicity in the composition.  I like it but it doesn''t reach out and grab me or give me that instant "wow" feeling.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 19:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744164, 380050, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I think the lighting here is perfect.  I like the composition for the most part, but I think the ashtray should be moved a smidge so its more square in the shot.  The focus seems soft on what appears to be the main subject of the burning cigarette and with a shot like this the focus should be perfect.  I think the classical colors all work together well here and I like the placement the box of cigarettes, in fact I wish it were more centered so it appeared to be growning out of the corner.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Nice image.  I think the lighting here is perfect.  I like the composition for the most part, but I think the ashtray should be moved a smidge so its more square in the shot.  The focus seems soft on what appears to be the main subject of the burning cigarette and with a shot like this the focus should be perfect.  I think the classical colors all work together well here and I like the placement the box of cigarettes, in fact I wish it were more centered so it appeared to be growning out of the corner.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-20 19:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744165, 380022, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I like the colors and the play between the ice and fire.  The lighting looks good and the focus is right there.  Very nicely envisioned and captured.  Bumping to a 6</td>', 'Great image.  I like the colors and the play between the ice and fire.  The lighting looks good and the focus is right there.  Very nicely envisioned and captured.  Bumping to a 6', '2006-08-20 19:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2744170, 379746, 11923, '<td valign="top">This has a nice story to it and there are areas that could be very interesting.  The only problem I see is the lighting and focus.  The light on the table is too harsh IMO.  Also the focus seems soft on the cards, though some of that could be from smoke? More control of the light and a deeper focus might improve this shot.  Also I''m getting a sense of the image having an odd tilt that throws me off.  I gave a 4</td>', 'This has a nice story to it and there are areas that could be very interesting.  The only problem I see is the lighting and focus.  The light on the table is too harsh IMO.  Also the focus seems soft on the cards, though some of that could be from smoke? More control of the light and a deeper focus might improve this shot.  Also I''m getting a sense of the image having an odd tilt that throws me off.  I gave a 4', '2006-08-20 19:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
