(2744875, 379763, 34938, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timfythetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice shot. If this isnt hotpasta then he will be flattered I am sure. If it is then I guess you wont be too flattered with your on mentioning. A shame the flame isnt a bit more crisp but the picture has nice colors and a good overall feel to it. Bumping up. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>well it wasn''t me and I was flattered, but I am sure you didn''t have me in mind. This is a great shot that I am going to put in my favourites because of the title alone...the shot is great and it deserved to do a lot better</td>', 'Originally posted by timfythetoo: Nice shot. If this isnt hotpasta then he will be flattered I am sure. If it is then I guess you wont be too flattered with your on mentioning. A shame the flame isnt a bit more crisp but the picture has nice colors and a good overall feel to it. Bumping up.   well it wasn''t me and I was flattered, but I am sure you didn''t have me in mind. This is a great shot that I am going to put in my favourites because of the title alone...the shot is great and it deserved to do a lot better', '2006-08-21 01:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
