(2745425, 379760, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  The storm was moving only about 5 MPH, so I was able to experiment from 5 to 30 second exposures.  So, it was easy to get some goodies.<br/> <br/>FYI- Unless its water, horizons can be tilted, as this is slight up hill from left at approx. 4700 ft. to right at 4750 ft.  Here in Colorado, we have little flat land.  :)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  The storm was moving only about 5 MPH, so I was able to experiment from 5 to 30 second exposures.  So, it was easy to get some goodies. FYI- Unless its water, horizons can be tilted, as this is slight up hill from left at approx. 4700 ft. to right at 4750 ft.  Here in Colorado, we have little flat land.  :)', '2006-08-21 08:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
