(2745732, 379584, 61244, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see you play up the fact this flame looks like a dress. Just for a creative approach other than - hey I captured some fire. Not sure what other critique I would give than the previous comments about the flatness - your flames appear almost pink</td>', 'I would have loved to see you play up the fact this flame looks like a dress. Just for a creative approach other than - hey I captured some fire. Not sure what other critique I would give than the previous comments about the flatness - your flames appear almost pink', '2006-08-21 10:55:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2745739, 379713, 61244, '<td valign="top">I think that all the comments regarding "I wish there were fire in this one". Be a little more creative people! What is the sun but a giant FIREball. The best way put so far was if it fails - it fails with grace. After seeing the results - I see why the winners won - but I for one think this meets the challenge in an abstract non-cut-and-dry sense.</td>', 'I think that all the comments regarding "I wish there were fire in this one". Be a little more creative people! What is the sun but a giant FIREball. The best way put so far was if it fails - it fails with grace. After seeing the results - I see why the winners won - but I for one think this meets the challenge in an abstract non-cut-and-dry sense.', '2006-08-21 10:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2745743, 380057, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great compositiona and concept which was very well executed.  Well deserved ribbon.  Not surprisingly you got hammered by the prudes...That''s life on DPC!  LOL.</td>', 'Great compositiona and concept which was very well executed.  Well deserved ribbon.  Not surprisingly you got hammered by the prudes...That''s life on DPC!  LOL.', '2006-08-21 11:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2745755, 379858, 35947, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot!  Great job and congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'This is an awesome shot!  Great job and congrats on your ribbon!', '2006-08-21 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2745765, 379447, 61244, '<td valign="top">My biggest issue is not the size of the image as much as the over-active vignette-ing (thats the big black halo in your picture - it almost looks photoshoped in). I do like the concept. the colors are a tad dark and the torch is a bit blown out. I would suggest a longer shutter speed and a lower iso next time. As to your torch being blown out - what you might want to do next time is this: a simple technique called - diffusion - dont quote me on the actual term name so much as the technique.<br/>Here''s what you do - its very technical and challenging so pay close attention here.<br/>Put a plastic bag or some wax paper over your flash.<br/>This spreads out the flash so you still get decent lighting without "burning" (thats the area which is pure white).<br/>Granted there are other solutions but if you want a quick, cheap - diy(do-it-yourself) fix. This will help.</td>', 'My biggest issue is not the size of the image as much as the over-active vignette-ing (thats the big black halo in your picture - it almost looks photoshoped in). I do like the concept. the colors are a tad dark and the torch is a bit blown out. I would suggest a longer shutter speed and a lower iso next time. As to your torch being blown out - what you might want to do next time is this: a simple technique called - diffusion - dont quote me on the actual term name so much as the technique.Here''s what you do - its very technical and challenging so pay close attention here.Put a plastic bag or some wax paper over your flash.This spreads out the flash so you still get decent lighting without "burning" (thats the area which is pure white).Granted there are other solutions but if you want a quick, cheap - diy(do-it-yourself) fix. This will help.', '2006-08-21 11:26:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2745790, 379908, 28710, '<td valign="top">Wicked stuff dude! I can almost smell this one.</td>', 'Wicked stuff dude! I can almost smell this one.', '2006-08-21 11:38:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2745799, 378066, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is really good. On my screen, I like this a lot better when the darkness is turned down a bit to really highlight those eyes and teeth... the graffiti is somewhat superfluous and could stand to be a fair bit lower in lightness.<br/> <br/>This picture looks amazing like that, the flow is improved greatly IMHO.<br/> <br/>I''d rather be looking at the way the fire complements the creepy faces than just the rather nondescript character of the fire itself.</td>', 'This is really good. On my screen, I like this a lot better when the darkness is turned down a bit to really highlight those eyes and teeth... the graffiti is somewhat superfluous and could stand to be a fair bit lower in lightness. This picture looks amazing like that, the flow is improved greatly IMHO. I''d rather be looking at the way the fire complements the creepy faces than just the rather nondescript character of the fire itself.', '2006-08-21 11:41:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2745809, 378685, 28710, '<td valign="top">very nice technique. Way to get technical with the slot shutter!</td>', 'very nice technique. Way to get technical with the slot shutter!', '2006-08-21 11:44:30.000000', NULL, 0),
