(2746576, 380056, 62099, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who looked at this photo and saw what I saw.  We happened to be camping when this fire broke out and were able to go to a look-out point to view it.  After we got home we found out that four of the  firefighters fighting this 5 acre fire were killed in a helicopter crash. It is devastating to watch a fire like this burn but even more devastating to find out that people were killed while fighting it!<br/> <br/>P.S.  It was caused by a dry lightening strike...</td>', 'Thanks to all who looked at this photo and saw what I saw.  We happened to be camping when this fire broke out and were able to go to a look-out point to view it.  After we got home we found out that four of the  firefighters fighting this 5 acre fire were killed in a helicopter crash. It is devastating to watch a fire like this burn but even more devastating to find out that people were killed while fighting it! P.S.  It was caused by a dry lightening strike...', '2006-08-21 17:44:42.000000', NULL, 0),
