(2747053, 380057, 25787, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot.  Great on so many technical levels.  What I like best though is the way it fits the challenge.  You can feel the heat from the background, and the added heat from those legs.  The contrasting cool fireman gives the photo balance.  I appreciate all the effort you put into this.  Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Stunning shot.  Great on so many technical levels.  What I like best though is the way it fits the challenge.  You can feel the heat from the background, and the added heat from those legs.  The contrasting cool fireman gives the photo balance.  I appreciate all the effort you put into this.  Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon.', '2006-08-21 21:34:38.000000', NULL, 0),
