(2748353, 380057, 62187, '<td valign="top">In light of my recent ''out-burst'' about this photo, and my thoughts still remain, I must also add this:<br/> <br/>I''ve always thought of photography as a form of art. To me, art should evoke emotion in a viewer. This photo has certainly, without a doubt, done that to me. So, in that sense, it''s a 10. Congrats on the ribbon...</td>', 'In light of my recent ''out-burst'' about this photo, and my thoughts still remain, I must also add this: I''ve always thought of photography as a form of art. To me, art should evoke emotion in a viewer. This photo has certainly, without a doubt, done that to me. So, in that sense, it''s a 10. Congrats on the ribbon...', '2006-08-22 09:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
