(3650622, 379795, 67152, '<td valign="top">I quite like the angle on this - very cool (excuse me, hot) image!  The colors are really warm and the fire is well captured.  I see from your comment box above about the focus part.  I have no trouble with the vast majority of the image, but I feel that you may be able to pull out just a little more sharpness pulled out of the image in post processing on the face (it''s there it just needs a little UnSharpMask as a second layer - allowed in Advanced editing - to show it).<br/> <br/>Chris - our family can''t wait to get out to Hawaii next month!</td>', 'I quite like the angle on this - very cool (excuse me, hot) image!  The colors are really warm and the fire is well captured.  I see from your comment box above about the focus part.  I have no trouble with the vast majority of the image, but I feel that you may be able to pull out just a little more sharpness pulled out of the image in post processing on the face (it''s there it just needs a little UnSharpMask as a second layer - allowed in Advanced editing - to show it). Chris - our family can''t wait to get out to Hawaii next month!', '2007-05-15 07:20:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3662834, 379858, 47541, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nuzzer:</b></div><hr/><i> Like theSaj, and others no doubt, I''m curious as to the setup on this.  Can you please explain how you got this shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I guess the time has long gone that you would be describing your setup so I''ll remove this from my favs.  There seems to be very little chance of learning from it without more detailed notes :(</td>', 'Originally posted by Nuzzer: Like theSaj, and others no doubt, I''m curious as to the setup on this.  Can you please explain how you got this shot.   I guess the time has long gone that you would be describing your setup so I''ll remove this from my favs.  There seems to be very little chance of learning from it without more detailed notes :(', '2007-05-18 09:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
